    {
        "review": "Bought for my 17 year old son to link to his android phone. Since they've arrived they have been permanently attached to his ears. He had them up and running minutes after opening so I would say they are customer friendly and comfortable based on the amount of use. Sound quality must be good as he can never hear us when we call. He also uses it for calls, either that or he's developed the habit of talking to himself. No complaints from him so guessing it's a good product with an extremely reasonable price tag."
