[
    {
        "review": "These came mostly charged (93%) and ready to go. There were no issues pairing the device, instructions provided were easy to understand, but if you're older have a magnifier handy, they were impossible for me to read.  The case itself is a good enough size to handle easily, but it is extremely smooth and I had a little difficulty opening it.  There is a small indent right above the window displaying the charge, you won't feel it, but gently scrape a fingernail and you'll find it.  The buds pop right into their spaces, but they are a little difficult to get out of the case.  I kept feeling like I'm going to break them, but they will pop out with a little persuasion.  They are a little heavier than the average pod, but it's nothing out of the ordinary given the design.They are controlled by 3 buttons (per bud), but two of them are for volume control only.  The third button controls on/off and answering / hanging up on calls.  Volume adjusts very easily.  They are definitely responsive!  For in-the-ear buds, they are actually very comfortable, and the over-the-ear design really helps.  Traditional stick buds never stay in my ears, but these go nowhere.  There is no bass / treble control, but they do have a nice, clear sound.  For general purposes, these appear to be a great deal.  For audiophiles, you might find the sound a little tinny depending on your music selection (instrumentals without a lot of bass), but it's in no way annoying.All in all, these seem to be a really good product - and that's from an audiophile!  Would definitely recommend!"
    },
    {
        "review": "The earbuds are light and comfortable and fit over the ears nicely. You don’t need  worry about them falling off. I have even slept in them."
    },
    {
        "review": "These earbuds are a great choice for a dedicated purse pair, especially with their fantastic purple color that makes them easy to spot. Beyond their eye-catching hue, they're packed with features perfect for my active lifestyle. The flexible ear hooks and multiple silicone tips ensure a secure and comfortable fit, whether I'm at the gym or on the go, and the waterproof rating means I won't have to worry about sweating or unexpected rain. I love the powerful bass, crisp highs, balanced mids, along with 15 hours of playtime per charge (80 hours total with the case) so I'm rarely without music. The buttons and instant pairing via switch technology add to their convenience, making them a reliable and stylish accessory for any busy day."
    },
    {
        "review": "I also love the over-ear hooks, which keep the earbuds secure during running and intense workouts. They’re very comfortable and stay in place the whole time. The IPX7 waterproof rating gives me peace of mind when I’m sweating or running in light rain."
    },
    {
        "review": "Bought this for my son with Autism. Best earbuds he's ever used! Comfortable and sensory friendly. Very high quality for the price! Clear sound and easy to use"
    },
    {
        "review": "Absolutely love these! Fit my ear nicely and the charge last a long time.Really good quality sound and cancel outside sound really well, and they come in my favorite colour!"
    },
