        "review": "The wireless earbuds Bluetooth headphones are really efficient. I purchased them for my mum and she is very pleased with the headphones quality and performance. She enjoys wearing them during her daily walks and they are suitable for exercise as well as around the house. The headphones are comfortable to wear and have good noise cancellation. They also have good battery life and are a good size."
    },
    {
        "review": "Excellent ! Have them for 4 weeks now and use them daily. Incredible battery life and great comfort, also while running (away from your problems). Also excellent noise cancellation, which sadly does not silence my inner monologue. Also the announcement ‘left ear’, ‘right ear’ might be helpful if you start your day with the basics again."
    },
    {
        "review": "I’ve been using this product for a few months now and it has been very impressed with the quality, cost and how good the sound quality is. The design is great as it stops the product from falling off your ear.I would highly recommend this product."
    },
    {
        "review": "I bought these headphones for my mum because her previous earbuds kept falling out while she was doing housework. These stay securely in place thanks to the ear hooks and are much more comfortable to wear. The sound quality is great, they’re easy to use, and they’ve been working perfectly. We’re both very happy with this purchase and would definitely recommend them!"
    }
]

