        "review": "Best earbuds I've owned so far. For the price and performance, these are the best pair of earbuds I have purchased. They stay securely in place and remain comfortable even during extended wear. The acoustics are quite good, and the bass is both sharp and plenty loud. While they may not be the most comfortable pair I've ever worn, they require no adjustments during long listening sessions and while being active. 5-Stars."
