        "review": "Excellent ! Have them for 4 weeks now and use them daily. Incredible battery life and great comfort, also while running (away from your problems). Also excellent noise cancellation, which sadly does not silence my inner monologue. Also the announcement ‘left ear’, ‘right ear’ might be helpful if you start your day with the basics again."
    },
