    {
        "review": "I bought these headphones for my mum because her previous earbuds kept falling out while she was doing housework. These stay securely in place thanks to the ear hooks and are much more comfortable to wear. The sound quality is great, they’re easy to use, and they’ve been working perfectly. We’re both very happy with this purchase and would definitely recommend them!"
    }
