        "review": "I’ve been using these TOZO earbuds for a while now and they’ve held up well. The charging case is compact and sturdy, easy to toss in a pocket or bag. Pairing was quick and the connection has stayed reliable.Sound quality is impressive for the price  decent bass without being muddy, and clear mids/highs. Battery life on both the buds and case has been solid for daily use.The fit is comfortable for extended wear, and the case has a satisfying magnetic snap when closing. Overall, a great budget-friendly option that doesn’t feel like you’re sacrificing quality."
