    {
        "review": "I've already been using it for a month, it really surprised me, great sensitivity, detail I thought it was very light but very professional, I've heard it was heavy but in reality I didn't think so, it fits perfectly in my hand, I don't get tired using it, my aim in FPS games was 10x BETTER without a doubt one of the best achievements I have for my Setup, I've always had a dream of owning a RAZER mouse today I achieved that goal, I remember the time Silvio Santos from CS Jogando said with GORDOX on the mouse I really found it perfect, great value for money, below R$ 180, it's really worth it, you can buy it without fear, it arrived on time for delivery, Note 9, I'm going to produce a review on my profile or Channel Studio Infinity Hype, see there."
