        "review": "I purchased this to simultaneously connect a mouse, keyboard, USB memory, etc. to a laptop that only has USB-C. The 4 ports are lined up horizontally, so it's easy to see what's connected where, and it's easy to organize the wiring on your desk. Because it is thin and light, it is also suitable for carrying along with a computer. This product is not a multi-functional dock for video output or charging the laptop itself, but rather a hub for increasing the number of USB peripherals. If it suits your purpose, there are no unnecessary functions and it is easy to use."
