    {
        "review": "I am giving this USB C hub 4 stars because it is a well designed accessory that makes it much easier to connect multiple USB C devices without taking up much space. The compact size fits easily into a laptop bag, making it convenient for travel, work, or keeping at a desk.The four USB C ports are very useful for connecting accessories like external drives, webcams, audio devices, and other peripherals. File transfers have been fast and reliable, and I appreciate that each port supports high speed data transfer. The 100W pass through charging is another great feature because I can keep my laptop powered while still using the other ports without constantly swapping cables.I also like that it works with a variety of devices, including laptops, tablets, and desktops that support USB C. The build quality feels solid, and everything connects securely without feeling loose.The reason I am giving it 4 stars instead of 5 is that it is important to know this hub is focused on USB C connectivity only. If you also need USB A, HDMI, or SD card slots, you will likely need an additional adapter. Depending on your setup, that may limit its versatility.Overall, this is a dependable and portable USB C hub that delivers fast performance and convenient charging. If your devices primarily use USB C, it is an excellent solution for expanding connectivity while keeping your workspace simple and organized."
