        "review": "Outstanding USB-C hub! The 6-in-1 design is very practical with Gigabit Ethernet, 4K HDMI, and 100W PD charging all in one compact device. Works flawlessly with my MacBook. Ethernet is fast and stable. No overheating. Premium quality from UGREEN as always."
