    {
        "review": "I use it daily with both the MacBook Pro and the iPad Pro and it works perfectly on both, without drivers or configurations: it connects and is recognized immediately. The HDMI output brings the external monitor to 4K without flickering or signal drops, and on the iPad it is very convenient for connecting it to the television or a projector. The USB-A ports transfer files from SSDs and thumb drives at full speed, and the card reader is very useful for downloading photos from the camera directly to the iPad. Pass-through charging works well: the MacBook charges normally while all peripherals remain connected, so just one cable is enough to have the complete workstation. The Ethernet port is also stable, useful when Wi-Fi is acting up. Very solid aluminum construction, it heats up slightly under load but nothing to worry about. The cable is short but just the right length to stay tidy next to the laptop. Compact, it fits in your bag without weighing you down. Recommended without reservations."
