    {
        "review": "Unlike other reviews I didn't have to put credit card info in and was pretty quick to sink with my phone. Been using it a few days love how I can customize the face even to personal photos. Big screen amd easy to read. Very happy with watch so far and im very picky with watches I hate most of them after a day but very happy with this one."
