        "review": "Beyond disappointed.  Amazon description of watch says Alexa built in. Not true.Watch instructions say nothing about connecting to Alexa.  Instructions say to download Da Fit app which doesnt have an Alexa synching component.  Amazon AI says to download the Trausi app to link with Alexa.  This app is trash.  Popup ads that look like they're part of the setup - to repeatedly take your contact info.  And worst of all, a step that says you need to supply a credit card number to proceed.  'But dont worry, they wont charge anything right now.'  Seriously?!?!  What a scam.I submitted a vendor inquiry to ask how to setup Alexa.  They closed my inquiry without responding.  Why would you do this unless there is no way to setup Alexa?This is getting returned ASAP.  False, misleading advertising and huge fraud potential.  Buyer beware!!"
