        "review": "The price of this type of watch for what you get is unbeatable. It doesn't feel cheap, and it's got tons of perks that it checks for. The app seems to be well designed, not chaotic. It receives my phone's messages, it keeps a good connection. The only issue I have with this, why it's not a 5 star, is because the main reason I got this is to track steps. I have other watches and I can see the counters going up on others when I'm working out hard, while this one is just sitting there, asking if I'm going to do anything. I'll live with it, but I have to know that data is skewed. Beautiful screen and good faces."
