        "review": "I love this phone case! It matches my phone color so well. I have multiple kids so the protection has been really great for me! The magnet in the case has been good and strong. I’ve had problems with them in the past with other cases but not this one! The back of the case is hazy which I like a lot. And it has a Matte feel to it. I highly recommend this case! You get a great case for a really decent price!"
