        "review": "I purchased the B-A Purple (D-Purple) color variant for my iPhone 14 Pro, and it fits like a glove. The clear body with the lilac/purple MagSafe ring looks absolutely stunning against the Space Gray finish — it's elegant without being flashy, perfectly complementing the steel body aesthetic.What I love:• The clear edges and body stay true to the phone's original beauty• The lilac MagSafe ring adds a gorgeous subtle pop of color• Slim and lightweight — you barely notice it's on• Includes a 9H tempered glass screen protector — great bonus at this price• MagSafe works perfectly — snaps on chargers and accessories with confidenceOn yellowing issue: Every clear case yellows eventually — I've paid premium prices for Speck and Incase clear cases that promise no yellowing, and they all yellow at the edges too. At ~$6, this case offers the same real-world performance at a fraction of the price.FYI for iPhone 15 Pro users: Size-wise it fits the my iPhone 15 Pro, but it covers the camera control button, which is why I got it exclusively for my iPhone 14 pro ....... so keep that in mind.Bottom line: For the price, this is exceptional. Don't overthink it. It is easy to install, gives great protection and feels durable and tactile!"
