    {
        "review": "Was going to give 3 stars for the other bad reviews and after noticing the top portion of my front case is warped a bit. However, I absolutely love this case! Aside from the warppage lol it is a very excellent material for comfort and slip resistance. The case is perfect for those who are looking for a little bit of additional protection yet don't mind not having many bells and whistles. Personally I just needed something to put my Strap onto. I use a permade strap with 3M on the back I got from here for my Fold 4. I used the same strap on my 6 and now 8. These can be purchased as a pack of 5 or 7 or so. They come in various colors also, white, green, blue, Grey, black, etc. I threw the Grey onto my case and it is all I can ask for! Still see the phones color bright as day and it does a good job at not blocking this out or being too thick. It allows for the display to be mostly open and not intervened with when typing or texting which is great. It also keeps the phone protected well and i would trust this case over many I have had in the past.I used to just leave the front open and for most 2 part cases this is what I do. This one is slim thankfully and it does an awesome job as well at distinguishing the volume buttons from the power button as they are extruding a decent bit now and a large improvement over stock imo! Is this case perfect or the best?!Not even close, but is it more than enough for some like me and a good fit for the 8? Yes, especially if manufactured correctly!"
