e you're ever going to get your hands on but it also is less than a Happy meal at McDonald's and under normal circumstances in normal day to day use and abuse I believe it will handle just about anything you throw at it in a normal day. And that brings me to the screen protector that also comes with it at that super low price point it's such a nice little screen protector then it was actually easy to install I've installed about 20 screen protectors now and every time they're hard to get the bubbles out different things like that I've literally had them crack in my hand while I was try to squeeze the bubbles out but this thing just went on perfectly the first time and so far I'm I'm perfectly happy with it.If you're looking for a sleek minimalistic case to cover your phone and give you a little bit of protection so you can rest a little easier that is not going to hurt your pocket that is bag safe and will work with all bagsafe items and wireless charging magsafe stands all kinds of stuff look no further because this little bugger was a great buy"
