        "review": "Good tight fit compatible with last gen, not bulkier than previous cheap clear TPU case but feels more precisely molded to fit the phone and the corners definitely have more cushioning despite not taking up any more space in hand. I used to have this cheapo sticker ring of flat magnets but the magnet embedded in this case is noticeably way stronger and doesn't take up any extra thickness in the hard back of the case which is super nice.Overall great case for a great price, and the magnet is definitely strong enough for any kind of compatible mount or accessory (just remember you won't magically get wireless charging in a phone that doesn't support it already). Can't comment on the included screen protector since I already had one on, but that alone can save you another $5-10 assuming you have the confidence to get it right first try haha (protip: try using stickers as a hinge), but most of.the time I do only need one and end up with the other two from an ~$8 three-pack just collecting dust, so I can see this being a good deal."
