[
    {
        "review": "Been using this phone case since I first got my new iPhone 17 Pro Max and its PERFECT. Strong magnetic hold I've been using for both magsafe charging and the magsafe popsocket and have had 0 issues. Super sturdy case that feels high quality, smooth, and looks fantastic. Love that it covers the raised part with the camera and flashlight as well, makes it feel even more protected and is more scratch resistant. Incredible case"
    },
    {
        "review": "FINALLY!!!!  This is truly hands down, the best screen protector I have ever purchased. It’s amazingly easy to install. I put the green frame on top of my phone and then laid the screen protector into the frame, and it immediately centered everything and that was all I had to do. I am so happy with this. I think that it will really protect my phone from scratches. As for the pretty lavender case, it is so pretty! It fits perfectly, and has a very velvety feel to it. I’m very glad I got this case!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Loved the idea of a silicone protective case for my iPhone 14.  What I didn’t realize, because silicone has a “sticky” “tacky” nature, was how every little bit of ANYTHING would stick to it!  Plus, it was next to impossible to rub or dust it off!  Being very dark purple  -  every spec of anything showed up!!  I read what others had to say about treating the case to try to get rid of the “tacky”ness.  I knew when the hand sanitizer didn’t work  -  I would NOT BE HAPPY with it !!  Soooooo . . . .  I put my noodle to work and rather than trying to change the innert characteristics of the silicone, I tried to think of something that would not take away from its characteristics  -  but add to them.Apply a very visible coat of Horseman’s One Step  -  Yes  -  a saddle/ leather conditioner!  to all outside surfaces.  Apply enough so you have a whitish layer on it  -  like you want enough on it to look like it would soak in.  I hung mine on a pencil (through the camera hole) and let it “soak” overnight.  The next morning, take a lint free cloth or paper towel and rub the coating off until you don’t see any “oily streaks “.  I now can lay it down or put it anywhere - and nothing sticks!  PERFECT!!  It will have a slick feeling to it, but not be oily.I’ve only had this a few days, so I don’t know if or how often I may have to reapply??  Also, I’ve never had any greasiness problem with leather in the heat of the summer, but silicone doesn’t really” absorb” the conditioner.  At best it probably fills in the micro pours of the silicone.  I understand silicone repels basically everything.  So I was very surprised that this seems to work!I have ordered some silicone glue.  Hopefully I will be able to attach a “phone ring” to the back of the case.  The sticky tape that the phone ring comes on  -  won’t stick at all.  I read that only silicone glue will work on a silicone surface.  I guess due to its oily feeling make up.I did NOT use the leather conditioner on the inside of the case.  The case fits very well on my phone and I didn’t want to take a chance of messing that up.  I hope you give this a try and it works as well for you as it has for me.  :)"
    },
    {
        "review": "Seems nicely made, I like the color and styling. I just got it today, so I can;t speak to durability.Shoppers should be aware that this case does NOT include a screen protector. The features mention \"screen protection\", which refers to a raised lip on the case around the edge of the screen. This confused me, so I want to point it out to others."
    },
    {
        "review": "I previously owned an original Apple case, but it fell apart within six months and never felt very comfortable in my hand. So far, I’m very happy with this case. It feels good to hold, seems well-built, and I believe it will last much longer than the original Apple case.Another big improvement is the protection around the camera-control button. With my Apple case, my car’s phone holder would constantly press the side button and accidentally open the camera. This case has a raised guard that prevents the holder from pressing it. Overall, this is a much better-designed case, and I’m very satisfied with it."
    },
    {
        "review": "I’ve been using this Miracase for a week and I’m impressed. The soft-touch silicone feels really premium and doesn’t attract fingerprints. It has a secure grip so I’m not worried about dropping my phone.MagSafe works perfectly. It snaps right onto my charger and wallet with no issues. The camera cutout is nicely raised so the lenses are protected when I put the phone down.The navy color is deep and looks way more expensive than it is. Button placement and ports all line up exactly. It adds minimal bulk but still feels protective.Great case for the price. Would buy again."
    },
    {
        "review": "I would give this about 3.5 stars but don't have option for a half star.  The case is very soft inside which is nice, the outside material is a very slick silicone style material and collects dust and debris, the phone can be dropped easily.  The material is such that it does provide shock absorption.  There is no included lens covers but the case itself has a raised rubber square around camera area, this will not keep anything from actually damaging the camera glass so I recommend if you use this you by the individual round covers that go over the stock camera lenses to absorb any impact so you don't need a major repair.  Price is too high for what this is made from.  Also the magnets as advertised a substantially stronger then normal magsafe phone cases, so if you use magsafe docks while driving the phone should not pop free, my old phone case never did even at normal strength and I'm actually concerned its going to tear dock from my air-vent as the magnets are that strong.  Thickness is perfect doesn't add to much bulk while protecting phone.  Easy to install and not bulky like some protective cases.  Update:  This also doesn't work with my native Apple Wireless Charger which is a bummer."
    },
    {
        "review": "I’ve tried three other iPhone 17 Pro Max cases over the past year, including a couple that cost nearly three times as much, and this is easily the best one.The buttons protrude just a little more than the others, which makes them much easier to find and press without looking. The silicone has a smooth feel, but it’s not slippery, so it stays secure in my hand and shirt pocket. It also slips on and off the phone easily without feeling loose, and the fit is excellent. The camera and phone are well protected, and the MagSafe connection works great.For the price, I honestly don’t think this case can be beat. Highly recommended."
    },
    {
        "review": "The rubber-like surface is non-slip and fits comfortably in your hand."
    },
    {
        "review": "Excellent service, very quick delivery. Very pleased with this item."
    },
    {
        "review": "After initial concerns, I bought this case. I have to say it's a little thicker at the corners and exactly the same color as my iPhone. No faded green. However, I also have to mention one disadvantage. Unfortunately, the protection of the camera is a bit more expensive so that my VW no longer recognizes it in wireless charging. I only use the phone moderately so I don't need to charge it on the way to work, but that could be a problem for a representative."
    }
]

[
    {
        "review": "I’m very happy with the ESR iPhone 14 Pro Case. It has a clean design, feels durable, and provides good protection while keeping the phone slim. I like that it supports MagSafe, making it easy to use with my MagSafe accessories and chargers.The clear black design also looks great because it lets the original iPhone design show while still adding protection. The case feels sturdy without adding too much bulk.Pros:Slim and lightweight designGood protection for everyday useMagSafe compatibility works wellClear design looks greatDurable build qualityComfortable gripCons:No major issues so farOverall, this is a great iPhone case for anyone looking for a balance between protection and a slim design. It feels high quality, works well with MagSafe accessories, and keeps my phone protected without making it bulky."
    },
    {
        "review": "I’m a happy camper when it comes to this case.I had my old one for two years before the plastic started to fall apart.Initially, I got a different case for five dollars that even came with a screen protector and I thought to myself this is such a great deal, when I tried it the magnetic component of the case failed miserably so I returned it and got this case again for about $13 which is the same price I paid for this case two years ago.You get what you pay for. This is a great case that served me for two years and the magnetic component of it is very strong.In the pictures you can see the two years old case next to the brand new one."
    },
    {
        "review": "If you’re tired of cases that claim to be \"tough\" but feel like cheap plastic, or \"rugged\" cases that make your phone too big to fit in a pocket, the ESR Military-Grade Shockproof Case is the upgrade you’ve been looking for. I’ve tested a lot of MagSafe cases, and this one feels like it was engineered, not just manufactured.Protection That Isn’t Just MarketingThe first thing you notice is the Air-Guard corners. They aren’t just decorative; they create a visible cushion that actually absorbs impact. I’ve already had one \"heart-stop\" moment where my phone slid off a high counter onto a tile floor, and it literally bounced. Not a scratch on the phone or the case. The \"Military-Grade\" label actually feels earned here.The MagSafe Connection (HaloLock)ESR’s magnets (they call it HaloLock) are notoriously strong—often stronger than the official Apple cases.• The \"Snap\": When you bring it near a charger or car mount, it grabs hold with a very secure click.• Reliability: I use a heavy MagSafe power bank and a wallet attachment; neither budge even when I’m walking or the car hits a bump. It’s rated for 1,500g of holding force, and you can definitely feel that extra \"tug.\"Design & UtilityDepending on the model you get, many of these come with the Stash Stand around the camera. This is a game-changer:• It protects the lenses when closed.• It’s made of a high-quality zinc alloy that doesn't feel flimsy.• It works in both portrait (for scrolling/FaceTime) and landscape (for videos) without blocking the MagSafe ring.The Build QualityThe back is a hard, scratch-resistant polycarbonate that stays clear much longer than cheap TPU. The sides have a nice matte grip that prevents that \"slippery soap\" feeling. It adds just enough \"heft\" to make the phone feel protected without doubling its thickness.Pros:• Superior Magnets: Best-in-class MagSafe strength.• Corner Protection: Air-Guard tech is legit for drop safety.• Tactile Buttons: They remain clicky and responsive, not mushy.• Raised Edges: Significant lip around the screen and camera for \"table-top\" protection.Cons:• Tight Fit: It’s a very snug fit, so it takes a little effort to get the phone out if you swap cases often (but that’s also why it’s so protective!).Final Verdict: This is the \"Goldilocks\" of cases—it’s tougher than a standard clear case but way sleeker than a traditional bulky rugged case. If you value your phone's trade-in value and use MagSafe accessories daily, this is an absolute no-brainer. 5/5 Stars."
    },
    {
        "review": "Pretty good case overall. Fairly easy to put on, looks nice (the picture is accurate), feels good and smooth in the hand. Seems to have some protective value, as I've dropped the phone a few times and it hasn't cracked. There doesn't seem to be any rubber component like the Otterbox Defender, but I reckon it's doing its job (the pink park is a little softer than the white, but not much). A good purchase."
    },
    {
        "review": "Firstly, I love the feel of this case, it's honestly a case I continue to buy and buy again. Since it perfectly fits my iPhone 15 plus, the installation is easy. This particular model doesn't have a kickstand, but I'm okay with that since I have a MagSafe pop socket. Did I mention MagSafe? I LOVE MagSafe compatible phone cases, it makes accessories easier to use, especially since I don't have to take the case off and on again. My phones fallen a multitude of times, and hasn't had any damage to the body of the phone. In terms of overall protection, screen protection is sound, especially from someone like me who doesn't use a phone screen! My only flaw with this however, is that the case does yellow, as I've mentioned this is the case I continue to \"buy and buy\" over again and again..."
    },
    {
        "review": "Nice, well made, better than original provided by Apple when phone purchased.Quick delivery. easy to install, fits great, great buttons"
    },
    {
        "review": "Amazing quality case at a great price! Super easy to install, and it helps protect the screen and body of the phone very well. Sleek design and it’s been dropped numerous times and always saved the phone! The clear plastic does eventually turn yellow, but that’s only because I rarely clean it/use it all the time, and even then, it takes a long time to show wear. Happy with quality and material!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Good fit, quality product"
    },
    {
        "review": "Conforms to the description and good lifespan"
    },
    {
        "review": "Item arrived on time and was exactly as decribed. Excellent product!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Best phone case I've had so far 🙏"
    }
]

