        "review": "This back up charger/battery works great. Charges your phone somewhat quickly. Can charge my phone twice - 2 full charges. The USB-C cord is retractable, which is very convenient. Keeps it neat and compact. Color was very cute (I got the light blue), so easy to find in bag or drawer amidst sea of black cords and electronics. Has a lanyard so you could hang from a hook for storing. Only negative is the block look is cute, but slightly bulky compared to flat , phone shaped back up batteries that you can put in your pocket. You could put this in a coat pocket or cargo pocket , but it's not flat . Otherwise,  I highly recommend this product and seller."
    },
    {
        "review": "This Anker Nano Power Bank has been excellent. The 10,000mAh capacity gives me plenty of extra battery life, and the 45W charging is impressively fast for something this compact. I’m constantly using my phone throughout the day for calls, pictures, estimates, and other work for my handyman business, so having reliable backup power is important. It’s small enough to carry with me without being a hassle and feels very well made. Anker makes dependable charging products, and this one definitely delivers. Highly recommended."
    },
    {
        "review": "Omg I love this thing.  Ordered one from Anker and it took a few days to get to me.  Loved it so much I ordered two more from Amazon due to shipping speed.I also own the larger version of this with the retractable cable and kept it as my primary battery Bank.The device is small enough to easily fit and comfortably hold in my pocket.  It's super fast charges my phone with its retractable cable which is insanely useful. The digital display on it is perfectly designed.I currently use three devices consistently throughout my entire day that require recharging. This battery bank is insanely useful.The difference between this bank and the others comes down to a few things. Really good brand name as Anker has made some really good products over the years. The retractable usb-c cable is absolutely a game changer. The 10,000 mah battery can charge my phone twice before needing to recharged. It's a small cube and for me I can easily just throw it in my pocket or if somebody was to add a metal clip they could just clip it to their clothes and forget about it. I travel a lot so you have no idea how awesome it is to have a device die and simply just plug it in to the bank and continue walking without having to find a power outlet. If I could suggest anything he would be for the brand to conclude a clip that we can use so I could clip it to my backpack. Well that's it"
    },
    {
        "review": "This power bank left me thoroughly impressed of the overall quality, design, and utility that it had to offer. I got this power bank on prime day and looked promising, and I was right. This powerbank had impeccable power, which charged my devices really quick, and also had a big capacity, which lasted a while until it ran out. This power bank also has a built in cable, which is really useful and reduces clutter, and plus, its retractable which is a really nice feature. It also includes a screen which displays the battery percentage, the battery health, how hot it is, and how much watts pushing out or in. It also has great build quality. I accidentely dropped it a few times, and it held up really well. It’s also really portable with a compact size and is lightweight. It connects with my laptop really well and the color was decent."
    },
