        "review": "Excellent power bank overall. The size, 45 W charging, built-in cable, and portability make it one of my favorite travel batteries to charge my 17 Pro, iPad, and even a MacBook Pro in an emergency. Packs small and light in EDC, backpack and my camera sling.However, after only a few months of normal travel use, the printed regulatory markings have faded significantly. This became an issue during airport security screening in China, where officers needed a flashlight to verify the certification labels (this power bank is compliant with CCC certification which is required in Chinese domestic flights)I hope Anker had laser-etched the markings or protected them under a clear coating, as this is a travel product and made me knock a star on this overall perfect battery."
