        "review": "Does the job"
    },
    {
        "review": "Compact and convenient to keep in your bag, even in the smallest bags such as fanny packs or small purses. Perfect for recharging the new iPhone 17 and iPhone 17 Pro which struggle or don't recharge at all with other power banks. Very fast charging, both of the phone and of the power bank itself. The power bank charge, by recharging only the phone, lasts me about 3 complete recharges, which in days, in reality, is about 1 week because I never discharge the phone to less than 20% and I don't recharge it beyond 80%, to prolong the life of the phone's battery. The integrated USB-C cable is uniquely convenient; I no longer have to carry around cables that I risk losing. In this model there is a strap to hang the power bank (for example, I hang it on the belt loop when I need my hands free) and the charging cable is not used as a hook, which instead retracts completely when not needed. In my opinion, it is better not to stress the charging cables by putting weight on them and this is perfect. The range of colors is beautiful and when it is available I will also buy it again in green. I find the price fair for the quality you buy but it often still goes on sale and therefore I recommend keeping an eye on it and taking advantage of it. Super recommended!"
