[
    {
        "review": "I gave this power bank 5 stars because it has been one of the most useful travel accessories I own. The biggest strength is how slim it is. It does not add a lot of bulk, and even with it attached to my iPhone, I can still fit the phone in my jeans pocket without much trouble. I have even carried it as part of an everyday carry setup because it is that easy to bring along.Perfect for travelThis really shines on long-haul flights, airport layovers, and day trips when finding a working outlet is not guaranteed. It has saved me more than once when I needed extra battery to get through a long travel day. It is also great for trips where you are constantly on the move and do not want to worry about your phone dying halfway through the day.Strong magnetic holdThe magnetic attachment is strong and secure. It stays in place well and does not slip around, which makes it much more practical to use while walking around or traveling.PerformanceIt charges my phone quickly and gives me enough extra battery to keep going when I really need it. That alone makes it worth carrying. This is one of those products that really comes through at the right time, especially during travel.One minor drawbackThe only downside I have noticed is that the power bank itself takes a while to recharge through the USB-C port. For me, that is not a deal breaker because the portability and convenience more than make up for it.Bottom lineFor the size, portability, and convenience, this is a great value. It has been especially useful for flights, airport layovers, day trips, and even longer travel situations where reliable backup power matters. If you want a slim battery pack that is easy to carry and actually practical to use every day, this is an easy 5-star product."
