    },
    {
        "review": "I've been searching for a reliable charging solution for my family of four—everyone has multiple devices (phones, tablets, earbuds), and we're constantly fighting over chargers or dealing with dead batteries when heading out. This GOODaaa 3-pack power bank set with the docking station has been an absolute lifesaver!First off, the docking station is brilliant. It charges all three 10000mAh power banks at the same time, so they're always fully topped up and ready to grab on the go. No more forgetting to plug in a single power bank overnight or coming home to a dead one. Just swap them out—it's like having a never-ending supply of portable power.Each power bank is super slim and lightweight (fits easily in a pocket or bag), with built-in USB-C and iOS cables plus an extra USB-C port. That means the whole setup can charge up to 9 devices simultaneously if all banks are in use—perfect for family trips, office use, or even sharing with friends. The charging is safe and reliable, with no overheating issues, thanks to the smart chip protection.The personalized stickers are such a fun bonus! There are 180 high-quality patterns in the kit, and my kids loved decorating their own power banks. It makes it easy to tell them apart and adds a personal touch—we had a great time customizing them together.Everything you need is included: the three power banks, dock, cable, adapter, and manual. No extra purchases required. Build quality feels solid, and knowing there's a 12-month warranty gives peace of mind.If you have a multi-device household or travel often, this complete kit is a must-buy. Highly recommend—it's made our daily routine so much smoother!con: Doesn't show you how much power bank has."
    },
