        "review": "They work, and they echo the price. The charging rate, in my opinion, is sub par for today's devices. Over 2 hours for a full charge on my note 10+. That is less than a normal everyday charger which is usually 1.5 -1.75 hours. Definitely not fast or super fast charging.By the time you get a charge out of it, you'll probably be back to a more efficient charging option."
