[
    {
        "review": "The INIU Ultra Compact Power Bank is a great little charger to keep on hand for everyday use. The slim, lightweight design makes it easy to carry in a purse, backpack, or even a pocket without adding unnecessary bulk.I like that it provides a convenient way to recharge my devices while traveling, at work, or when I’m away from an outlet. The build quality feels solid, and the display/indicators make it easy to know how much power is remaining. It charges reliably and is a great backup option for busy days.Overall, this is a well-designed, portable power bank that delivers the convenience you want without taking up much space. A great value for anyone who needs dependable extra battery power on the go."
    },
    {
        "review": "The 2 best features of this power bank is the large digital readout and the attached USB-C loop combo. I love that I don’t have to hunt for a cord to charge things and can use the same cord to charge the power bank. Most brilliant idea I’ve seen on this type of product. Fast charging, battery life recharges my phone and AirPods several times before needing recharge. Side light is helpful for searching in small spaces for lost items. This is one of my everyday carry items! Love it!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I bought one of these quite a while ago and ran it through its paces. It fits in the cargo pocket of my pants, and honestly even fits into jeans pockets as long as the jeans are not too tight. it keeps a charge for a very long time and can quick charge mt S23 Ultra twice before needing to be recharged. I loved it so much that at this point both my wife and I have 2-3 of these each that we keep various places. Pockets, purses, car cubbies. I have not had a single one of these units go bad, and I have purchased several different models that they sell.This ultra compact model was for my wife's purse, and we end up using it pretty much every time we leave the house.  INIU is pretty much the only brand of power bank I buy at this point."
    },
    {
        "review": "I bought this for a 2-week trip to Scotland. I was trying to downsize everything so I could do carry-on only. This little charger doesn't take up much space at all. It even comes with its own charging cable, which is also the handle/strap! It held a charge very well, and was able to charge my phone pretty fast when I was out on long bus tours. I definitely recommend it!"
    },
