    },
    {
        "review": "I have larger INIU chargers for my phone already, but wanted something a bit lighter to carry and to give my phone enough charge in case I run out of juice during my trip. I ended up buying two, one for me and my wife. I like this charger because you can charge it pretty quickly and it shows ths percentage of charge it has, which is a nice feature so you know just in case. It also comes with 3 ports 2- USB-C and 1-USB A... Its strap doubles as a USB-C connector to you can just attach it to your phone, if you have a newer one with that connection. Also as an added it have a little light too. We both used it on our trip and it charged our phones in between places and even carrying it while hooked because they are pretty light. We both like them for our needs and they were just exactly what we needed and will be carrying them on our next excursion."
    },
    {
        "review": "Reliable; charges my items quickly. I also use it often to power my portable router. This is my third INIU product, and I am impressed. I've been a loyal Anker user. I wish it showed the power-in and power-out status, not just the battery level."
