    {
        "review": "Works well; do not buy if you plan to attach/hang the charger to a backpack like advertised. The cable comes apart way too easily, so unless you wrap it with tape, it is useless and will fall off."
    },
    {
        "review": "Since I'm constantly traveling with two backpacks (one for work and one for leisure) and a small sling bag, I was always faced with the same problem: The power bank was definitely in the wrong backpack. That's why I bought several of these INIU 10000mAh power banks and put one in each backpack. My wife uses the fourth one in her backpack. The power bank is pleasantly small, light and handy. Despite its compact size, it offers very good performance. This charges my iPhone 16 Pro Max very quickly without the power bank or smartphone becoming uncomfortably hot. It is also ideal for the iPad. I was particularly impressed by the good price-performance ratio, the fast charging speed and the high suitability for everyday use. Its compact design also makes it perfect for traveling. For us, it is one of the best power banks we have used so far. Clear purchase recommendation!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Great little gadget, ideal small and easy to use - just what I wanted"
    },
    {
        "review": "I had been looking for a long time for an external battery that would not take up much space in my bag or pocket, and this INIU has exceeded my expectations. Despite its compact size, it has more than enough capacity to charge my phone several times. What surprised me the most is the loading speed; Being 22.5W, it charges my device much faster than other portable chargers I've had before. I give it 5 stars because it is the perfect balance between size and performance. The detail of the support to support the mobile while charging is very useful and very well thought out. In addition, the digital screen that indicates the exact battery percentage is super practical to avoid surprises. It is an essential accessory for traveling or to carry with you and forget about running out of energy. Highly recommended, excellent build quality."
    },
    {
        "review": "Like most people I am using my phone and tablet more and more these days.  But the trouble I often face is that when I most need to use the device I am running dangerously low on battery power.I have been using small power banks for many years (back to the days of the original Power Monkey for those old enough to remember) and recently ordered this model from INIU.  Although I had not heard of the company before (usually choosing name brands like Anker), I looked at the specifications and was quite impressed for the price and I certainly have not been disappointed.Thanks to the very useful display on the unit I could see it had an 80% charge out of the box so I was able to use it straight away.  I had a completely flat iPad which I connected up to the device and it charged this to 70% before the INIU unit was drained.  This gave me a good opportunity to test the time it takes to recharge the pack and 2 and a half hours later the portable power pack was fully charged up to 100%.The pack is very fast charging at speeds up to 22.5W but it also very small, light and portable which makes it easy to keep in your pocket, bag, tablet case etc.The unit comes with a nice carry case and a USB-A to USB-C lead which is probably unlikely to be used (due to the fact it is very short and you will more than likely use your own devices charging lead) but nonetheless is a nice inclusion on a product which is already excellent value for money.Overall very impressed with my first INIU product and look forward to using more of their range in future."
    },
