        "review": "It's ugly, and more importantly, it's not even super small. I ended up with the Ultra-Thin 35W USB-C PD Super Fast Charger, 2-Port Wall Charger from TREBLEET instead. The measurements look pretty similar, but it just feels so much smaller. Not keychain, but it's small enough to slip in anywhere, and I guess it also just seems smaller because it's not at 15 weird angles. It's just a super flat little rectangle. Less than half the price, too. And so, SO fast. I got the Retractable USB C to C Cable 3.3ft cable from BANGMANG for the cord. Takes up more space, but it was worth it for me to have such a long cable. A tiny, short little cable is pretty cheap and easy from anybody."
