        "review": "This is a very good, solid webcam for business or personal use at a good price. The field of view is great, just about perfect in my opinion. The durability is solid, and it has good adjustability options for angle and direction. A big selling point for me was the manual cover that can be folded down whenever you like and left that way unless you're using the camera.The only real drawback of this camera is that its color balance is a bit off. It can get easily washed out by bright light and will over-expose nearby light sources and anything that is caught in nearby light sources. This is particularly likely to happen if there  is a strong source of white light or sunlight in the field of view such as strong sunlight coming in from a side window or a window behind the camera. So if you use this camera, you will have to carefully manage the on camera light sources or point the camera away from direct strong lighting.Other than that, the picture is sharp and clear and transmits in high resolution with no trouble. All in all, I like the camera and expect it to provide good service in the years to come."
