        "review": "Great camera easy install of software.  Works great when I'm streaming with it in 1080p 60fps works great for video calls over discord in 4k 30fps. Easily mounted on a tripod or on top of a monitor. Doesn't really have that many bells and whistles but has a privacy cover."
