    {
        "review": "I recently purchased a Logitech C920e HD Mic-Enabled Webcam to go with a new ASUS desktop computer running Windows 11... I was having compatibility problems with my old Logitech webcam, so I decided to treat myself to a new Logitech webcam... After some research, I landed on the Logitech C920e HD Webcam, as it fulfilled all my requirements and more... After browsing for one at several electronics stores, I ended up ordering one from Amazon due to the stores asking price of $120 versus Amazon's $62 dollars - a 50% savings...!!! It works great and is easy to install - very user-friendly - even for someone like me, who's unfamiliar/unskilled with most things technical...!!! In doing my research, I learned of the Logitech C920e Webcam's numerous functions and features - (1) 2 microphones in stereo, instead of one, so there's no need for an external microphone... (2) A nice, snap-on privacy shutter/lid that provides you with privacy when you want it... (3) A blue indicator-light lets you know when it's on and operating... (3) A tripod mount for a 1/4\"-20 or a 3/8\"-16 screw gives you added versatility/portability... (4) A built-in motion sensor allows you to use it as a security camera... (5) Great camera functions with a manual focus slide gives you excellent photo results... (6) A Video Recorder - 1080x30fps for high-resolution videos with Automatic Light Correction & Auto-Focus included... (7) A 78-degree Field of View (FOV) for exceptional wide-view videos... (8) A high-quality glass lens for extremely clear/sharp photos and videos versus a cheaper plastic lens... (9) 3 Megapixels for great high-resolution images... (10) A detachable cable which is convenient... (11) It is compatible with Windows/Apple IOS/Chrome/ Mac OS X... Since I take my review photos with the Logitech C920e Webcam, it has proven itself to be easy-to-use and very proficient... I am very happy with its performance, affordability, and audio quality when talking to friends, overall... Highly recommended...!!!"
