    {
        "review": "The background removal technology works quite well on this camera. Obviously, it works better with a more \"simple\" background. I found in my bedroom, even with my bedding, laundry, and wall posters in the background this camera still did the trick (although the image was blurry/cut off my arms). I am going to try this camera with a green screen to see if that significantly improves the background removal technology. I use this camera with personify (the supplied program) and OBS and found that it worked well when streaming/recording. The only weakness is the compatibility of OBS and personify. OBS will crash if you try to have a normal webcam source and a source with background removal. Personify isn't the best program in the world, however, it was sufficient to performing the basic tasks I neededIf you are just looking for a solid webcam, this is a great option. The light absorption and auto-focus technologies were quick and responsive. Even when I opened my window and had the sunlight shining directly on the camera, it was able to focus and produce a (reasonably) clear and well lit image"
