    {
        "review": "Had multiple chance to use c920 for many years due to work. I’m glad that I did not cave in to buy c920 and chose to get brio instead. It worked perfectly straight out of the box with everything set to auto. When compared to the built in webcam on the laptop the differences was beyond words. It will cost more but having different fov, 4k and usb-c meant that the product is future proofed. Given that c920 is still on sales for so many years I’m pretty sure brio will stay relevant in the years to come. Quality product."
