    {
        "review": "I really like this camera. The 4K picture color quality and sharpness are spot on. The sound produced through the dual microphones is clear and distinct with little or no background noise, nearly studio quality. It’s compact, super easy to set up, and the mount is soft so it doesn’t scratch your display. Pretty much just unbox it, plug it in to an available USB port and you’re good to go. It can be adjusted easily through your computer’s onboard Camera app. It would be better if it had the auto-follow feature, but it’s not a deal breaker for me. The only gripe I have about this camera is the privacy shade. It doesn’t come attached, so it’s up to you to get it positioned just right. It’s held onto the top of the camera body with sticky foam, which holds well. To use the privacy shade you just flip it down or up. Overall I really like the quality, picture, and sound of this camera and recommend it."
