        "review": "Only 1 regret related to this purchase; that I waited this long to finally add a lamp to my makeshift “office” at home and subsequently finding this lamp. For years I’ve worked under an overhead light in my dining room (I own a townhouse, not huge so no extra room for an actual office, therefore my desk is downstairs in between the LR and DR) with my headaches and migraines becoming more and more frequent. I set the lamp up almost immediately upon delivery. Super simple to set up, no hassle at all, clamp it to the desk, tighten the clamp, plug it up and throw 2 AAA’s into the remote and BAM! You’re done. The strain on my eyes and my head was almost instantly relieved. The numerous light settings to choose from, AWESOMENESS. After trying them all I finally found my sweet spot (and It took less than five minutes to find). I love that it has a nightlight setting (didn’t notice that in the description) and a timer. It appears to be made very well, very sturdy but easily flexed to your liking. Love that the lights are two different bars and can be adjusted individually as well. Overall, best money I’ve spent on my workspace since I discovered the almighty mouse jiggler, honestly. If you’re on the fence and looking at every lamp Amazon has listed, save your time and energy and just click to buy, I promise, you won’t be disappointed!!"
