[
    {
        "review": "I bought this 4-head lamp for my large workstation setup and it has completely transformed my workspace. If you have dual monitors or a massive 90-inch desk area, this light coverage is unmatched.The Good:Phenomenal Coverage & Flexibility: The 4-head design is a game-changer. With the combination of the 360° flexible neck, folding arms, and rotatable heads, you can eliminate every single shadow on your desk. You can fold them out wide or point them down directly for detailed work.True Eye-Care (CRI 95+): The light is genuinely soft, flicker-free, and anti-glare. Colors look vibrant and accurate under it, which is incredibly helpful for crafting, reading, or long hours staring at a computer screen without eye strain.Dual Controls: Having both the wireless remote control and the hand-wave motion sensor makes adjusting settings effortless. The stepless dimming and adjustable color temperatures (from warm yellow to crisp daylight) work flawlessly.The Not-So-Good:Clamp Clearances: The desk clamp is very sturdy, but make sure your desk has enough of a lip underneath to attach it securely (it fits up to 2 inches thick).Takes Adjustment Time: Because there are so many points of articulation, it might take a few minutes of twisting and bending to find your perfect angle without hitting the tops of your monitors.Verdict: An exceptional, space-saving architect lamp that clears up desk room by clamping to the back. It’s easily worth the price if you need powerful, customizable lighting!"
