    {
        "review": "My eyes will be eternally grateful to this invention. Since I have been teleworking, I have realized that I do not focus well if there is not enough light, so my eye health has skyrocketed since I had it ✨ I love it, not much to say, it does what it promises, it adapts to the monitor and takes care of my eyes."
