        "review": "I was just about to write a one star review because after only having this lamp for a month, the remote stopped working! It had worked great until I had to unplug it and then after I plugged it back in - the remote no longer worked! So, just as I was about to write a bad review, I read the back of the remote on how to pair the lamp with the remote control. I guess I hadn't thought to do that because I didn't have to do that when I first plugged it up and the remote worked fine then. But, I went ahead and followed the instructions and it now works like a charm again. It has a great brightness that adjusts easily and it has a great look to it and is perfect for my desk. Would recommend! Easy assembly and is lightweight."
