        "review": "This Desk lamp body is made entirely of high-quality aluminum for excellent heat dissipation, extending the lifespan of the desk lamp. It's paired with a weighted, non-slip base and stays stable on any surface without wobbling or tipping.I like the differnet adjustments available. The light has 4 rotatable joints, allowing you to freely adjust direction and angle to deliver precise light exactly where you need it—onto your book, keyboard, or crafts. It reproduces true-to-life object colors and provides even illumination with no glare, no flicker, and no blue light hazard. Reduces eye fatigue and creates a comfortable environment for jigsaw puzzle or computer work.This LED desk lamp offers 4 color temperatures (3000K–6500K) and 5 brightness levels (20%–100%). Adjust both to fully customize the light, creating the ideal illumination for any task. It even has a built-in auto shut-off timer. Set it for 30 minutes before bed, and the light will turn off automatically. It also remembers your last lighting settings, so next time you turn it on, it instantly restores your preferred setup.I'm enjoying this desk lamp and hope it lasts a long time."
