        "review": "I have had this lamp for almost a year and a half, and it is undoubtedly one of the best things I’ve ever purchased! I use it to do my crafting. We have canned lighting in our basement where my crafting area is set up and it was nowhere near bright enough for me to do the fine detail painting on my art. I tried one of our smaller LED desk lamps to supplement the basement lighting, but that just wasn’t cutting it. I found this lamp and was WOWED (still am)! Super bright light exactly where I need it. The lighting is adjustable, per the product description, but I use it on the brightest setting and that makes doing the fine detail painting on my art a breeze. I have other crafters join me on occasion and the width of the lamp provides bright light for those sitting on either side of me as well.It is very easy to set up and adjust, and has never given me a moment’s trouble. I just gently touch the power on for the sections I want to have lit and I’m ready to roll. To top it off, it looks professional.I highly recommend purchasing this lamp. It is worth every penny."
