        "review": "I searched through a lot of desk lights (even some branded ones) and finally narrowed down on this with a slight feeling in the back of my mind this might not be best, but happily found that I was wrong. Boy! These lights are amazing, better than what I expected. Really good quality construction, adequate brightness levels and light colors to choose from, flexible yet long enough to fit behind any monitor size and adjust to your liking, look really neat with tucking the wires on the side seam of its neck, and very affordable. The lights don't shine on your face yet illuminate the necessary area so you can work in nights without any additional lights. Remote control is an additional bonus along with the touch controls. It was really easy to assemble and I did not bother to look at the assembly instructions."
    },
    {
        "review": "If you are on the fence on rather to buy this or not. Go for it, it is well worth the price. The setting and remote make it perfect. Has some nice color for lighting options and the remove makes it so good. I have 48inch monitors (2 of them) for me work and if I have dark mode on both monitors it is really dark on my desk these guys fixed that completely. I can't say about longevity or anything but the lighting is perfect."
    },
    {
        "review": "Such a good light for the money. It works perfectly  with the remote and the controls on top of the light if you don’t get the one with the remote. It’s bendy so you can adjust it however you want. The light sticks can fold into an array of different positions. It’s tall enough to fit over my monitors and the white color is nice. The cord fits into a track along the light so it’s hidden from view and looks clean. The different light color options with the dimmer are so nice. Super easy to assemble and seems pretty durable. It doesn’t make me hot when I’m working under it while doing my nails or homework."
    },
    {
