        "review": "I love this little lamp. I do not have a lot of space at the moment and needed something that didn’t take up much room, worked with my Echo, and had multiple light settings. This fit the bill!! It works flawlessly with my Echo, there are a ton of varieties of brightness and color settings to choose from, and it is small so it doesn’t take up a lot of space. It was super simple to setup. It connected through Smart Life and Alexa without any issues. I would recommend this lamp if you need something small, needs to be a smart lamp, doesn’t cost a fortune, and you want a variety of light settings!!"
