[
    {
        "review": "Recent Nail Tech Graduate!💅🏼I was looking for a portable desk lamp for when I start up my travel Nail Tech business. This is perfect! It is lightweight, flexible, has MagSafe capability and USB outlet on the back. You can adjust the brightness or change the light color to multiple shades. I think it’s really cool too that it has a timer on it, which I’ll be using to time myself as I practice and get better. Great size, good quality, cable is kinda short that’s really the only downfall. A nice touch was the light dims out when it turns off instead of turning off abruptly, very demure. 10/10 for price, quality, and multi use!"
    },
    {
        "review": "This is a good desk lamp with nice features. I don't use most of the 10 brightness levels or 5 color temperatures regularly, but you are sure to find something that suits your requirements within this range. It is sleek and has a small footprint but is not unstable. The lamp direction can be set by two hinges which are easy to adjust but stiff enough to hold position once set. Plus it has wireless and USB charging, as well as a shut-off timer. It is excellent value, for a very reasonable price.The lamp I received had a functional USB charger but a defective wireless charger, which was a minor annoyance. I contacted the supplier by email, and they sent me a replacement lamp within two days. Such outstanding customer service is hard to find these days.Some reviewers have complained about the slow speed of charging. I found the USB charging speed to be adequate, charging my phone from 40% to full in about an hour. Wireless charging is sensitive to phone placement. If not placed in the correct position, it keeps turning off and back on randomly, which takes much longer to reach full charge. With proper placement it works fine. It is easy to find the optimum placement by trial.I highly recommend this product and the supplier."
    },
    {
        "review": "Personally I like the warmer light. This light only has one setting with warm light. The other brighter lights do come in handy. Though I would prefer more warm light settings with more dimming power. Overall: I find this light very useful. The wireless charging pad is great for my iPhone or my AirPods 2 Pro. Not so much for my Apple Watch as it needs a stronger magnet to hold it in place. I like how the light swivels. I would like to see the manufacturer enable the use of the wireless pad simultaneously with the USB A port in the back. It cuts that one off in favor of the wireless when both are used at the same time. All things considered I'm good with this lamp. It works and has nice added features. Improvements: more warm light options, more sensitivity in the dimming control, simultaneous use of wireless and USB A port. Otherwise for me, perfect. =^) It is easy to use. And it's well made. Looks good on the desk."
