        "review": "I really was excited about this lamp. I’m only one day in with it so I’m sure I’ll be updating review soon but I just had to say how I woke up to phone more dead than it was. I was sure it was charging on the wireless pad before going to sleep. It was lit up solid blue and show it charging but phone on 60% when I woke up this morning when it should have been a full charge after sleeping allnight. I hate my main reason was buying this for the charger. The lamp was just a bonus. I love the lamp functions so far. The many color options (5 i believe at least) then you can turn up or down the brightness that’s cool but this wireless charger function not good at all. I will report back when I try out the usb port for charging later although that’s not how I want to charge my phone. It’s 2026 and I got it for the wireless charging function and to have less cords at my deskUpdate: the wireless pad just don’t like certain phone cases. It really charged fast once I removed my case. Just a tad inconvenient having to remove the case or sit the phone a certain way for it to charge but hey it charges so I can’t complain. I changed my rating! I’m satisfied with the purchase nowUpdating again : even taking phone case off this charging pad is so annoying! If the phone not on it exactly where it need to be it’s not charging too good, even when it light up solid blue and you think you about to have a charged phone. Nope 👎🏾"
