    },
    {
        "review": "Brilliant bit of kit. Two smokers in a small flat so it has its work cut out but it does try very hard and certainly makes a difference, been quite a godsend in these heatwaves too. Very happy with purchase, scan the QR code on the box for replacement filters...easy as pie"
    },
    {
        "review": "Small but quite efficient. Sleep mode is almost inaudible, but still produces a steady stream of filtered air. The controls are easy to use, the instructions are easy to follow. It's a neat looking machine, and good value."
    },
    {
        "review": "Its a great air purifier but I give it 4 stars as the scent section does not work when putting aromatherapy oils inside as no smell comes out"
