        "review": "It's one of those things like cell phones, microwaves, the internet that you wonder, \"how could I exist for so long without it?\" It makes life much easier in the kitchen and is very easy to understand and use. I am an elderly person and I don't like having to learn new techniques but it is very easy to use. I bought the mini 3 quart Duo Pot which is more than enough for my husband and I. The truth is, don't hesitate to buy one. I am so happy and pleased with this purchase."
