    {
        "review": "I had never used one and heard that they were very good and worth it. Because of my sensitive teeth I didn't opt ​​for the ones that rotate, I went for this one that vibrates and I thought maybe it would be something Meh! …Far from reality. It's a super brush! It feels VERY POWERFUL at low speed you can even feel your teeth in danger haha ​​but it doesn't cause any harm, on the contrary, with the manual ones I was hurting my enamel and above all there were parts that felt difficult to reach. I got this one on sale, it only comes with one head and it's small, it reaches difficult places and feels gentle on the gums, I definitely recommend it for sensitive teeth. There are many head options for different purposes. Only 2 speeds and very easy to use. I would buy it again without hesitation."
