        "review": "After two months of use, I can say, this is the best electric toothbrush I have used. When I saw this new type of brush, however, I initially wondered if it wasn't another way to attract consumers, but no. The cleaning system seems very different to me from what I used before, including from Oral B. FOR:- The vibration/rotation system of the brush is simply very well thought out. It's very gentle to use, it also seems very precise and the result is really good. - The light which lets you know if you're pressing too much on the brush is very visible, it's quite simple to adapt the pressure exerted. - I also like the vibration speed. CONS: - A little expensive. In the long term, if the toothbrush remains as reliable as ever, this could compensate for its price. Conclusion: We love the Oral B iO brush! Hoping it lasts several years."
