        "review": "This is -hands down- the best toothbrush I've ever used. I feel like I've just come from a great teeth cleaning session at the dentist every day after using it. This Philips Sonicare 5950 is easy to use and one charge lasts a very long time. It shows the battery level and has a light that lets you know when you are brushing too hard, which is not good for your teeth and gums. I really love that it has an automatic timer and lets you know when to move on to the next section of teeth so every tooth is thoroughly clean. I actually look forward to brushing my teeth now. I'm seriously considering getting them for everyone on my Christmas list this year."
