        "review": "My family and I have been using Oral-B electric toothbrushes for many years. So expecting the great level of quality performance I ordered this one. I was not disappointed. This Oral-B IO is exceptional and arrived fully charged. Also, it did a great job cleaning my teeth leaving my mouth feeling fresh. There is only one small caveat there is only one brush head included and my old Oral-B brush heads do not fit the new toothbrush. There are several reviews that mention the single included brush head is stiff. I’ve not had the same experience. Perhaps I received a different brush head."
