    {
        "review": "Really nice toothbrush.  I have had a Philips Sonicare for many years.  I redid my bathroom and it's all blue, and granted this is a little more expensive than the regular white one.  But the Blue looks SO GOOD with my Blue Bathroom.  And of course it works great!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I had to replace my Philips 6100 after only three years, which I wasn’t happy about. I got the 5900 because I only really use the CLEAN setting anyway and it was $60 cheaper! This new toothbrush is so quiet and smooth. I love it. I did Google and now these things only last like 3 years now. The older ones lasted forever. The one I gave my parents 25 years ago is still going strong! Funny how things change."
