    {
        "review": "Whoa - I love it! I just brushed with this toothbrush for the first time and rushed to write this review because I was so impressed. It cleans *extremely* well! Way more powerful than my older model Sonicare brush. I got the pale pink color and it’s so pretty! I love that you can adjust the intensity and mode. The material feels different than my old brush - it’s more of a matte finish and feels nice in my hand.I actually dropped my old Sonicare brush on the floor and it stopped working and I was so sad that I had to spend money to buy a new one. I begrudgingly purchased this new brush and now I believe it’s worth every penny and that my old brush falling was a blessing in disguise! I’m going to order one for my husband, too!"
