        "review": "So I usually use one of the disposable electric toothbrushes that vibrate and stop working when it’s time to replace. But I decided to take a new approach to brushing my teeth and I will say I love the shape of this toothbrush head because it reaches my bar back teeth, but I’ve never been able to reach and I absolutely love that. It has different vibration methods depending on what your goal is I’m guessing I just like to use the cleaning method, the noise is fine. It’s not too loud. It’s easy to charge. I haven’t had to recharge it yet. I love that. It comes with a toothbrush cover, which makes it easy to travel with. It looks nice and it feels comfortable in my hand my only and it’s I feel like it’s a pretty big problem is that the bristles come out never had bristles come out of my toothbrushes before no matter how cheap I’ve purchased and it feels disgusting. It makes me want to gag every time because it taste like the texture of hair on in my mouth while I’m brushing my teeth that’s the only reason this is getting three stars. I haven’t changed toothbrush heads yet being that I’ve only been using this for roughly 2 weeks other than that, it’s amazing but that’s a pretty big downside but given the price I feel like I guess that’s expected, but I don’t know. I’ve used some fairly cheap toothbrushes in my past and I’ve never.  Had that happen before."
