        "review": "I am keeping it and hoping I get used to using it. But this toothbrush is MASSIVE! The handle is very long, and the power button is in the middle of the handle, so it turns off all the time when I am using it. Poor placement for a power button. Then there is the POWER of this thing. The first time I used it I literally thought there was no way I was going to be able tolerate it. But I used one of the other settings that was a little less dramatic for a few days and slowly worked my way up to the \"cleaning\" function. But it is still some crazy force that comes from this toothbrush. It does clean your teeth VERY well and I like that it is rechargeable. I charged about a week ago when it arrived and I have not had to charge it since. I like the pink color; it is not an eye sore sitting on the bathroom counter. I would say this is not a \"travel\" toothbrush. Again, it is oversized and while it comes with a cover for the head of the toothbrush that cover is not going to stay on in a travel bag. I will have to get a smaller battery operated one for travel. It seems durable and if you can get past how big it is and the massive power then you might love this toothbrush. I on the other hand.... am tolerating it for now until I can't and I will order something different."
