        "review": "I purchased the Philips Sonicare DiamondClean Smart 9500 on September 11 for $273.61 SGD ($203.48 USD), and it has completely failed after just two months of use. The toothbrush head holder is loose and doesn’t hold the brush properly, while the body makes a loud, awful rattling noise. This is unacceptable for such an expensive product."
    },
    {
        "review": "I love the tongue cleaner setting and attachment for a clean mouth!Comes with a plastic base to sit in while not charging. The charging glass is excellent. Exceptional charging case and not bulky. It is loud but it is doing its thing! Works to a prestige job!This one has everything!"
    },
    {
        "review": "After 6 months, it stopped working! Waste of money"
