        "review": "I’ve been using this Oral-B Pro 100 CrossAction battery toothbrush for a while now and I’m really happy with it. It feels like a noticeable upgrade from a regular manual brush — my teeth feel cleaner and smoother after every use. The round brush head gets into areas that I usually miss, and the battery-powered action gives a deeper clean without making brushing cumbersome. The built-in 2-minute timer is a nice touch to help me stick to the dentist-recommended brushing time too.It’s lightweight, easy to use right out of the box (just pop in the batteries and you’re ready), and being compatible with various Oral-B heads means I can swap to softer or more advanced heads later if I want. For the price, it’s a reliable and practical daily toothbrush that genuinely improved my oral care routine."
