    },
    {
        "review": "I recently purchased the Oral-B Pro 100 CrossAction Battery powered toothbrush, and I am extremely satisfied with its performance. From the very first use, I noticed a remarkable difference in the cleanliness of my teeth compared to my old manual toothbrush. The CrossAction brush head, with its unique round design, really does provide a tooth-by-tooth clean, reaching deep between teeth and along the gumline for superior plaque removal. My gums feel healthier, and my mouth feels fresher after every brush.The toothbrush comes with two AA batteries included, so it’s ready to use right out of the box. I appreciate the consistent battery performance—there’s no drop in power, and it lasts a long time before needing replacement. Another great feature is its compatibility with a variety of Oral-B brush heads, including Sensitive, Gum Care, FlossAction, and 3D White, allowing me to customize my brushing experience as needed.Knowing that Oral-B is the #1 dentist-recommended toothbrush brand worldwide gives me extra confidence in my purchase. Overall, the Oral-B Pro 100 CrossAction is an excellent investment for anyone looking to upgrade their oral hygiene routine. Highly recommended!"
