        "review": "purchased for travel, really, I've entirely lost the technique for brushing my teeth? I just don't feel I am getting every corner they way an electric tooth brush does and, I have a lot of repair work so, getting everything clean is essential.It works as well as my rechargeable model and is not heavy. The only thing that baffles me is the timer, my rechargeable unit twitches every 30 seconds giving you half a minute for each quadrant...this one, I think it runs the full two minutes, giving you total time, not a real problem because, if you have done this for years, you have a pattern for it, but I keep meaning to time it out of curiosityvery pleased with it, in fact, I keep this one in the kitchen to remind me, if I snack late at night or, eat something more likely to stain my teeth, really, just walk upstairs into the bathroom, right?but seeing it in the kitchen reminds me and, less likely to snack if I brush my teeth after I have cleaned up following dinner..."
