    {
        "review": "I bought this toothbrush specifically for my frequent work travel, and it’s been a great choice. It’s the perfect size to fit easily in my luggage, and I love that you don’t have to bring a charger—one less thing to worry about when packing.The brushing power is impressive. The first time I used it my mouth felt cleaner than it had been a long time! I barely have to move it; I just gently hold it in place and it cleans better than some of the rechargeable toothbrushes I’ve owned. It feels sturdy and well-made. While it’s a bit heavier than a standard manual toothbrush, it’s not too heavy for travel and actually feels very comfortable to hold. Battery life seems to be holding up strong. I’ve had it for many months.Overall, this is a strong, travel-friendly toothbrush that delivers excellent cleaning without the hassle of charging."
