    {
        "review": "I was pleasantly surprised by the quality of this toothbrush and the range of features it offers for the price.Performance: It has 5 modes and very gentle, smooth mechanical movements. The brush is much quieter than I expected, which makes brushing more enjoyable.Battery life: It holds a charge for quite a long time, which is very convenient.Design: Mine is red, including the brush heads, and it looks very stylish. The travel case is also sleek and well-designed.Value for money: For this price, getting 8 replacement heads included was an amazing surprise!(For comparison: I also own a Philips 5300. That one costs about twice as much, is quite noisy, offers only 2 modes, and holds a charge for about two weeks. This toothbrush beats it in almost every aspect.)Overall, I’m very satisfied and will definitely recommend it to my friends!"
    }
