        "review": "This toothbrush is unbelievable, if you are a normal toothbrush user and never have tried one of this you will be very surprised. I bought it because I wanted to replace my old regular toothbrush and ended up getting this during a prime deal. First of all, price is incredible for what the toothbrush does. Also, I feel me teeth cleaner than ever before, at first I though it was going to be a regular toothbrush but no, I was very surprised, it vibrates and clean like nothing else and is super easy to use. Toothbrush itself looks very good quality and durable. I seriously recommend people try this and see what it does with their own eyes."
