        "review": "I have been looking for a laptop for just surfing the Internet and keeping track of emails. I didn't want to spend a fortune because I just need it for basic things. This works great for me. It came well packaged. I love the size of it, 15.6 inches. The screen is nice and clear and easy to read. It is a touchscreen and that is good because I am used to using my phone like that. The battery lasts a long time also. I am really impressed with it. It is a good value for the money."
