        "review": "This laptop is great for working and browsing. It holds its charge for almost half the day before it needs to be recharged. The keys feel great, and the mousepad has a nice texture. If you need more processing power, there is an empty slot to add more RAM. The screen is plenty bright, and the colors are very good for the price. This is a great pick for a budget laptop. If you're looking for a laptop that won't break the bank, but is also functional enough for daily use, this is the laptop for you. I highly recommend it."
