    {
        "review": "So far I’m happy & impressed with the JBL Grip Speaker. I own 2 other JBL brand portable speakers, and they’ve all been reliable speakers & have sounded great to me. I just purchased this one so I can’t speak to its longevity yet, but my others have lasted over time, under water, dropped and taken on plenty of adventures. I’m hoping this one will have a long happy life too. (I’ll edit this review if I have anything less than a 5-star experience.) This was NOT a paid review for a free product, just another free opinion for you."
