        "review": "For a $20 speaker this thing is pretty awesome!!Sound is great! Very loud to be a smaller speaker. Connected very quickly and easily done! Can change the lights to either go along with the sound of the music or just a slow roll through the colors. You can also turn the light off if you’d like!My favorite thing about this product is if you have 2 of the same ones you can connect them together and put one on each side of the house!!  I’ve been playing it for about 3 hours now and it has only used 1 dot of battery on half charge out the box. All in all pretty great budget friendly speaker!!"
