[
    {
        "review": "I have wanted these Henckels knives for a long time and finally got the opportunity during a Prime Day sale.I can't say enough good things about these knives. They are sharp so be careful! Compared to the dull knives I used before, there is no comparison. These knives easily slice through everything I use them for, mostly meat and veggies. This set contains every type of knife I need, including scissors and a sharpener.I will not allow these beautiful knives to sit in soapy water or the dishwasher, therefore I can't speak to how well they will hold up over time to rusting. I am relying exclusively on the well-regarded reputation of the manufacturer.Overall, I gave these knives 5-stars because of the quality, sharpness, and ease of handling. They are sturdy and I am not concerned about rusting or degrading of the metal. This is an excellent set for the price and I'm very pleased!"
