[
    {
        "review": "I ordered the Ninja Foodi NeverDull 17-piece knife set because I was tired of constantly switching between dull knives and cheap replacements. After using this set for a while in an everyday home-kitchen setting, here’s what I’ve honestly found:Right away, the set feels solid and well-made compared to my old Mainstays Knife Set that's over 10 years old.Each knife has a nice weight to it — not too heavy, not flimsy — and the handles feel comfortable even when I’m doing longer prep work. The German stainless steel definitely feels a step up from the random mixed knives I had before. They cut really well. The chef’s knife is probably the one I have used the most, and it slices through vegetables and meat cleanly without me having to “saw” through anything. The steak knives are also surprisingly sharp.The built-in sharpener is honestly one of my favorite parts. You literally slide the knife through the sharpener on the block and it freshens the edge. It’s easy, it takes seconds, and it keeps the knives very sharp.One thing to note: they’re not dishwasher safe. That didn’t bother me too much because I hand-wash my better kitchen tools anyway, but it’s definitely something to be aware of if you prefer to just toss everything in the dishwasher.There’s a knife for pretty much everything. This set has way more than I actually use day-to-day, but it’s nice knowing I have a bread knife, a boning knife, and plenty of steak knives when I need them. It feels like the kind of set that covers you for almost any home cooking situation.Only con for me is the amount of counter space they take up, compared to my old set. So, if you have a smaller kitchen you’ll want to think about where it’s going to sit. But the block looks nice and modern, so I don’t mind it being on my counter top next to my stove.All in all, they are definitely a solid upgrade."
    },
    {
        "review": "This knife set exceeded my expectations. The knives are extremely sharp, comfortable to hold, and make slicing, chopping, and dicing effortless. The built-in sharpener is a fantastic feature that helps keep the blades in excellent condition.The block is sturdy, looks great on the countertop, and keeps everything organized. The knives feel well-balanced and are made with high-quality materials.Overall, this is an outstanding knife set that offers excellent performance and great value. Highly recommended. Amazing!"
    },
    {
        "review": "So convenient to have the sharpener handy when they start getting dull!!! They cut amazing! They also look great on the counter! I  love this invention!!!"
    },
