        "review": "I’m really impressed with this Ninja NeverDull knife set. The knives feel sturdy, balanced, and comfortable to use, and they make everyday prep so much easier. I also love that they feel nice, not too heavy. From chopping vegetables to slicing bread or carving meat, there is a knife for just about everything... I got the 17 piece set haha.. a little bit of a Ninja fan! :P and including eight steak knives and kitchen shears makes the most of this set.My favorite feature is the sharpener built into the block. It is incredibly convenient and takes the guesswork out of keeping the blades sharp. Just a quick use of the sharpener helps restore the edge, so the knives continue to cut smoothly instead of crushing food. The black block also looks clean and modern on the counter.Overall, this is a great all-in-one set for anyone who wants sharp, reliable knives without the hassle of separate sharpening tools. Ninja says its built-in NeverDull sharpener is designed to maintain a sharp edge for more than 10 years.. guess I'll let you know in 10 years it that's true! :P"
