    {
        "review": "So I have had this set since November 2020 - 3 FULL YEARS - and it still looks and performs like the day I first got them!!  They are beautiful, sharp, feel good in the hand/nice weight and handle, and are easy to use.  JUST TAKE CARE OF THEM AND HAND WASH THESE KNIVES!!  Of course, if you put them in the dishwasher, water will collect in the handles and rust may develop if the blades don't dry completely.  I think that was one of the \"Don'ts\" that was mentioned in the description by the manufacturer.  Mine are still perfect!!  And I do have my favorite - the Santoku Knife!! ❤️"
