    {
        "review": "I bought this set of knives as a “cheap set for the beach” and they have exceeded all of our expectations! They are incredibly sharp, comfortable to grip, and slide right through everything we have cut/chopped/etc. I can’t speak for the longevity as we’ve only used them for one week on our beach trip as intended but if you need a quick set of knives, look no further. 10/10! Fun colors too!"
