    {
        "review": "In my case, R100 came, the seller was super accessible and attentive, he provided all possible support for what happened. The product was sent quickly and delivery also came ahead of schedule, everything in order, with manual, invoice and well packaged. Original product, camera is light and compact with a rubberized finish, it has its own built-in flash and you can also add another one if you prefer, battery and charger, it comes with a Canon strap, it even appears to be resistant, the rest are working perfectly too. For the charger, I recommend having an adapter to be able to charge it. Note: the card shown in the photos is not included with the product, it was a separate purchase. Overall, I loved the product and service, super reliable store, I highly recommend it. Thanks!"
