        "review": "This camera is everything I hoped it would be. I am very picky when it comes to cameras because at my last job I was using $8k Fujifilms. For the price, this easily satisfies the creative parts of my brain.It has customizable settings but it also is super easy to use if you don’t have experience. When I’m lazy I just set everything to auto.The quality of its components are notable.The zoom quality is great, but the zoom distance leaves room to be desired, however with this model you can purchase additional lenses.The batter life is great so far. I’m snowed in currently and have been using it all day without needing to charge.All in all, a truly great product!"
