    },
    {
        "review": "Disappointed. The camera itself is in great condition however the listing is extremely misleading. The second photo shows quit a bit more gear including 2 more lenses, a carrying case, cables and more. Apparently I am not the first person to comment on this issue. This is not a lot rather it is just a camera with one lense, 1 battery, charger and a strap. This is quit a bit more basic and to me is not a full kit. This listing should be 50-75$ cheaper and the second photo should be removed. I contacted seller and the solution they offered was to return the item. The camera itself is nice I just feel misled and I think a partial refund is an adequate solution."
    },
    {
        "review": "I love this camera! I’ve been  photography has been my hobby for the past couple years and wanted to do more with ISO, Focus, Aperture, Shutter speed and so on. My other camera did none of these things so I needed an upgrade, problem is I don’t have a ton of money and I was worried a camera this “cheap” was not going to be good. However this is possibly the best bang for your buck you can get! I have loved this camera and it has done me quite well. I would recommend however disabling the automatic flash, I think flash ruins things. I have had it for a few months and haven’t found a troubled with it so far. Battery lasts a long time and the quality picture you get all depends on you. Nice easy dial for changing settings fast during shoots. Really though, if you use this camera correctly, you’ll get a banging picture."
