    {
        "review": "I purchased this Canon EOS R50 mirrorless camera because I recently purchased a bridge camera with a single lens and I wanted a lighter alternative that I can use different camera lenses with it and have more control and options over the lens aspect This Canon camera is not a replacement for my fantastic bridge camera but this Canon mirrorless camera is incredibly light even with a 55mm - 210mm lens attached. I did a lot of research to try and choose the right mirrorless camera for me and I had high expectations of this Canon EOS R50 when I purchased it and my hopes have been met and surpassed. I have never had a DSLR camera and this is my first mirrorless camera. The inclusion of the RF-S 18 - 45mm camera lens with the camera at a very good price from Amazon UK was.an important reason for choosing Amazon UK to purchase this camera. I wanted this camera to be excellent and yet affordable and I am very satisfied. My aim was to use the camera with multiple lenses and to be able to achieve great clear point and shoot photographs as well as me advancing to using the various semi-automatic and more manually controlled settings. I now know this is a fabulous camera and the image quality is amazing even with it set to Automatic. The camera is definitely suited to enabling me to develop my photographic knowledge and skills using it. I have only had it a short time but take it with me most places and I have taken well over 1000 photographs with ease. I still also use my bridge camera and love that too. However, there is no denying this Canon camera’s image quality is superior but horses for courses as my bridge camera has a very long zoom in a single lens so in that respect it is more versatile. I do not intend my last comment to be negative about this mirrorless camera. I have found this Canon camera to be a precision instrument as are the Canon lenses I use with it. Attaching and detaching each lense is simple providing you read the instructions or already know what you are doing and the extremely high quality of the fittings gives massive reassurance. The image stability through the lens and the autofocus functions are superb. I could not be more pleased with this camera and taking pictures with it gives me enormous pleasure.  This Cannon camera is very compact and lightweight. I read a lot of professional photographer reviews before purchasing this camera and most of them praised it but my perspective is not necessarily compatible with them. My opinion is that this camera is much better than even the most positive professional review I read. I am not able to comment on its vlogging capabilities or it’s video capability because my focus is its picture taking abilities. I note that the camera description refers to it as a vlogging camera and I have no doubt it would do that well too although I think the alternative V version is aimed specifically at that market."
