        "review": "So far so great! I’ve brewed coffee multiple times now using this product and it works great. I love how it’s super basic and easy to use. After using multiple other products such as the keurig and nespresso I got tired of the constant buying of capsules and cups etccc. This thing is easy to use and allows for your coffee to be warm for multiple hours.It fits right under my counter, paper roll next to it for reference. Brews a bunch of coffee (12 cups). Just one switch that’s all (to turn off and on). The coffee container does feel like it contains some plastic but so far durable and has not stained."
