    {
        "review": "My sister in law told me about this Keurig singles or a carafe for a full pot of coffee product. She was on her second one after many years . So they are long lasting., The carafe holds up to 12 cups and of course the keurig side is single pods. There is a button to make ice coffee and one to make your cup stronger! Yummy yum! It is attractive countertop and it is a lightweight coffee unit.It is grayish black in color and cleans easily as you could imagine. We really like it so much better than the unit we had that started with a C and was not inexpensive. Thinking it will last us for quite some time. We really like it!"
