        "review": "I can say what others have said. It's a great coffeemaker. It's small enough for one or two people, easy to clean,  and makes good coffee.  As someone stated before, the on/off button requires two hands to use: one for holding the coffee maker and the other to turn the button on or off.I am also unclear on what kind of filters to use in the filter basket. Still searching.In general, I gave this a five star because I am able to make coffee quickly in the morning.  It's great."
    },
    {
        "review": "I loved it for the first few days that it was working. It was easy to use easy to set up. Everything was perfect. The cleaning process it was perfect. Then it stopped working about after 2 1/2 weeks. I cannot figure out what’s going on with it I think it is an internal problem. Because the light the power light comes on, but that’s all it does and it makes a weird noise. But it doesn’t get hot anymore. It doesn’t make coffee. The water doesn’t go anywhere so I’m actually very disappointed in this product because if I’m going to pay money for something, I at least wanna be able to use it for 30 to 60 days before it immediately stops working on me."
    },
