        "review": "My upper cabinets are low and I don't have much counter space, so I was excited to find this coffee maker that is so compact. With the lid up, the height is only 17\", so I don't even have to pull the machine forward to prep my coffee.The machine heats the water just the right amount so the coffee comes out hot and flavorful, not burnt or oily. The plate keeps the brew at a good temp.The only flaws is that the light gray warming plate has no sealant on it, so drips stain it.However, this machine is still a great buy due to the low price point, efficient footprint, and awesome coffee."
    },
    {
