    {
        "review": "I bought this to replace an older 12 cup maker that unfortunately stopped working.While significantly smaller, this one does what it's supposed to just fine. It looks good on my counter, doesn't take up much space. Other people have commented about the temperature of the brew, and they're right. It doesn' brew as hot as my previous one, though for me personally that's not an issue. I usually had to let a cup sit and cool down a bit before whereas now, once I put some milk in it's the perfect temperature.The only issue I have with it is that due to the small size, it takes a bit to get used to pouring it slowly so as not to spill all over the counter. This is more of a learning issue as opposed to an actual problem. I would however caution anyone with more than one coffee drinker in the household, get a bigger one than this. lol.All in all, for what I paid, no real complaints."
