        "review": "I was so excited to find a coffee pot that is the exact same shade of purple that’s my favorite color. I was pleasantly surprised to find a reusable coffee filter that came with the machine. The setup took less than 5 minutes from the start of opening the box all the way to programming the time for my coffee to brew the next morning. The coffee was already freshly brewed when I woke up for the day which 10000/10 was so excited about. The quality of this is way better than I imagined given some of the reviews I saw. The coffee itself dripped nicely,  no mess or anything. The plate stayed hot for 2 hours. One feature I loved about this, is that it shows you how long the pot has been sitting since brewed. After 2 hours when the pot turns off it reverts back to the regular time. It’s nice to be able to see how long the pot had been sitting prior to serving myself.The counter space taken up is extremely minimal, this is a great coffee maker."
