    },
    {
        "review": "After one year of daily use, the BLACK+DECKER CM1160W-1 has proven to be a reliable and well-built coffeemaker. The build quality is excellent for its price range: the materials still feel sturdy, the white and stainless-steel finish looks good, and the carafe remains strong, easy to handle, and completely leak-free.It brews quickly and quietly, which makes it perfect for everyday mornings. The size is compact, so it doesn’t take up much counter space, and the coffee always tastes clean with no plastic smell or strange aftertaste.I don’t really use the programmable features—most of the time, I simply brew my coffee and then unplug the machine once I’m done. Even with this simple routine, the machine has held up perfectly with no issues.Overall, after a full year of consistent use, I can say this is a dependable, efficient coffeemaker with excellent value for the money. Definitely a purchase worth recommending."
