        "review": "I love it! I only drink 1 or 2 cups of coffee each morning.  My daughter brought her (fancier) Keurig home with her from college.  Iv been using it all summer long.  I didn't want to part ways with it when she goes back.  So I bought this basic and inexpensive one. I don't need all the fancy buttons. Just pour the water, put your coffee in and hit the button.  Super easy.  It's fits my 12oz mug and it brews up to 12 ounces.  I use the reusable k-cup and it fits fine.  It's not loud.  The coffee tastes good."
    },
