        "review": "brews coffee quickly,  works as expected: coffee is hot and taste is the same as a larger multi-cup Keurig.  Item is nice and compact and easy to use."
    },
    {
        "review": "If you’re purchasing this item because it looks like a perfect set, be sure to read the entire ad and small print  The item is fine, works as expected. Pretty color, great size for small spaces like a dorm room. What bothered me about the purchase was that I thought the cup was included because it is pictured with the machine.As it turns out, it is not. This listing is very misleading. Unless you look at all the pictures, you will not know that the mug is not included. It is written in tiny print on the third picture of the Keurig machine. I’m disappointed, as this was a gift."
