    {
        "review": "I love this coffee maker. Its size is ideal for small spaces or the office, as it takes up hardly any counter space. The mint green color is exactly as pictured and looks lovely in the kitchen. The coffee comes out hot and brews very quickly. Plus, the stainless steel thermal mug keeps the drink at a good temperature for quite a while. It's super easy to use and clean. Highly recommended!"
    },
    {
        "review": "This cute little personal single serve coffee pot is exactly what my mother-in-law needed and I’ve made sure that she got one. It comes with its own mug. The brew time was very quick and the coffee tasted just perfect. No need for filters as it has its own little basket that is washable. But we decided to purchase the coffee pads, the little round coffee pads look like coffee and a teabag. Couldn’t find them in the store so I purchased them on Amazon. I told her not to fill up the water too high in the mug before she poured it in because she’s gonna be putting her creamer in it. She’s 80 years old so sometimes you have to remind her of things. But all in all, it’s a great little coffee pot and I’m glad I purchased it."
