    {
        "review": "You need to add more coffee if you like it strong. Having no replacement available for the filter almost made me return it. But it works great for chai tea bags as well. Chai tea is great iced and watered down a bit. Probably will put it in one of my campers though for visitors and get a 4 cup Mr. Coffee for the house."
    },
    {
        "review": "I have tried many different coffee makers and this one is really a win on both value, ease of use and making a great simple cup of coffee. If you drink one cup of coffee a day this coffee maker would be a great solution for you. I started grinding my own coffee during covid and never went back to k cup pods as the coffee strength Is extremely watered down and not the correct ratio. This coffee maker is easily movable and takes up a very small amount of counter space. It comes with a reusable filter as well that can be emptied out very easily. It makes a perfect cup of 12 oz. The to go cup it comes with also is surprisingly great quality and has a nice padding under the mug to not slide easily. Overall this is an amazing value for a coffee maker that you can use daily or as a backup. ☕️"
    },
    {
        "review": "I liked it a lot and it is very practical."
    },
    {
        "review": "I have bought seven of these over the course of two years. Not because they break but because they're so good and a number of family members have asked for one as a gift after seeing mine. My husband (his is in black) and I both have one for work and we have one for the house. All three of ours get heavy use and they're still going strong! The other four have been bought as gifts and everyone who has gotten one absolutely adores it! I got one for my work Secret Santa and they have been delighted to use it every day since it is much more affordable than pods.It makes a cup of coffee, assuming max fill, in less than 3 minutes and it is delicious every time. It also brews at the right temperature. This little coffee maker is punching way above its weight class in terms of value and it comes out on top every time."
    },
