[
    {
        "review": "This chair is exactly what I was looking for. It’s very comfortable, plush, and supportive, making long hours at my desk much more enjoyable. The cushioning feels firm and great, it almost feels like sitting in a recliner while still giving me enough support and maneuverability to work comfortably.I really like how adjustable the chair is. The backrest, and other features can be adjusted to fit your preferred sitting position. The pull-out leg rest is a fantastic addition, especially when you want to put your feet up, take a quick break, or simply change your sitting position throughout the day.Assembly took me around 30–40 minutes, but it was straightforward and definitely worth the time. Once assembled, the chair feels solid and well-built.Overall, I’m very happy with this chair. It’s comfortable enough for relaxing but practical enough for working, gaming, or spending long periods at a desk. The adjustable features and built-in leg rest are big pluses for me."
