    },
    {
        "review": "This is one solid solid chair and super easy to assemble, but came arrived with a rip on the back where the leather is tight.  Contacted mfr to see what happens and will update review accordingly.  Chair does it all though and for a fraction of the price as many other popular ones are.  Adjustable all over and fot and finish is great.  Comfy and tall as im 6'1 and zero issues as well fitting under desk since you can adjust the arms all around and up and down...  UPDATE..  seller responded super fast and is fixing the issue so yes get this chair!!!  So happy now!!!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Very well built all the screws line up- well illustrated. Anyone can put this together.. Step by step instructions very very easy..."
    },
    {
        "review": "I really love the support team. After a year of using I have noticed that back rest is tilting sideways and back seat getting ruptured! But contacted the support team after the warranty period . I got prompt response and complete replacements parts! Kudos to the team! I would highly recommend this chair! It is very comfy and easy to assemble."
    },
    {
        "review": "Ok. So I'm a gamer/streamer. I wanted a nice gaming chair, nice within reason. I selected this one based off of the ratings and the amount of reviews it had. Let me preface this review by stating I am a disabled chubby woman lol. I'm 5'5 and 200 lbs so my review is for someone of that stature and support needs.To start the ship time was estimated at nearly one month. Which was shocking to me, but it did arrive very early at only 9 days. (This was due to my proximity to one of their warehouses, I'm an hour from one of their 4 warehouses. So I can't assume this shipping time is the norm.) The box arrived in good condition, although massive and heavy.Assembly was shockingly easy, the instructions were clear and all the parts were accounted for and they also send some extra bolts just in case, which is always nice.Once assembled I put on the support pillows, the lumbar one was too large and firm for me due to my back issues. If the lumbar one was the same softness as the neck pillow I believe that would have been perfect.The chair is nice quality, no scratches, dings, dents, or tears were evident after assembly. The material feels luxurious without the price tag. The chair is also completely gorgeous. I LOVE the dark purple color, all the other purples in chairs looked more pink, this is deep purple and lovely.Now the downside. For this price I would have thought the chair would have been more comfortable. The curves on the lower part of the backrest are fairly protruding, if you aren't a small or average hipped person these press into your hips/bum. The seat itself feels extremely hard and flat, and feels as if it's tipping forward. For this price I just really was expecting at least some comfort and cushion and the cardboard box I think would be more cushiony. The armrests are constantly out of place, I think I spent more time adjusting them back to where they belonged. If the chair was priced closer to 130 I think I would be happy with it, but at this price point it is at I just expect better. My end result is selling the chair and I went and bought a nice executive office chair from an office supply store, where I could sit in the chairs first. That would be my suggestion, go sit in things before spending any money so you know what matters to you and what you like.TL:DR Gorgeous chair, easy assembly. If you are anything other than standard sizes this chair might be a bit small. Chair lacks comfort and cushioning, wiggly armrests. Getting rid of my Gtracing chair and bought a nice office chair instead. (Writing this from the office chair and I have a happy bum.)Good luck and happy gaming!"
    }
]

