    {
        "review": "Briefly on my own behalf: The DPD driver simply claimed that I wasn't there and delivered the package to a shop The chair was really easy, and you only need the only tool provided. There is a QR CODE that provides a setup video, which is practical, but it works very well without it. After about half an hour, the gaming chair was set up and could be used. The chair is really comfortable, ideal for my back, which is very sensitive. The lumbar cushion in particular supports the back optimally during longer gaming sessions, for me it's truck rides in the simulator area. I use a steering wheel with pedals, so I have I have high demands on a gaming chair. The neck pillow can also be moved variably, so the neck is well supported! This chair offers an incredible amount of adjustment options and settings, which is exactly what I was looking for! I am 1.74cm tall and the dimensions of the chair are ideal for me. The leg rest also suits me very well, it might no longer fit well with taller people. You should probably take that into account before buying! The gaming chair has a medium level of hardness, you don't sink into it, but it is comfortable at all times, even after long periods of use. The highlight is of course the removable back, so that you don't get stuck in the summer! Then the back area is airy and the heat can circulate. I'm happy to forgo a massage function because the designer has achieved a significant improvement in comfort here. My gaming computer generates a lot of heat, the hot summers do the rest and you're literally stuck in standard gaming chairs. The mesh in the backrest can now be used to run the fan Distribute the air, a great thing in my opinion. This way you always keep a cool head while gaming and you can retrofit a massage cushion for €10 if necessary. The chair is also suitable as a TV armchair, it can be folded back wonderfully very cleanly processed and the gaming chair looks aesthetically high-quality, like a sports seat in the car. The side support is also similar, the armrests are wide and comfortably padded! Conclusion: For me personally, an all-round successful product of high quality and at a reasonable price. The removable back cover is a great idea and extremely practical for the hot summers! In my opinion, the comfort of the gaming chair is very high, the aesthetics are not neglected either, great design paired with clean workmanship! I haven't been able to find any weak points so far I can't rate durability yet. The service is good, if I need similar gaming accessories again, the seller will definitely be my first point of contact! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ absolutely deserved and I would be happy to recommend this product."
