        "review": "An excellent replacement for my old computer chair. Easy to assemble using either the instructions that came with it, or the online video. Nice looking chair and very comfortable to sit on, especially with the footrest, lumbar support pillow and the neck/head pillow. It’s quite lightweight for a chair of this sort of thing, so you need to be careful when you sit down on it as it moves fast."
