    {
        "review": "My son ordered this chair for his desk and gaming. He loves it and said it was very easy to assemble. It's a nice slim size so if you're cramped for space you'll love it. It's solid and looks to be durable. The foot rest is brilliant and I may get one myself for my work desk. I am in a chair all day for work and I've been having a lot of hip pain. The reclining back and foot rest do wonders for tight hip flexors and circulation."
