    },
    {
        "review": "For the price, I wasn't expecting much. I underestimated this chair.We got this for my wife, and she absolutely loves it. It’s comfortable, supportive, and looks great in our space. The footrest is a really nice bonus, and she’s actually been using it way more than we thought she would. The recline function is smooth, and she likes being able to lean back and relax for breaks at her hobby and work desk. The metal legs are very sturdy. Much better than plastic ones that tend to crack over time. Both arms are adjustable as well.Assembly was straightforward and didn’t take long, my wife did it herself. Once it was put together, it felt solid and well-built. The massage lumbar pillow was a pleasant surprise too, she uses it daily and says it helps with her lower back tension. It even has a USB power connection in the pillow with a vibrate function.She’s been using it for everything from work to gaming. Overall, this chair’s been a great buy. Would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable, supportive chair without breaking the bank."
