        "review": "I absolutely LOVE this chair!! It was easy for me to put together, and it suited my needs perfectly! For example; I've been needing a chair that would go high enough for me so that I am actually over my keyboard instead of typing beneath it. Also, it leans back and the chair part has a lip that keeps me from sliding out of the chair! It's easy to clean, the price was FANTASIC and I am a very, very happy camper over this purchase!"
