        "review": "Solid but not made to be abused. One of the most shocking things when receiving this product is its packaging. You think you bought something cheap when the reality is that everything is optimized so that you receive the best possible product for the price you paid. This chair is not fragile at all. Most of the construction is made of metal and plastic of good material, in addition to having an ingenious design to adjust the screws to have the best assembly with difficulty ratio. The screws are positioned in such a way that, although simple, it guarantees a pressure and sustainability higher than what you would expect for this price range. Of course, this is not made to be assembled quickly and with great force. It requires patience and \"craft\" when inserting the screws on the legs, the back of the chair and especially the arms. I give it a 7/10 for difficulty in assembling which, although it is simple, requires you to pay attention. Would you recommend this product to the most \"demanding\" ones? The answer is complex, but in my experience. Yes, if you want to treat your chair with due care so as not to shake yourself too much or have bad postures that the same instructions tell you to avoid for optimal use of the chair. A no, if what you are looking for is an ergonomic chair that can withstand the roughest of rough use. In short, great chair, packaging that is a bit scary but is a satisfying experience in the end. Highly recommended if you are in a financial pinch or if it is your first desk chair."
