    {
        "review": "This chair is comfortable. The last office chair I owned, the cushion had began to bottom out so I knew that I wanted to try a mesh chair instead. I was able to snag the B100 at a pretty good deal. Assembly was straight forward and all the nuts and bolts were clearly labeled with the included tools. I'm about 5'6'' at around 200 lbs and I can comfortably sit in this chair for +6 hours. If I really want, I can lean back in the chair and take a small nap in it. The arm rests are solid and I like the back support. I only wish I had gotten the version with the foot rest. Oh well. I recommend this chair to my friends and family and they generally agree with me."
