        "review": "I’m very happy with this office chair. It’s comfortable, supportive, and has plenty of adjustments to get the sitting position just right. The back support makes a big difference when sitting for several hours, and the chair feels sturdy and well built. Assembly was straightforward as well. Great chair for a home office and definitely worth it!"
