    {
        "review": "Bought this for my wife and she's been very happy with it. It was easy to put together, feels sturdy, and the pink color looks great. She says it's comfortable for long periods at her desk, and the adjustable features make it easy to find a good position. For the price, it exceeded our expectations. We'd definitely buy it again."
