    {
        "review": "I bought this gaming chair for my grandson! He is 14 years old snd absolutely loves it! It was originally ordered for his bedroom to sit at desk to do homework & watch tv. He claims it is so comfortable he could sleep on it! It has a padded head and footrest feels like suede.He looked at many this caught his eye and is pretty satisfied!! You will not go wrong with this chsir!"
