[
    {
        "review": "Looks great, assembly is really easy and straightforward without headache and has high quality overall. Only downside I did not like is that it’s not soft, rather really hard and uncomfortable to recline and lay back"
    },
    {
        "review": "Needed a new gaming chair, and looked this particular one up which had great written/video reviews. Was a little disappointed in how long it took to get it, but now that I'm sitting in it, it was worth the wait. I give it a 5-star because packaging, assembly and product as a whole is top notch in my opinion. Hope this review helps.Packaging: This chair comes somewhat pre-assembled in the box, and comes with the tool needed to put it together; no additional tools needed. When you open the box, there are a set of gloves provided immediately for putting the chair together and definitely helps prevent any paper/cardboard cuts.Assembly: Recommendation is 2 people to put this together, but even on my own I barely had any problem. I struggled slightly with connecting the top (back) and bottom (seat) halves with the screws since I soloed it, but other than that had no issues assembling it by myself. You can look up video instructions if you prefer, but it comes with a huge instruction print out making assembly go smoothly.Product: The chair is super comfortable at least to my standards. Would definitely buy this chair again in the future. I'm considering getting another one, but maybe in a different color this time.Weird Experience with Shipping: I ordered this chair on 2 Dec 24 when it still had a Black Friday/Cyber Monday sale price tag. It said it was out of stock and I would be notified and the chair would be shipped when it was available again. About a week or 2 after that, I had a notification that it was in stock and I would receive it between 9 - 29 Jan 25. However, my friend was looking for a new gaming chair and I suggested this one. He popped on Amazon, found this exact chair for the same sale price and ordered it on 20 Dec 24. He got his on 29 Dec 24 before me. Not sure why I got skipped in the queue for a chair and had to wait for it to arrive on 9 Jan 25. Small inconvenience and weird how that worked out, but just thought I share in case this happens/happened to anyone else."
    },
