        "review": "This is the Razer chair that you should get above all others.  Spend the extra 100 bucks from the Iskur and get the Enki.The cushion on this chair is amazing.  It is firm, but has just the right amount of cushion, as well as the right amount of give.  The fabric on this chair feels amazing.  Sitting in it in my underwear right now and the softness of the fabric on the back of my legs is superb.The back support of this chair is amazing.  The lumbar sits in exactly the correct spot.  The bolsters on the side of the chair don't exactly hold me in, but someone bigger than me would be nicely supported.  Upper back is very supported.I sat in this chair about 2 years ago.  Longed for this chair, even after sitting in high end office chairs at the office.Get this chair.  You will not regret it."
