        "review": "This backpack is absolutely amazing. I love how spacious it is without looking super bulky. It’s been perfect for a college student like me and its material is SO good. Not flimsy or thin, it’s very durable. I’ve had it for over a year and it still looks brand new. Definitely recommend."
