        "review": "Item showed up on time and as described"
    },
    {
        "review": "We have been using this black backpack for some time now and are absolutely satisfied. It is a real all-rounder and also looks quite chic and timeless. Use at school: The backpack offers enough space for notebooks, books and a tablet. The laptop/tablet compartment was particularly important to us: It is well padded so that the device is safely stowed away and does not slide back and forth in the main compartment. Even when heavily loaded, it can still be carried easily thanks to the comfortable shoulder straps.Leisure & Sports: After school it is sometimes used straight away for sports or other leisure activities. The design is simple enough to match any outfit, but robust enough to be worn on the sidelines. Even sports clothes and a drinking bottle can easily fit next to school supplies. Quality: The material appears to be durable and the zippers run smoothly without snagging. Since it is completely black, you can hardly see any dirt - and if something does happen to be on it, it can be easily wiped off. Conclusion: A great backpack for anyone who is looking for a reliable model for everyday use. It combines functionality (especially with the laptop compartment) with a modern look. Absolute purchase recommendation!"
    },
