[
    {
        "review": "To be fair, I am not using this monitor for gaming as it was marketed for. But the high resolution gives me more real estate on my desktop, which is what I need for my work computer. Text and graphics are both sharp and crisp, and everything works on my Mac M1 using the display port connection. There are no delays or flickering or dead pixels.  And most monitor stands can accommodate this 27 inch monitor with ease.I am very happy with how this monitor displays websites, spreadsheets, YouTube videos, and streaming videos.  The screen size and resolution have no problem, giving me multiple windows open simultaneously."
    },
    {
        "review": "I picked this up as a secondary monitor, and it has been a great addition to my desk setup. The image clarity is excellent. Text is sharp, colors are clean, and it is easy on the eyes even after long work sessions. For email, documents, spreadsheets, and keeping reference material open, it does exactly what I need without any fuss.The 27-inch size is perfect for a second screen, giving plenty of space without overwhelming the desk. Setup was quick, the stand is stable, and it paired seamlessly with my primary monitor. For the price, this is a very solid option if you want a clear, reliable secondary display."
    },
    {
        "review": "Eco friendly, anti-glare and anti-blur, the 27 inch Acer monitor was one of the best deals for our purpose. This screen has a full HD resolution (1920 × 1080). In general, monitors for screens display are TN, VA and IPS, which is the case of the Acer. The In Plane Switching is actually a LCD screen known for its superiorcolor accuracy, wide 178 degrees viewing angles, contrast (perfect for dark rooms), and response times as low as 1ms with refresh rates up to 1200 Hz via HDMI. This screen is the ideal choice for gaming or office task at a reasonable cost. One can hand it up on a wall, to save space for example (VESA wall mount compatible (100 × 100mm)), and it is tilt adjustable too (-5° to 25°). It was a good value quality/price and a good deal. Let's hope it will last a while."
    },
    {
        "review": "Its a great match for your Apple IMAC, works flawlessly, HD graphics, picture quality is excellent! Great price"
    },
    {
