[
    {
        "review": "I bought two of these monitors for my set up after upgrading from 1080 P. The refresh rate is very smooth and the HDR setting is very nice. The colors are true and the lighting is bright. I also enjoy the small borders around the monitor making it feel almost nonexistent. I really enjoy these monitors and would recommend them to anybody as they’re a decent price for what you get."
