        "review": "Really really good monitor. Works absolutely perfectly fine. For the budget, it is really good on the Refresh rate, and specially the resolution. I know many top quality monitors prefer the 1920x1080p resolution. But this 2560x1440p actually makes a really good difference in a better way."
