        "review": "This is the best monitor I’ve ever owned and it looks great and is easy to use with the monitor having 5 separate buttons for controlling it and a clean OSD that makes sure everything is intuitive and easy to use. Mounting it is also super easy granted you have the proper vesa mount but even without it I’m sure there’s a way to use a regular TV mount. It’s can get super bright or dim and looks to be decently durable for a monitor but I wouldn’t test that and it’s easy to adjust and has a .3 ms response time. Great monitor and I got it and the new monitor arm within a day after ordering."
