[
    {
        "review": "This insulated water bottle is amazing! I am so happy I purchased it, and decided to keep it.  I love that has three different ways to carry it, the extra drinking lid, extra compartments on the carrier and how easy it is to remove from the case.  The color is exactly what I wanted.  The straw stays attached for continuous drinking. Some bottles I’ve had, the straw constantly fell off.  It’s been 14 hours so far and the beverage is still cold.  I’m very happy with this purchase!"
    },
    {
        "review": "What are the best purchases I've ever made, love this. Living in Arizona it's always hot just keeps my dreams cold for days I've had ice last for 2 days it has two option fruit heads a flip mouthpiece with a straw in the lid that just unscrews off it has d-rings to clip it to your belt loop and a paracord that's very strong and very well made I'm always sharing mine by the Paracord. Not only is it an insulator container it comes with a zip up padded cover that also installation even more. It comes in multiple sizes from extra large 86 Oz and down"
    },
    {
        "review": "Fabulous water bottle!  Great to handle, holds a ton of water and keeps it cold!  Took it to an outdoor event that was HOT and it really worked.  Easy to clean and came with options for carrying and drinking.  Lots of color options too.  Don’t hesitate to buy this!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Awesome. And it does hold the ice and keep things cold on my 12 hr shift.The rope is also nice to lug it around. 10/10 recommend."
    },
    {
        "review": "I love this water bottle so much! It has a paracord handle on it, with a little compass, which my kid loved, and a detachable strap for carrying. The neoprene cover unzips at the bottom for easy cleaning and it comes with a straw mouthpiece and one that you just drink like a bottle. The cover also has little rings and pockets, so I can see it being super handy as he gets older. Lol might also make a great \"purse\" if you're into a minimal feel. It came with a pretty good quality scrubber brush to reach down inside also."
    },
    {
        "review": "It’s great, I work outside on hot summer days and it keeps my water cold with ice through the long work days.. most of the time the water tends to last me all day but sometimes I need to leave and go refill it so it’s a 50/50 on capacity depending on how much water you tend to drink and if you have easy access to refill. I like the protection sleeve, appearance is great.. doesn’t leak. The only issues I would say is that when I received it the compass was missing but I don’t really care about that bit, I’ve had it for probably about 3 months now and since I’ve had it, the clasp with the rope handle has broke but to be fair it gets pretty beat up within work. I have no issues and I would probably buy again"
    },
    {
        "review": "I've had this for one day & I already love it. On a 108 degree day, I filled this to the top with ice & never needed to add more. By the end of a 10 hr shift, there was still enough ice filling at least a quarter of the bottle. The bottle itself seems pretty durable. The option of lids is nice but I don't have any use for straws so I stick with the flip top that screws down so it won't accidentally open. Color scheme looks good too. The carry bag is nice too, giving you 4 ways to carry it as well as one extra layer of insulation. And if you just want the bottle without anything on it, all accessories are removable. Although a little effort might be needed to put them back around the neck. We'll see how well everything holds up over time but I'm really happy with this purchase."
    },
    {
        "review": "Absolutely LOVE this bottle! I got a metal one because I add DoTerra essential oils in my water and my old plastic jug wasn't the ideal thing for using citrus oils. It comes with two lid options for your preference, is super durable (I drop it a LOT), the grip handle is easy to grab and strong, doesn't hurt your hand, and it only leaks if I dont close the straw all the way. This thing keeps my water cold literally all day even when it sits in the car!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I love my bottle! The colour and quality is amazing! Seems easy to clean as well.The problem? I'm missing the straws, which is kind of a dealbreaker since I only drink from that type of mouth, the other one is useless to me. It also didn't come with the straw or bottle cleaners, that bothers me less since I have some already.I'd really like to not return this and somehow just get the missing items (Mostly the straws.)---Review of actual product:Gosh darn is this thing HEAVY! I wasn't expecting it. But the quantity lasts me 12 hours just fine. I'm considering the extra weight an excuse to get a workout for my arms, haha, but if you have any type of disability, you might want to consider a smaller size. My stronger and taller friend uses their gifted bottle just fine, they also say they really like it.This one (128oz) doesn't fit in my backpack, which is a shame, but oh well. It can also be a struggle to fill it all the way, depending on what you get your water from. I can do it to the top, my friend can only get 8/10ths unless he wants to use a separate cup to scoop the rest of the water in.The colour is beautiful, the clips and bands seem sturdy, I got a stain on the sleeve, and it washed out with just a dab of water. The mouth is wide enough to pour ice in, and it keeps the same temperature forever!---Edit: The seller contacted me quickly and helped me find a solution, they were very concise and answered all of my questions. I will say, there seems to be a problem with quality control, I think sometimes bottles get sent back, and they can miss any damages/missing items because of that.I bought another bottle and this one had a black smudge on the sleeve I couldn't wash out, it's not a dealbreaker for me, but so far 2 of the 3 bottles had some error. The only reason I'm keeping it at five stars despite that is because of their customer service being 10/10 and the quality of the product being the same."
    },
    {
        "review": "This water bottle is a AMAZING purchase it comes with 2 straws 2 lids one with a sipping part. And the other with somthing to pour with. It was very high quality material. And a very convenient travel case that sits flush around the whole bottle. The bottle it's self is very sleek and nice looking with multiple anchor points to put your keys or lanyards whatever you need this water bottle will hold it. The travel pouch itself has a phone holder great for cards credit cards maps when hiking just very convenient. Has a paracord handle to hold very sturdy. When the carrier pouch is on it also comes with a shoulder strap you can put on the carrier pouch to hold it even more comfortably😆 the plastic is bpa free in case you care about that and also the carrier pouch has a zipper on the bottle for easy removing. I'm very happy with the 52$ I spent on this im sure you would be 2 keeps water cold forever!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I love this product. I didn't take a picture of the strap that it comes with because I leave it near the front door for when I'm heading out. This is ideal for people like me who need to be drinking more water but can't really keep track and maybe too lazy to go to the sink many times over the day. If I drink one complete container then I know I've got my water for the day came with a lot of accessories really handy. Especially the brush to clean the inside. If I put cold water in in the morning it's still pretty cold by the end of the day which is excellent. The outside cover is easy to clean and comes off pretty easily. I don't think there's much you could put in the little pockets they're pretty tight and wouldn't fit a phone or anything like that.I'd say the color isn't as vibrant as it is on the image but it's still orange and it's still yellow and it's close enough. I always assume there's a little enhancement done when they take these photos."
    },
    {
        "review": "Perfect for camping, sporting events and if you have a home office.  It is heavy to carry around as your daily water source.  Keeps your water cold!  I use it in my home office and love it."
    },
    {
        "review": "Husband works a job where he needs a large bottle due to a lack of constant fresh water. He says that it's durable, doesn't feel too bulky, and likes the carrying choices. I like the cleaning tools it comes with, as it makes our lives easier."
    }
]

[
    {
        "review": "I purchased the STANLEY Quencher H2.0 (30 oz) in Rose Quartz 2.0 and it has exceeded my expectations.Keeps drinks cold: It keeps water ice-cold for hours, making it perfect for car rides or keeping at my desk while working or studying.Smart design: The tapered base fits easily into standard car cup holders, and the handle is super comfortable to hold.Lid and straw: The FlowState lid is very versatile, and the straw works great.Aesthetic: The soft pink color is gorgeous and feels durable and high quality.Definitely worth the investment—100% recommended!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I finally got a Stanley tumbler, and I completely understand why so many people love it. The quality is excellent, and it performs even better than I expected.One of my favorite things is how well it keeps my drinks at the right temperature. I usually fill it with warm water before work, and after an 8-hour workday, it’s still pleasantly warm. I no longer have to keep reheating my water, which is a huge plus.I’ve also noticed that I’m drinking a lot more water since getting this tumbler. Having such a large capacity and a comfortable handle makes it easy to keep with me all day, whether I’m at my desk or on the go.The color is what really won me over. I absolutely love it! It’s even more beautiful in person than it appears in the product photos. The finish is gorgeous, and I’ve already received several compliments on it.Overall, this is an amazing tumbler that’s stylish, functional, and built to last. It keeps drinks at the perfect temperature for hours, encourages me to stay hydrated, and looks fantastic. I couldn’t be happier with this purchase!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Bought this for my daughter as a ten year olds birthday request. She wanted pink or purple in 32 or 40oz that’s it but being me, I figure she needed some stuff to go with it 😆! It was $45 for the 40oz Peony Pink color. I thought the lilac was also gorgeous but this pink stood out so strongly and in stores they only carry the hot pink 40oz that has an orange logo on it. I don’t think it’s as attractive as the one o bought and I don’t think she enjoys orange either. It’s sturdy and sleek and comfortable in the hands. The screws were standing out so heavily as fine quality upon notice. No scratches or scuff. Super clean. No Oder!!! Thank God!!! I hate strong oders. It does have gaps where you can easily see it’ll leak if it’s full and you tip it over but being the dad that I am i bought the stoppers as well and they fit so snug. Could still leak but it’s not supposed to be upside down so like… who cares? And seriously you really have to work hard at getting it in a position that causes it to leak. The stoppers I bought for snuggly so I’m very satisfied with the leak stoppers I bought on Amazon, I left a video of the before and after installing them in the other sellers review section. I would know how to link this one to that one but hope you find it and that it helps. But if you don’t buy the stoppers, Honestly get over it nothing is literally perfect except Jesus so just enjoy the cup, it’s phenomenal even without the stoppers. The stainless steel or titanium is what it actually looks like is superb by the look and the feel!!!  The pink paint is gorgeous!!! Taylor Swift probably made that song about this Stanley 🤷🏾‍♂️ I seriously wouldn’t be surprised. I have no cons for you honestly. It’s a wonderful buy and I get it now why she wanted one and why my girl friend also desires a Stanley. I really questioned why that brand of all brands like it’s just a cup, like it’s not that serious?! 🧐 but low and behold! Boy! It is that serious and for the price amazing and again, I could not find this color anywhere in the real world. So thanks Amazon! Thanks to the seller and thank you Jesus we have the internet and apps that make life easier for everyday day citizens like you dear reader who took the time out to read my long winded commentaries 😂. Hope this and the pics and videos help you making your decision. I’m fully intending to buy one for myself in some bold manly color if I can find one.If your worried if it’s fake or not, you can compare them to the others online:#1 Screws are located underneath the handle and are aligned well. Using the same metal as the inside of the drinking canister which is really think is titanium and not stainless steel actually. Because it’s definitely superior grade quality. Trust me you’ll know the difference looking inside it 😆#2 the straw comes in the cup already with no separate packaging and is the same semi-cloudy tone as the upper lip of the cup and is not totally transparent or translucent.#3 the inner canister of the metal bottom will have an etched in recycled sign at the very bottom.#4 the Lion logo on bottom of cup.#5 the Lion logo on upper half of the cup will be about an inch or so from the lip of the cup while a fake will be two to three inches lower, much further from the lip of the cup.#6 the top of the cup handle will be super close to the top of the stainless steel part while a fake will be noticeably further from the top of the top (like inches or so away from the lip of the cup).So this one is real! And I highly recommend it!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Hi there, this is a review of the Stanley Quencher H2.0 Flow State Tumbler, 40 oz in the color Pomelo. It's great size for the price I paid for it. It keeps my drinks cold and even colder when ice is added. Shipping was not in issue. It arrived on time and in perfect condition. The 40 oz tumbler fits perfectly in my car cup holder, and did I mention that I love the color. I travel for work, so it is great for on-the-go travelers such as myself.  Overall great quality and I truly enjoy the handle because my husband can also use it if he needs to too."
    },
    {
        "review": "I have a few ofthe 40 oz Stanley Quenchers, but the cups are pretty heavy on their own. When you add the water, the cups get pretty heavy.They are great for when you want to go out for the day and you really need a lot of water, but when I’m at home and have access to my filtered refrigerator water, I don’t really need that big of a water cup. So, I ordered the 30 ounce and I think it’s really the perfect size.  It keeps ice for well over 24 hours., So your drink stay nice and cold. Idrive a Honda CRV and it fits really well in my cupholder because of the tapered bottom. I also love the color!  I can see myself adding to my Stanley collection!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I have two Stanleys, my first one was a creamy white, and this one is black.  Even though I had had the first one for several months, I purchased this black chroma one right before Christmas two years ago.  My mother knew that I had wanted a Stanley for Christmas and also purchased me this same tumbler (I had asked her to get it, but forgot that I had asked her).  I had to return the one I purchased and kept the Christmas present from my mother.  Both tumblers, the black one and the white one have held up extremely well over a two year span.  The drinks are kept cold for an exceptionally long time.  My only complaint about Stanley tumblers have been that the straw leaks if you tip it in both the black and white versions that I have.  I do see that Stanley does have non-leaky versions of lid that come with other items of theirs.  I have also used competitor brand lids if I want to go anywhere other than the usual places.  It's a beautiful thing that competitor lids do fit my Stanley tumblers. I really enjoy the fact that with the black tumbler it's hard to tell if it's dirty.  I am always using one of my Stanleys on a daily basis, so I'm sure I would purchase this item again if needed and I would recommend this item to my family."
    },
    {
        "review": "To be honest, now the Stanley trend is over. I feel like the quality has gone down a little bit. Although this is my 1st cup, I do feel that it was not as high-quality feeling as I was expecting. I feel like the handle could be a little bit more dense plastic, and the cup itself could be a little bit heavier, the flowers look a little blurry, but I believe that is because of the material they used to print them on so that you could put it in the dishwasher, which I appreciate I do highly highly highly highly recommend getting a boot for this cup. If it falls, it’s super easy to scuff and it also helps keep it from getting dented with normal wear and tear. it’s a very pretty cup and I get a lot of compliments on it. I also would recommend getting some extra straws since I find the one that comes with gets a little bit gunked up with use. I also did not find it to be completely leak proof I knocked it over a couple days ago and it spilled a bit, but it didn’t like gush everywhere. It is comfortable to hold in my hands and I do feel that it keeps things cold for a good long time as long as you put enough ice in there, I don’t really drink warm stuff too often so I’m not sure how long it will keep something warm, but I imagine it would also be good. Just based on how well it keeps things cold overall I’d recommend just waiting until it goes on sale or using your cashback to purchase. It’s definitely expensive for what it is, but it’s very cute makes me happy and I use it every day"
    },
    {
        "review": "My baby after my hydro flask of 5 years dented its way to not be able to stand I bought her. Soooo easy to clean and take apart. Keeps drinks freezing for long periods of time. Not to mention I love the color and style. I’ve dropped it and no scratches or dents so far so good durability. I love how the straw is clear but not like a cheap plastic. It fits in my cars cup holders. Would buy again!!!"
    },
    {
        "review": "The glass is beautiful and very good quality, just like in the photo, I bought the smallest size there is. I give it 4 stars because I think it is too expensive, otherwise perfect"
    },
    {
        "review": "Excellent thermos, it is worth the investment, due to the size you can bring water during the day and maintain the same temperature without problem, I would definitely buy it again."
    },
    {
        "review": "At this expensive price the packaging super BAD. The product did not come with its own box and it looked like a package that came from a startup from a local store only wrapped in amazon’s bubble wrap gray plastic. On the inside I received a scratched product, the metal powdered coating was scratched and the handle also was scratched. Had there been its own box then this would not happen. I totally do not recommend this product. There are better products that do the same function at 10% of this premium price. Total money wasted"
    },
    {
        "review": "The orange is really bright, hard to miss it. You can keep ice in it over night without problem"
