[
    {
        "review": "These are the best water bottles, in my opinion.  They are the perfect size and the perfect circumference so you can grab them easily and they are not too big.  I have been using them for years and something always seems to happen to my bottle - friends want them, kids want them, my latest 'lost' bottle was confiscated at the airport cause I had water in it !!  I have never had one of them leak or wear out.  And a huge variety of colors, too.  Easy to clean with the bottle brush and holds up very well in the dishwasher.  Love them !!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Favorite water bottle of all time. Very smooth flow while drinking, thanks to the little air hole. Love how it's so slim for a high capacity bottle, so it's never an issue fitting into cup holders. It also locks if needed. Very smartly designed water bottle. No issues with any leaks or anything like that. Holding band is sturdy. I don't think it's durable though, since my last one cracked from falling like 1 foot onto the floor. But it was such a good bottle in all the other aspects that I bought another."
    },
    {
        "review": "This water bottle is exactly what I was hoping to find to help me keep up with hydration during my pregnancy. I normally use straw tumblers, but found I wasn’t getting nearly enough as it took longer to drink and I felt I was getting more than I was. I’d headed out to a few stores in town to try and find one that fit my needs, but was unable to find one like this without a straw style spout.This chug style bottle is perfect for me as it has no straw and it has a smaller spout so that it’s not pouring out on my face while I sip in bed during the night. It’s a traditional tip to drink style bottle and I love the meter on the side to help cheer me on and assure me how much water I’m drinking each day. It comes in a variety of bright, fun colors. I chose the one with teal/pink and love the color mix even more in person. This bottle has two methods built in to carry it along where you go. The first is the nylon strap attached permanently via a plastic ring at the neck and then there’s also a flip up handle on top of the lid. When comparing this style to a few others, I ultimately chose this one as the lid covers the entire mouthpiece where you sip, as well as the whole top. Others I’d seen only covered the spout or didn’t look nearly as cute.Overall I’m very happy with this bottle, the low cost, ombré colors, the clear teal color on the lid, the ability to lock the lid in place with a quick flip up motion on the button, carry it around in a variety of ways and I even loved the smallest detail they added of a tiny bead of teal added to the open button. The printed measurements also seem very durable and do not scratch off when I tested them. It also came with extra silicone seal parts and a soft sponge bottle cleaner, which was a super nice addition so as not to scratch it when washing. 10/10 would recommend."
    },
    {
        "review": "Mostly really like this water bottle. I've got a \"love-hate\" with the lid. The good part is that you can secure it with a little closure to keep it from leaking, but that same plastic piece juts out of the lid so when you go to drink from it your lip hits the hard plastic. I've never had that on any other bottles, so it just took some learning to adjust the angle from which I was drinking to make it comfortable. The soft outer part of the bottle that has the beautiful colors can chip away as I only had it a short time and a mysterious little spot is missing on part, but not a big deal. Contrary to the title advertised I do occasionally get it splashing/leaking water when I go to drink sometimes. Not sure how or why. I do like the carrying strap most of the time, but when you go to clean the bottle with soap and water you cannot detach the strap (that I'm aware of!). I covered it with a Ziplock bag to keep it from getting wet and just carefully cleaned it. Besides that, it's a good size, and fits in cupholders (not as snuggly as I'd like, but it stays put), and the colors are pleasing to the eye, and I like the variety of choices. The bottle has that soft \"velvety\" feel, and the top springs open quickly."
    },
    {
        "review": "I was looking for a few things in my next water bottle  - that it can hold more than 20 oz, does not have a built-in straw, has a wide mouth opening for easy cleaning and a small spout for drinking. Ideally, it can also fit in a cup holder. This bottle checks all of those boxes and more!This bottle actually came with a soft foam sponge that can easily clean this bottle (and I suspect some other vessels I was having a hard time cleaning!) - the ability to clean the bottle is a huge concern. The reason you don't want to reuse a disposable bottle is because they are impossible to clean and bacteria can breed easily inside them.The size is relatively slim for an over 30 oz bottle - I haven't put it in my cupholder yet, but I'll be shocked if it doesn't fit. I've been using some bottles over 40oz in gym classes and they are all much thicker than this bottle, which makes it harder for me to grip and drink when needed and means my bottle is usually flying all over the car. This bottle should fit nicely in a pocket in my work bag, the other bottles would not have even come close.Speaking of putting it in my bag - this bottle has a little lock mechanism to keep the bottle from suddenly opening on you - It's plastic and cheap and will likely break easily, but it adds just a little peace of mind if it's going to be tossed into a bag - I've had several bottles leak in my lunch bag and I'm sure that won't be a problem with this bottle.This bottle even comes with replacement silicone pieces. Not only is it a great find today, it is fixable (provided I dont' lose the pieces, but I suspect the silicone elements will be misplaced long before I might use them to replace the original components. Still, I'm glad it was included, I'm hoping that it won't be needed anytime soon, but grateful to have them just in case."
    },
    {
        "review": "I bought this water bottle for my son for school. It is a very nice water bottle. It has a very soft feel to it. Very sturdy. Easy to use and drink out of and doesn’t leak. Perfect size for my son for every day use at school on these hot days. I like that it has a ring on to top to be able to hang on a hook and has an arm strap as well to hold on the wrist while having your hands free for holding other things. The colors are vibrant and very good looking. It is a great water bottle to use at schools that have rules with restrictions with water bottles. I would recommend this water bottle for kids and adults."
    },
    {
        "review": "Awesome for hiking. Wrist strap is strong and made carrying it easy. It also fit easily in the side pocket of our back pack. It is hand wash only. But easy to wash by hand as it comes with its own bottle cleaning sponge with handle."
    },
    {
        "review": "This is a decent bottle. My issue is with the brush that is advertised also. The brush is too short, the handle does not reach the top of the bottle while inside making it useless for cleaning the 33oz bottle. My wife had bought this same bottle a while back and that handle will extend in length. This handle does not."
    },
    {
        "review": "value for money, good size for holding water, no leakage, good durability and a good grip, easy to drink out of."
    },
    {
        "review": "excellent bottle, the cap is super comfortable and closes so that when you put it perhaps in your bag or backpack it doesn't leak or open, it washes very well with the brush that is supplied, beautiful color the same as you can see in the photo"
    },
    {
        "review": "I really love this water bottle! One of my favorite things about it is that it actually makes me want to drink more water throughout the day. I've noticed a real difference in how much water I'm drinking since I started using it.It comes in tons of cute colors, and my favorite is the bubblegum color. It's such a fun color and looks really nice. The bottle itself also feels very sturdy, so I don't have to worry about it breaking easily with everyday use.The strap is another really handy feature. It makes it much easier to carry around, especially when I'm out. I think this would be great for both kids and adults.It's also pretty easy to clean, which is definitely important for a water bottle that gets used every day.Overall, this is a great combination of cute and practical. It's sturdy, easy to carry, easy to clean, and most importantly, I've definitely been drinking more water since I got it!"
    }
]

[
    {
        "review": "I've tried several water bottles over the years, and this is hands-down my favorite! The handle makes it easy to carry. It doesn't leak at all. And it keeps water cold for hours. There is a LOCK position so the top can't accidentally flip open. It holds plenty of water, and fits in a car cup-holder easily. Since I only use it for water and don't share it, I haven't tested it in the dishwasher yet. The straw works really well and it's very easy to drink from.One caution - DO NOT put any carbonated beverages in it!  In a group setting at a camp, someone drank all my regular water and the only water was flavored & bubbly, so I poured that in, forgetting the caution in the directions.  Luckily, I didn't wait too long before I tried to open it, because it almost wouldn't open. Somehow the carbon dioxide bubbles lock it up!This is a WINNER, and so many colors to choose from, too!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I am obsessed with w/ the sway, I bought Daybreak/ Fig, they are gorgeous, the bottle design is sleek as well highly functional. It is matte vs  shiny the bottle isn’t slippery in hand, & there are different sizes to choose from.  It fits into my cupholders, it also fits into my couch cupholders, & have the 30 oz. I will be buying more for me as well for gifts as EVERYONE deserves to fall in love w/ this water bottle!  Oh, I have not talked about the lid functionality and I left the best for last because I never thought I would love love love the sip straw part as much as I do the chug part is very good as well. They’re right kind of like right next to each other, but you can definitely tell the straw area versus the chug area. I don’t usually use a chug type mouthpiece , but I did try it out because well it’s there and it’s very nice as well. With other brands, you either have a straw straight up you have a straw you have to flip up and this is more practice.  The sealing is  awesome,  I tested ice in the bottle and I put it in  @ noon 8/21/26 &  it’s 653am 8/22/26 and my water is cold with a lot of ice. I wanted to test it out because I know there’s some mixed reviews. I myself do not use ice in my drinks. I just use cold water so the ice retention for me is really not huge on whether I buy a bottle or not.. and let’s face it if you put water and ice into any water bottle you’re gonna have some weight, but I don’t think it’s that heavy and I have arthritis and some other issues. I love the handle on the sway. I don’t usually like cups that have the side handle. I just find those to be bulky, but I love the handle on the sway because even though I have small hands, sometimes I have to carry it versus putting it into my bag because I have a lot of things as being a teacher if you know you know. So I’m an advocate for cleaning your entire bottle and when I say entire bottle I mean take the little part and I don’t like 1 million gazillion pieces and I’m one that’s very thorough. I don’t just take a little brush through it. I take the seals off I take my watch a video first on it on TikTok and then because sometimes I don’t know how to clean the bottle lid and then of course I repeat that and I find this one to be extremely easy to clean even the piece that sits in the lid. I don’t know depend on the color you get mine is gray. I will just pop that out, clean it with the brush clean it however let it dry then put it all back together so you don’t get any type of mold because any water bottle you have you’re gonna have mold if you don’t clean your bottle and again I love this bottle and I did purchase it with my own money as I have no deal with them at all I’m not even vine reviewer( I wish)."
    },
    {
        "review": "This is a wonderful water bottle! I love the gulp or sip part the best , cuz I didn't want to always use either one, ALL the time! This way I can decide on the spot, whatever the circumstances, which to use!! Win/win for me!! And drinks stay cold for a looonng time!! (I haven't timed it yet but it's long!!)It's easy to carry, not as heavy as I expected, and is a very fun color (I got the one that looks like a watermelon!). So now I truly am an Owala lover! Never had one before but it won't be my last one!!My best purchase for the year so far!!!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Loved it it has a lock which is convenient and doesn’t spill the color is beautiful just as described it’s like a black cherry !!! Comes in its original packaging it’s so easy  to carry it and also fits in my cars cup holder. Highly recommended this Owala!!! Got  a lot of compliments on it the first time I used it it fit my outfit perfectly!!!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I love this water bottle for many reasons.  It checks off all of my requirements!  My list was particular and I didn’t think I’d find exactly what I wanted.The body is stainless steel and is quite sturdy, it keeps my water cold for about 24 hours and the 30 oz. size is perfect. It’s neither too big nor too small. It fits in my car’s cup holder, has a convenient carry handle, features a lock and unlock switch, has a dual spout with a straw and also a regular spout to drink out of, the mouthpiece is covered by a pop up lid that opens at the press of a button and protects the mouth area from dirt and germs. Last but not least is the pretty color. I bought the Out of the Blue color.Durable, sturdy, leakproof, easy to clean. The lid, straw and gaskets are dishwasher safe. The bottle itself should be hand washed so the finish doesn’t get ruined in a dishwasher.One point to consider is that this bottle is for cold liquids only, not for use with hot beverages. It’s by far the best water bottle I’ve had because it has so many great features.  Since it’s easy to carry around by the handle, I am finding myself taking it wherever I go in the house and I’m actually drinking more water because of it!Try it and you’ll fall in love with it just like I did!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Love, love. Love this Owalla water bottle! It’s big enough to supply my needs and the body has flat side., just a tiny indented surface that makes it much easier to hold. I enjoy the sipping it allows so the beverage doesn’t come in an uncontrollable flow. With that you get a face wash ! But the open top allows for larger portions faster on days you’re really hot. I like the style of the bottle and the colors to choose from are so varied and stylish. In using this bottle it performs beautifully in keeping my beverage cold, even on the beach. I highly recommend this item👍‼️"
    },
    {
