    {
        "review": "I’ve been using this tumbler every day, and I’m really happy with it. The soft pink color is even prettier in person, and the matte finish gives it a premium feel. The handle is comfortable to hold, and it fits in my car’s cup holder, which is a huge plus.It keeps my water cold for hours, and I love the large capacity because I don’t have to refill it constantly throughout the day. The lid feels sturdy, it’s easy to clean, and I haven’t experienced any leaking during normal use.Overall, it’s practical, stylish, and well made. I would definitely purchase another one in a different color."
    },
    {
        "review": "Love love love. This is my second hydrojug. It’s the best water bottle on the market in my opinion. It doesn’t leak, has a straw, you can twist the lid on in two different spots so the handle and straw are set for left or right handed folks, it fits in cup holders, there’s a grip on the base and it’s a beautiful color! Overly engineered in the best way possible haha. I drop it all the time and so does my toddler and it’s very durable. Only problem is that it can be difficult to unscrew the top sometimes. But that’s okay because I love being able to throw it in a bag, my car passenger seat or the base of a stroller without a second thought. Get yourself one, it’s worth the money!"
