[
    {
        "review": "I've been very happy with this Stanley Quick Flip GO bottle. It keeps my water cold for hours, and the quick-flip lid is convenient for drinking on the go. The bottle is completely leak-proof, easy to carry, and fits nicely in my car's cup holder. It's also durable and easy to clean. Great quality and perfect for work, the gym, or everyday use. Highly recommend!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I purchased this water bottle in January 2026 and have been using it regularly at work ever since. Overall, I've been very happy with it.The biggest positives for me are that it is truly leakproof and does an excellent job keeping drinks cold throughout the day. I've never had an issue with leaks, even when transporting it to and from work, and my drinks stay cold for hours.The flip-top lid has worked well, and I haven't experienced any problems with it over several months of use. It's also very easy to clean, which is something I appreciate in a water bottle that gets frequent use.The only thing worth mentioning is that it doesn't quite fit the cup holder in my 2019 Volvo XC60. That's not a dealbreaker for me, but if cup-holder compatibility is important to you, it's something to check before purchasing.Overall, this has been a reliable, well-made bottle that performs exactly as I hoped it would. I would definitely buy it again."
    },
    {
        "review": "Great water bottle! My Stanley keeps my drinks cold for hours and is very sturdy. I like the design, the handle makes it easy to carry, and it fits well in my cup holder. It’s perfect for work, travel, or everyday use. I would definitely recommend it!"
    },
    {
        "review": "These are the best Stanleys in my opinion. I like the easy open touch top for quick drinking. I also like that It latches shut for easy travel. I work with children so I appreciate the spill proof ability of this bottle. This keeps hot drinks hot and cold drinks cold even in extreme temperatures. I have left hot tea in a cold car (well below zero) while shopping all day and it is still hot by evening! I have also left ice in there on a 100 degree day outside in the sun and still have ice left the next day! Love these!"
    },
    {
        "review": "This bottle is perfect. It's so easy to open it to take a drink (just hit a button, no need to unscrew anything), you can lock it closed, it doesn't leak, and it keeps my water cold for the entire workday"
    },
    {
        "review": "Stanley is a trusted company of mine for years. Way back when I worked construction. 30 years later I still know that I'm getting quality product. If you want the best, do yourself a favor and pick up one. Works as advertised, I fill it up with ice cubes and water and still ice cold the next morning."
    },
    {
        "review": "4 and a 1/2 stars...Stanley quality in every way. Durable finish, clean stainless steel, no chintzy parts.This lid is not my favorite Stanley makes, but it's not terrible either. It has a spring so it does stay open as you sip. It does tap you on the forehead very lightly. But it's not like my no-name that I had to hold open as I sipped. That one kept my drinks cold, but the finish got scratched so easily and you had to exercise a lot of manual dexterity to hold it from landing on your nose as you took a drink - Annoying!I recently bought ice ball makers. The ice balls are 2.5 inches in diameter. Provided I give it a few minutes to thaw they'll fit. But I think the molds that make the 1.9\" ice balls will not need a few minutes to shrink minutely.  I don't use this Stanley for hot beverages, so can't speak to that.The lid is fairly simple and easy to keep clean and sanitary. The little metal handle on the back is a plus.I have a silicone boot on the bottom of mine to protect it from any potential dents or dings (heavens, no!)"
    },
    {
        "review": "I've been using this bottle for a few months now and I can't say enough good things about it!I've been having some health issues and need to keep myself hydrated, and can't stand warm water... I had another bottle that required the lid to fully screw off, which was ok, except the ice would melt halfway through the day and on long days my water would get warm (yuck!). This Stanley bottle not only keeps my water cold all day, there's usually a good amount of ice still in it when I get home.I love the 'quick open,' just hit the button and the lid pops up, ready to drink from, and the locking mechanism is nice also, so I don't accidentally pop it open. At 24oz, it's perfect for a 16.9oz bottle of water and enough ice to last all day. While it was twice the price of the other one I had ($25 vs. $12), it was well worth the money!!If anything happens to the one I have, I wouldn't hesitate to replace it with the same thing!!!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I love these water bottles! We have 4 in total, and we've given them as gifts to several people too!Ice will last for nearly 2 days in these bottles, keeping your water nice and cold for h-o-u-r-s. The lids fit securely and do not leak, ever. They close well, and have the additional feature of a small flip wire-type thing that ensure the push-button opening won't trigger on accident. Even without that feature, the closure is very secure.The water bottles are weighty and a good size. The quality is excellent. This size (24oz.) fits perfectly in car cupholders - at least they do in ours (Subaru Outback).My only improvement suggestions would be to have a silicone grip, both for hand grip, and on the base of the water bottle. I have small hands, so I can be a bit dropsy with it (not at all a lot, I am just kinda clumsy - and on that front, even though I've dropped mine a few times, there's been no dings, dents, or damage of any kind). As well, they can be a bit slide-y on hard surfaces.Overall, though, love this product! (And I've tested so many water bottles over the years, my god! 🤣)"
    },
    {
        "review": "Size was ideal for travel in bag item."
    },
    {
        "review": "I had my doubts since it did not arrive with any protection or wrapping. After that I checked it and the lid looks like it doesn't fit well, however I think it is because of the packaging but even so it doesn't spill any liquids. It's 700ml, it's a bit long but easy to transport, it keeps things cold well, it arrived to me in just 1 day, it's very pretty and the best at a great price! I know that at that price I will not get a thermos from this brand again. I'll take it for my KickBoxing classes. 🤗"
    }
]

[
    {
        "review": "This bottle hits all of the criteria for greatness. It is BPA-free, I can see through it to see how much water I drank, it is labeled clearly and with big writing to indicate how much water is left and where I should be time-wise in having drank water for the day. Like most water bottles, it has a flip top dust cover and it is easily lockable so no water spills out. Unlike some water bottles, it has an extra hole at the top under the dust cover that lets out air so that you don't drink a bunch of air with your water. Unlike most water bottles, it has two handy ways to hold the bottle. It has both a hard loop on top for folk like me who hold the bottle with one finger (that makes it easy to set the bottle down, unlike with the cloth strap that it also provides which otherwise can be a nice way to carry it too. It easily fits into any car or standard cupholder. It is dishwasher friendly (though make sure the strap is captured on the bottom level of the dishwasher (like looping it around a fork) so that it doesn't get burned. If you're wondering about glass bottles, I've bought them too, but these are lighter, a bit shorter, and you don't have to worry about breaking them if you drop them. Also, the glass water bottles don't tend to have all of the features described above. Last, I like that it offers multiple colors, as in drinking my 64 oz/day, I use one color to signify my first bottle and the other to signify my second because I used to forget if I'd had one or two bottles in any given day. In short, I have bought many water bottles, and this is the best of them all! It's also cheap - well priced for the value."
    },
    {
        "review": "This has become my everyday water bottle. The motivational time markers help me stay on track with my water intake, and the 32-ounce size is perfect because it doesn't feel too heavy to carry around. I like that it's leakproof, easy to clean, and has a comfortable carrying strap for taking it to work or on the go. It's sturdy, practical, and has held up really well. If you're trying to drink more water each day, I definitely recommend it."
    },
    {
        "review": "Awesome water bottle! Here are the features I love:-Skinny, so it fits in my car's cup holder and it's easy to grip.-Has a filter piece to keep ice (or lemons, limes, tea bags, etc.) from getting through.-Has an easy to open lid (lockable to prevent leaks) with a drinking spout (perfect amount of water comes through to drink).-Has a carrying handle that I can put around my wrist which makes the water bottle very portable.-I bought the clear version and it looks great.-Has fl oz and ml on one side, and has time indicators (and encouraging phrases) for reminders to drink on the other side -- really helps with hydration!-I purchased it for $9.99 which is very affordable.One thing to keep in mind:-Not dishwasher safe -- hand wash only with a scrubbing brush.This water bottle has made hydration more convenient and fun for me. I highly recommend it!"
    },
    {
        "review": "This is a great water bottle! The 32-ounce size helps me stay hydrated throughout the day, and the motivational time markers make it easy to track my water intake. It is lightweight, easy to carry, and the lid keeps it from leaking. Excellent quality for the price!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Best water bottle ever! I dislike metal, so this is a perfect fit for me. Safe plastic with a quick flip lid. Didn't really need a ice cube guard or measurements on the bottle, but it's a nice addition. Great look and great size!"
    },
    {
        "review": "This is a great water bottle, and I really like the size. It holds a good amount without feeling overly bulky, and so far, I have had no issues with leaks. I also appreciate the wide variety of color options, which makes it easy to find one that suits your personal style.The bottle feels durable and it functions exactly as expected. The lid opens and closes smoothly making it convenient for everyday use.My only complaint is that the strap is not removable. I personally do not typically use a strap on my water bottles, so I would prefer the option to take it off when I don't need it. Aside from that, I am very happy with the quality, design, and overall functionality of this water bottle. It is a reliable option that I would recommend."
    },
    {
        "review": "Excellent product. Holds a good amount of water. I liked that it actually has 2 handles one of which is not visible in the advertised pictures. The synthetic flexible carrying loop is good to hold and won’t touch the ground even for shorter people. The harder plastic handle locks in to the lid and can be flipped out for carrying. It is much broader than other smaller titan bottles I have and feels more comfortable to hold.I bought 2 bottles. The clear pink  has motivational messages and time markers. The  Capacity clear bottle just has ounces and ml marked on the side. It fits in the coffee cup holders of both sedans and SUVs without the cup liners.The best part of these bottles is the fantastic smooth flow of the water without glugging or flowing in spurts. This is due to the small vent hole that allows air to escape, preventing vacuum formation when drinking. It works best when you drink from the opposite side of the vent, not from the sides or perpendicular to the vent.As with any water bottle, once in a while, I use a bottle bright cleaning tablet to clean it and avoid mold. I love these bottles."
    },
    {
        "review": "I love this water bottle so much. Seriously I never thought I would like a water bottle this much. I would give it more than 5 stars if possible.It’s leak proof as far as I can tell. I’ve been using it every day for about a week now, and I have knocked it over and off my desk at least 5 times while half or more full. I do tend to flip the latch/lock if I’m not shortly going to be getting another drink and whenever I’m moving or walking. Unlike pretty much every other bottle I have tried, there has not been a single drop left behind after I pick it up.I adore the strap. It’s easy to use to carry it, and, the way the lid goes on, it’s impossible for the strap to slide off. It’s so much easier when you have full hands to let it dangle from your arm or wrist. I would say overall durability is very impressive especially for the price.It’s easy enough to clean if you have a bottle brush to really reach the bottom. To be fair, I’ve only put water in it, so I only hand wash it every other day, since well water doesn’t leave residue behind.This bottle has made it so much easier to meet my goal amount of water per day (2 liters). Where I struggled with other bottles, I seem to be overachieving with this usually finishing it before the suggested time. So the only danger is drinking too much! It has also saved so many disposable plastic bottles already, since it takes 2 16.9 fluid ounce bottles to make a bit over 1 liter. That’s over a 24 pack a week, so it’s also helping the pocket book and the planet. I’ve already been asked by multiple people who have ordered one for them, and that’s within about a week. Definitely recommend!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I loved the bottle!! Great dimensions, very good spout. And because it has a smaller circumference and is easy to pick up and fit on the side of the backpack. 10/10"
    },
    {
        "review": "The water bottle was extremely hard to open & I was disappointed that there was no drinking spout/straw"
    },
    {
        "review": "It's a pretty good water bottle! I didn't know there was a small filter in it which was a nice surprise! Not the purifying kind, more so you don't get chunks of ice or anything else you could put in it like fruits, etc. The lid is sturdy and doesn't leak, or break open while holding it by the wrist strap. Overall, very happy with it."
    },
    {
        "review": "nice water bottle well made recommended"
    }
]

