[
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love this YETI water bottle! The neon yellow color is incredibly vibrant and stands out in the best way it's. I easy to spot whether I'm at the gym, in the office, or outdoors.Performance-wise, it does exactly what you'd expect from YETI. It keeps my water cold for hours, even on hot days, and I often still have ice left long after filling it.The chug cap is one of my favorite features. As the name suggests, it's perfect for taking big sips without spilling. The mouthpiece feels very similar to drinking from a regular plastic water bottle, which makes it comfortable and natural to use. It's a small detail that makes a big difference, especially if you're constantly reaching for your bottle throughout the day.Overall, this is a high-quality, well-designed bottle that's durable, practical, and looks great. If you're considering it, I highly recommend it!"
