        "review": "First of all, the color is beautiful - perhaps not quite as brilliant as in the photos, but it is delightful. This second one I received was a replacement for the first one that was sent, which seemed to have some damage to the interior lining (presumably a manufacturing flaw). This replacement bottle has a seamless and flawless interior lining, for which I am grateful; however, the outside has a slight dent in it. I'm not sure if that is because of packaging/shipping issues or if it was sent out that way. I do know the bottle was sent in a bag, not a box, so it is very possible there was damage done during shipping. I'm a bit disappointed, but not to the point of returning this one. Still, I think from now on, I will order any YETI item directly from YETI since it will hopefully be packaged better for shipping. As for the product itself, it is a nice size, the handle makes it easy to carry, and I like the chug cap very much. It also does a great job in keeping my water cold even when I left it in a hot car for a few hours. Overall, a great product but sad that I received it already dented."
