[
    {
        "review": "These are our go to water bottles for our family. They are dishwasher safe, no melting or warping when you put them through. This is really important to me because I have 3 boys in multiple sports and I like to wash between uses. They hold a very good amount of water to get through a basketball practice and the kid goes on and off easily to refill quickly. I like that they don’t leak (though I also wouldn’t just leave it upside down) and they can “mist” by squeezing when they are upright (which my kids like for water fights). They last longer than we can keep the pieces because we tent to lose the lids"
    },
    {
        "review": "I really like these Gatorade squeeze bottles. I’ve always wanted to try them because they look so cool, and now that I have one, I get the hype. The design is great — it feels solid, and it’s super easy to squeeze the water out without having to put your mouth on the spout. That makes it perfect for sharing or doing a “waterfall” when you pour water into someone else’s mouth without touching the bottle. It’s also nice that it doesn’t leak, and the flow is just right. Overall, it’s a simple but really well-designed bottle that does exactly what it should."
