    {
        "review": "As a football mom, these bottles have been perfect for practices and game days! They’re durable, easy to squeeze, and hold plenty of water to keep everyone hydrated. The leak-resistant design is great for tossing in a sports bag, and they’re easy to clean. Definitely a must-have for any sports family!"
    },
    {
