    },
    {
        "review": "They are good. Really good. When full can squirt further than you’ll ever need. Always regains its shape and doesn’t stay compressed. Easy to clean, a pack is good for a volleyball or basketball team to share. They are durable. Team throws them around, leaves them on the floor, a couple has been tossed and kicked, had balls smash that and they are still good. Never had it leak and holds enough for a couple people during water breaks. Best part is your lips don’t even need to get close to the bottle. Just squeeze and water shoots out, worth the buy"
