        "review": "Great price, easy to clean, and don’t leak."
    },
    {
        "review": "Great buy especially since sporting goods stores sell these exact squeeze style bottles for $5.99 each. Disappointed that 2 out of the 6 lids won't screw on completely at all times. Caused a leakage on the basketball court, mostly all over a player, luckily we were on the bench when it happened. Other than the 2 out of 6 sometimes leaky caps I love this and it was a nice addition to our girls' basketball team this year. Saves time during 30-60 second time outs for our players to get a fast drink without running around searching for their individual water bottles. I love that you can just tilt and squeeze and nobody has to put their mouths on the mouthpiece to get a quick drink. Will use these next year too. Some people complained that these are knock offs and not Gatorade bottles because there are no Gatorade symbols on the bottom of the bottle. I checked the local sporting good store selling these for $5.99 each and they're exactly the same, no Gatorade logo in the bottom of theirs either. Now if you want he Gatorade logo in the bottom of the bottle you can pay $15.99 per bottle at a local store for their insulated bottle that looks just like these, but when you need 6 or more that's just not cost effective in my mind."
    },
    {
        "review": "The \"No-Leak\" Magic: The standout feature is the self-sealing gasket valve. You don't have to pull a top up with your teeth or flip a lid; you just squeeze to drink, and it instantly seals when you stop. I’ve watched these roll around the trunk of my car and sit upside down in a backpack, and we haven't had a single drop leak out.Design & Durability:Easy Grip: The updated \"Easy Grip\" texture is actually functional. Even when the bottles are covered in condensation or the kids have sweaty hands, they don't slip.Translucent Strip: There is a clear vertical strip on the side so you can see exactly how much fluid is left and how much powder/water you're mixing.High Volume: The 32 oz size is the \"sweet spot\"—it holds enough for a full game without being too heavy or bulky for a side pocket.Pro-Tip for Parents: These are dishwasher safe (top rack), which is a lifesaver. Just make sure to rinse the lids well to keep the pressure valve clear of any sports drink residue."
