[
    {
        "review": "Love the size, color, and how cold it keeps my water throughout the day. It’s sturdy and I like that there are two options for drinking (one with a smaller opening and one where you can quickly fill and empty it). I hate external straws and this is a great alternative. I can put ice water in each morning and there are still ice cubes by the end of the day!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Favorite waterbottle in our household. It is stainless steel and does not get funky odors like plastic waterbottles do especially after sitting in the sun. It can keep a beverage cold for quite a long time and is very durable. The pieces come apart very easily for cleaning and make it easy to avoid mold buildup. The bottle itself is easy to reach a hand into the bottom to clean too. My husband and I each have one and it is simply a favorite. The handle makes it easy to hold onto for walks!"
