    {
        "review": "I have had different styles of water bottles over the past few years but this is still my favorite.  Things to consider are if you prefer a chug cap over a straw and how important weight is to you.  I like the chug cap and I prioritize the amount of water this can hold and keep cold over lightness.  Also, this water bottle will not fit in most car cup holders which will surely bother some but the positives outweigh this point for me.  Extremely durable with a nice handle for carrying around."
