    },
    {
        "review": "I had been hearing positive things about Owala water bottles for years, so when I needed a new water bottle for an upcoming work trip,  I figured it was time. The fact that Beauty and the Beast is my favorite movie made this particular model a no brainer. I absolutely understand the hype, your water stays cold all day, the lid is secure, I love the option to sip from a stray or chug. This particular size was perfect for me, easily fits in my diaper bag and my car cup holder, and is large enough to hold a decent percentage  of my daily water needs. After this purchase, I ended up buying two more for myself and one for my husband.The only negative feedback I have on this particular line (the Disney Princess, and likely any other bottle that has stickers) is that the stickers simply didn’t last. After one hand wash all the colors faded, so the slight up charge between a regular Owala and the Disney Princess version was kind of a waste, but I did add my own stickers and they’ve been just fine.  That’s the only reason why I docked a star."
