        "review": "Really happy with this water bottle. It’s a great size for everyday use, fits nicely in my car cup holder, and the 2-in-1 lid is convenient depending on how I want to drink. The insulation works well and keeps water cold for hours, and I haven’t had any issues with leaking. It also feels sturdy without being overly heavy. Overall, a well-designed bottle at a very reasonable price. Would definitely recommend."
