    {
        "review": "Great sized bottle, and drink system from Ello. Lid is difficult to thread onto plastic bottle. If the bottle goes on it’s side or upside down, it fills the lid and then leaks out the side - not ideal if you want to put the bottle in your bag or for when you’re drinking. another thing I’ve noticed that when it manages to thread correctly the handle is on the left side - not functional. Wouldn’t recommend this product. Better off getting the metal 64oz, which is what I’ll get to replace this."
    },
    {
