    {
        "review": "Good product, the plastic of the bottle is not of the best quality that is why many people leak water. You must check that the lid is well aligned with the bottle when closing it. This happens a lot when the plastic in the bottle is not of the best quality. I use it at home or where I know the bottle will be static. It's not a bad product, it could only improve the plastic. I do not regret making this purchase. I found it at a discount, to conclude; Very nice bottle, excellent functional for working or having at home or in a place where you know it will be static. I bought it when it was on sale, I recommend that you ONLY buy it when it is on sale."
    }
