        "review": "I’ve ordered from this seller 3 times. Twice for my daughter and once for her friend as a gift. This is the best water bottle she’s ever had. She drops her water bottles all the time and neither has ever broken. The lid cracked over time. But it doesn’t leak, easy to clean, And it’s durable. Especially for a rough kid like mine. Will be ordering another one for upcoming school year."
