        "review": "Hands down the best cycling water bottle available. Excellent flow, easy to squeeze, nice locking system, easy to clean. Good selection of colors."
    },
    {
        "review": "These bottles were bought to replace the exact same bottles that have been well-loved and well-used for several years. (Seriously, my husband cycles about 5000 miles a year, so these bottles have really held up well.) Eventually, the inner rubber piece in the drinking spout will tear if you take it apart to wash (which you should do regularly because it will grow mold inside if you don't) and that has now happened to the old ones, but they have been great bottles because THEY DON'T LEAK during use.Please be aware that the black bottles will draw heat and warm your water much faster than a lighter color bottle."
    },
    {
        "review": "I have bought four of these so I obviously like them. Great for the price, perfect size for a standard bike bottle cage, easy to open, and I haven't had any leaking. My only complaint is regarding the bottles that have the color strip on the bottom -- that coloring rubs off very quickly when taking it in/out of a bottle cage on a bike.  Then your pretty bottle is not so pretty."
    },
    {
        "review": "When these arrived I thought that they were the wrong bottles since they look so small. But I filled them all the way up and measured the volume and they really do hold 24 oz. Both of these bottles in my pic somehow hold 24 ounces of liquid. These are perfect for your bike, especially if you wanna fit a bag under your top tube, as they have such a low profile considering the volume they hold. These bottles are magic!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Good water bottle for my bike great color"
    },
    {
        "review": "Just perfect"
    },
    {
        "review": "Although I like the color I chose and the look and feel of this thing and yes it will work on my bike this is not what my inquiry was about and it's not exactly what I had ordered the bottle that I had ordered said something about being insulated this bottle is not insulated so that's the downfall, yes at the same time this seems to happen quite a bit with Amazon purchases you read the description or something blah blah blah you're looking at one thing and then you wind up getting something and then you look back at it and it's like it doesn't say exactly what it said when you ordered it but it's just magic it's just you know suddenly just changed like you know what you previously read in the original isn't there no more"
    },
    {
