        "review": "These shirts fit great, I'm 6'2\" 242 lbs and wear an XL and these had room but not too much that it looks weird and doesn't shrink crazy when you wash and dry them at least not the first time so I'll update if that changes any. the material is nice and stretchy, soft and of great quality or at least appears to be but we shall see over time. As of now I'd recommend these to everyone."
