        "review": "I bought for my husband he is a Medium bought a large thinking it would shrink it barely shrunk because I wash them with cold water and it seems to keep its shape so they fit well. I also did some heat transfers on them and they stuck on very well even after washing them. Love the material well made it is breathable and he uses for the mechanic shop. It is not too thick or thin and it stretches a little also but keeps its shape."
    },
