[
    {
        "review": "I purchased this T-shirt on Black Friday at a really low price because I was looking for just a simple one-color shirt to wear underneath hoodies during the winter. I wanted something comfortable, soft, and something that wouldn’t shrink immediately after washing it. I also wanted it to be versatile enough where I could either layer it or just wear it by itself around the house or out running errands.At first, I honestly didn’t know what Hanes meant by “Beefy-T,” but after getting it, I completely understand the name now. This is a thick T-shirt, and I mean that in a good way. The material feels substantial and much higher quality than a lot of the thinner shirts out there right now.As a bigger guy, finding T-shirts can honestly be very hit or miss. Sometimes an extra large doesn’t really feel like a true extra large, and the sizing gets weird the bigger you go. This shirt actually felt roomy in a comfortable way. It had coverage to it. I felt warm wearing it, and it almost seemed intentionally made a little beefier and more relaxed fitting, which worked perfectly for me.It ended up being extremely comfortable underneath a hoodie because of the softness and thickness, but it also looked perfectly fine wearing it by itself too. For the price I paid, I was honestly impressed with the quality.I highly recommend this T-shirt, especially for bigger guys who are tired of thin shirts that feel undersized or cheaply made."
    },
    {
        "review": "I am incredibly happy with this Beefy-T. As a bigger guy, finding t-shirts that have a true tall fit without being ridiculously wide or shrinking into a crop top after one wash is tough, but these are spot-on. The cotton is thick, heavy, and feels high-quality and durable. It holds its shape perfectly, stays comfortable all day, and provides that classic, solid weight you just don't get with cheaper, thin shirts. An absolute staple for the wardrobe, highly recommend!"
    },
