        "review": "My husband is impressed with the length - he's 6'6'' and the weight and soft feel of the material. He likes the charcoal gray, but will likely order other dark colors. Great value. Good for work or active lifestyle."
    },
    {
        "review": "I'm 5'6\" and weight around 385, and the 4XT fits great. This is the 2nd time I've ordered these, and I've purchased a variety of colors. My lady has essentially stolen them from me.The fabric is soft and I like the comfort, wearability, and lack of clinginess. They also haven't shrunk at all after a couple times through the laundry, which is nice. I especially like how thick these shirts are. My only real complaints are: 1) they wrinkle easily; 2) the collar is kinda loose after you put it on and take it off- they don't really stay flat; and 3) as mentioned before, my lady keeps wearing them, so I feel like she gets more use out of them than me.Overall, I'd say the shirts are worth what I paid for them. I could probably find other shirts that are \"more perfect\" but would end up paying a lot more. And these look good enough that I'm not dissatisfied."
