[
    {
        "review": "These are amazing tees. I looked at tons of reviews. None were good. Either tees were too small, too thin or too short. And let's not talk about the price for big and tall tees, robbery!!!  My son is a big guy 6'1' and 360lbs, Broad shoulders. He's starting a new job and he needed plain tee shirts. I got super frustrated. Then I saw these... a 10 pack of Gildan black tees, and I kept thinking I'd seen this name before at Walmart, but I wasn't for sure.  I was so dispondant from all the bad reviews of the tees I had looked at, I was getting afraid to order. Well, I took a chance and went ahead and ordered them. Omg...I did order a 5x, but they are too big...but not too bad, I will see if they shrink. I hope so. But to me this wasn't a bad thing. Because these are the greatest quality tees I've seen in a long time. Great for winter, the material is thick, not too thick , but will be great for work. They are a great length, perfect. I'm ordering a 4x next time, but I couldn't be more pleased. I bet he could even get into a 3x. I mean honestly, you can't beat the price. And the quality.  $3.40 a shirt, where are you going to find that? I'm ordering another 10pack later this week. I'll see how these wash up, before I do the review on those...so stay tuned....but you really can't go wrong. My next adventure is big and tall men's pants for work. Lol that was just as bad, wish me luck. lol"
