        "review": "These Gildan T-shirts have that classic heavy-duty feel to them while still being breathable and comfortable to wear. The material feels soft to the touch, and they strike a really good balance between durability and comfort, which honestly is why I keep coming back to them.They fit perfect and true to size!For me personally, I mainly use these as undershirts underneath hoodies and heavier layers rather than as my everyday standalone T-shirt. They work perfectly for that because they’re comfortable without feeling overly thin or flimsy. That being said, they’re definitely versatile enough to wear casually on their own if you want to.What I appreciate most is just the overall comfort and reliability of them. These are the kind of shirts you can throw into heavy laundry rotation and not constantly worry about them falling apart after a few washes. They really do hold up well in the washer and dryer over time.I happened to get these during a really good Black Friday sale, which made the value even better, but honestly, I would still recommend them at normal retail pricing because the quality is genuinely there. These are just dependable, comfortable shirts that do exactly what they’re supposed to do."
