[
    {
        "review": "I love this shirt and how it fits. I like my clothes to be very tight. Amazon recommended a small. That would have fit. And it probably would have fit well. However, I ordered an extra small because I know how I like my clothes. And I’m really pleased with it. This is a runs true size item! The material is stretchy and definitely not see-through! I also feel like the material is lightweight making it perfect for hotter months! I love the print of the camo! I think the shirt looks really casual and trendy while being comfortable!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I’ve bought this shirt in 7 colors now. All the colors are true to description. The shirts are my absolute favorite. I usually wear a large but I sized up to an XL just for a bit more length in the sleeves and torso. Tight fitting but in a soft, comfortable way. Great for running around town, working out or pairing with a cute pair of jeans to dress it up. I’m a firefighter and have worn these under my gear and it’s been one of the cooler shirts I have to wear so it’s great in that it’s not to thick but also not so thin you can see through it. 10/10 shirt, 5 stars all around, goal is to own every single color eventually. I wash it with my regular laundry and it goes through a hot dry cycle in the dryer and it’s come out fabulous every time. Absolutely no complaints"
    },
    {
