[
    {
        "review": "Very impressed by the quality of this overall. Wasn't expecting much considering the price, but it's actually extremely comfortable and fits a lot better than I thought it would.I'm tall (6'1\") and bigger (210 lb) with a long waist so a lot of things I've bought from Amazon don't always fit like I want them too, but this is an exception. The XL length actually feels perfect, and the width of shoulders and everything feels right. The material is soft, lightweight, and breathable, and great for wearing casually.I got the wine red and love the color! It really doesn't wrinkle very easily. I've even left it crumpled on my bed for a day and then put it on and it looked fine. I wouldn't say it's super warm but definitely more of a warm weather shirt. The sleeves are short but not tight and overall the cut and shape looks pretty good. Definitely think I will buy more colors of this! One of the better casual tops I've purchased."
