        "review": "These are my favorite shirts. I have them in multiple colors. They are long enough that you don’t worry about them coming up but slim fit that you don’t feel like they are too loose or too tight. I will buy these again and again. The neckline is perfect. They wash really well. The material is soft. It is a great shirt. I wear them under overalls and just as a shirt. I literally have this one on right now."
    },
    {
        "review": "Love this shirt. I purchased this in an xXL, I am 5’7” I wear a  XXl, depending on the shirt. After reading the reviews, I settled on the XxL. I purchased the green color, it is a little lighter color than the description, but I think it is a nice looking color. It is soft and comfortable. I have a tall body and it fit nicely. I washed it and so far it held up well didn’t shrink. The shirt is decent quality and lightweight. The price of the shirts are reasonable come in several colors and sizes. I picked this one up for $7.99. I like this shirt so much that I I plan on ordering more. I definitely recommend this shirt. I went to the mall and prices there seemed a lot high."
    },
    {
        "review": "I love this brand. They are longer so I dont have a crop top look and let it all hang out. My age and shape dont want this to happen. Thank you for making a normal top that looks classy and has a really comfortable fit that both smaller and larger people can enjoy. I want more of these and will keep watching for sales. Please dont stop making these. They are my favorite tees."
    },
    {
        "review": "We bought the burgundy XL by accident but it still worked; despite saying it’s for a 43” bust, it fits a 46” bust & 40” waist we remeasured to make sure we’re accurate and we are! So it fits loosely not tight across the chest and has a bit flair out by waist into the bottom which she was also a 46” hip. The material is so soft and stretchy and seems well made it was packaged nicely with tissue paper and vacuumed sealed not wrinkled it looks good on my daughter! She wants more but sad her favorite colors are priced so much higher at $17.99. They should raise the $8.99 and lower the $12.99 even it out across the board but for this t-shirt $17.99 isn’t worth the high price! Only 2 reasons for taking off a 2 stars is price on some colors & sizing not accurate other wise a terrific t-shirt. Hopefully you’ll fix sizing through! It really is a 5 star t-shirt if you are able to get the size you need for $8.99! Haven’t washed it yet; don’t know if it will shrink."
    },
    {
        "review": "I’ve been wearing these exact shirts for several years for work as a home health nurse. They hold up for a really long time, don’t shrink and the color doesn’t fade. Eventually, after over a year of weekly wear, they kind of start to develop pills in certain areas so I just retire them then.They are super comfy. I can move easily in them and they don’t make me too hot. The fabric is thinish in a good way. It drapes nicely over the chest and feels comfortable in the shoulders and underarm area. The length is also perfect for me. I am 5’ 6 1/2” for reference and weigh 175 lbs with a bit of a tummy. I don’t like a short shirt or one that’s too long. I can easily reach, squat or bend all the way down to touch my toes without the shirt riding up too high in the front or back.  I wear a size large. I am big busted and these fit fine for the girlies. I do wear a smooth bra underneath and it doesn’t show. Certain bras will show if they bulge out at all. It is, however, not see through at all. I just mean you can see little bumps with certain bras.I would say it’s a looser fitting, lightweight, casual tee shirt and the pics shown are accurate. As long as they keep making them I will continue to buy them.Be aware that they do go on sale. I wait for sales and stock up because their sale prices are unbelievable. I just got a bunch of them for $8.99 each. Different colors are different prices though so you may have to pay more for a specific color if you want it.Sorry but  these work selfies are the only pics I have while wearing them but still thought they might be helpful to someone to see the fit."
    },
    {
        "review": "Edit to add: I got another one in green because I loved the first one I ordered. However it’s a completely different material and much longer, I’ll be returning.. super disappointed.Absolutely love this top, I got it in the maroon color. The material is soft and good quality. The fit is perfect. I’m 5’2 167lbs and got a large. I like how it’s a little longer than typical shirts so it’s also good to wear with leggings. Definitely buying more especially for the price, I paid $9 which is a steal in my opinion. 10/10 recommend"
    }
]

[
    {
        "review": "Beautiful, soft and comfortable fit. I bought several colors and have found the length and tightness to vary a little. This one is perfect, while some others I do find myself tugging them down during the day, but I wear them at home only so I don't mind. They are incredibly flattering! I debated a long time between Large and Medium but wanted them to fit slim and fit my figure. This Medium fits a little looser than the other colors I bought but I am happy with them all."
    },
    {
        "review": "I love these henleys! I have a very difficult time finding shirts that fit my body type. I am large busted and somewhat small waisted. These shirts work perfectly, because the ribbing expands and contracts in all the right places, giving me an actual figure rather than disappearing in something too large or squeezing in something too tight. I have bought several colors. I love the versatility of colors that this brand offers, as I have been able to find many that work with my coloring. The fabric is nice and thick, not at all see-through. I have washed them many times, and the color has not faded, nor have any of the buttons popped off.I definitely recommend these shirts. They are so easy to dress up or down. You can wear them with a skirt or with jeans. They are the perfect every day shirt!"
    },
    {
        "review": "These tops are really cute and flattering! I’m 36 and have been wanting to switch up my wardrobe to look my nicest. I’ve also been researching my color season and I’m a deep/dark winter. With that said I was on the hunt for a top that looks nicer than a plain t-shirt within my colors and came across these tees. It was a little trial and error to get the correct size. For reference I’m about a 40 inch bust, about 31” waist, 168 pounds, 5’6” and wear a size 12 in pants. I decided the xxl looked best on me because it has some give without clinging to my stomach or looking baggy. I don’t have a typical job and work in an aircraft hangar moving boxes and material around and so far the tops have held up fine. The color is saturated and I feel like they make me look more professional but also casual enough for the environment I work in. I wish they had more colors because I’d buy more!"
    },
    {
        "review": "The fabric is excellent—very soft, comfortable, and smooth. It’s soft without being overly clingy, so it doesn’t highlight every curve or bulge. However, the sizing runs a bit small. I normally wear a medium, but I had to exchange it for a large. Unless you prefer a very fitted look, I would recommend sizing up.The cut is very flattering and has a slimming effect. The button detail at the neckline helps create a longer, more elongated silhouette. Overall, I highly recommend it."
    },
    {
        "review": "This is a great t-shirt. The color was true to the picture and the size chart is pretty accurate. I don't have a long torso, but the torso of the shirt is a little on the short side. If you have a long torso it may have more of a cropped appearance on you. The shirt is fitted, so if you prefer a looser fit I'd size up. I have purchased this shirt in a couple of colors and noticed the sizing is slightly different between colors, but not enough to be a deal-breaker. I'd buy this again."
    },
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love PRETTYGARDEN’s tops and just bought my 8th one in a new color! I’ve tried a variety of their styles now, and the quality is always fantastic. What keeps me coming back is how reliable the craftsmanship is—the stitching is always perfectly on point, and the fabric is incredibly breathable and comfortable to wear. The fit is amazing every single time. Plus, they are at an excellent price point for pieces that are versatile enough to layer or wear completely on their own. Highly recommend!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Such a pretty shade of pink. The fabric is soft, not too thin, not too thick. Perfect for a summer day. Whenever I notice a top listed as “slim fit,” I always size up one size. I did with this one, and was correct to do so. Love it. Enjoying it very much."
    },
    {
        "review": "This is the third time I've purchased this shirt...this time in Beige.  The first two I ordered were white and black.  I ordered size medium in all three and the size has been consistent every time.  The shirt is definitely fitted so if you're on the border of one or another size, I would suggest size up, but it may vary depending on body size and how you like your shirts to fit.  It isn't a cropped shirt, however, it is on the shorter side with not a lot of material to tuck in, if that's your thing.  The material is ribbed and soft.  The lighter colors aren't super see-through, although you can see your bra lines.  I always wash on cold and line dry to avoid shrinking and they turned out fine.  Overall, it's a really cute shirt that is a step above a regular tee because of the style, ribbed material and little buttons, which add to the style, and they even work.  Very happy with these slim fit tees!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Beautiful vibrant red tee, classic and stylish and comfortable! So glad I bought these in several colors. Perfect fit, I always follow Amazon's recommended sizeand perfect length! Highly recommend!"
    },
    {
        "review": "It's attractive and is made with quality materials. It fits perfectly and is very flattering which is a pleasant surprise. I was afraid by the sizing that it would be skin tight and wouldn't look good on me but it's exactly the opposite. It's beautiful and very flattering to my figure.I have an extremely hard time finding clothing that fits properly and looks good, despite the fact that I take my measurements regularly.This top looks just like it does in the picture and still looks flattering on a larger figure. Amazing! It's also available in so many colours, there must be one for anything you want to match it with something.I'm not able to go out to try on clothes in person at a store, and so this is a marvelous find. I'm so happy!"
    },
