[
    {
        "review": "The material of 100% is amazing and is a heavier cotton. I have been searching for a t-shirt of cotton but not thin.  This shirt is exactly that! I purchased the purple and the black with the sun and moon. The Sun and Moon shirt seems to be just a bit smaller which is perfect! I purchased a large in both, I am 160 pounds and I like the fit more of the moon and stars with less over sized for me personally. I love the purple as well, but didn’t want too over sized. No clingyness whatsoever! I did purchase a medium in the purple to have a bit more fitted with jeans. I cannot say just how amamzing and perfect these t-shirts are. If you are searching for cotton with no stretchyness like most T-shirts nowadays and want something like in the 80s and 90s but when cotton T-shirts weren’t see through and comfortable, this is the shirt for you! It is cotton so if you don’t want to shrink it, don’t dry or dry on low heat which I did and it got even more soft as cotton does! If you’re on the fence, but the shirt! I am 5’4 and the large isn’t super long, it hits just below the bum. It doesn’t fan out at the bottom like others that claim to be oversized. I plan to buy more of these shirts! I am very happy with all 3 shirts I have purchased. Also, the large purple shirt was a bit more stones washed looking as well as the moon and sun one. The medium purple doesn’t have a much stone washed look to it but has less, I still love it. The material and fit are outstanding!"
