        "review": "I've had Comfort Colors t-shirts before and was very happy to find them on Amazon.  They are inexpensive, but well made and the colors last.  The fit is good, with little or no shrinkage with washing (although I have to admit that I now need an extra large at 5'8\" and 215 lbs.) and they are durable.  Most importantly, these shirts are VERY comfortable.  I generally don't like wearing someone's advertising, so having a good looking, plain front, comfortable t-shirt that I can expect to last and don't have to overpay for is great.  I will but more without hesitation."
