        "review": "I’ve been on the look out for the perfect T shirt for a longggg time. My search is over. The best T shirt out there, bar none. Perfect softness, perfect weight, perfect colors, perfect even after laundering. I will be replacing every ill fitting, misfit T shirt that I own with these shirts. The only thing that could make Comfort Colors T shirts even better is if they offered a ‘long’ size option. Otherwise, I’m happilyIn love."
