        "review": "I got the 4XL. Fits a little loose. But I wanted to wash it before making this review. So after washing it, it shrank a little bit. It did not shrink a lot. But that looseness is now gone. So it actually fits perfectly. The neck doesn't sag and the length of the shirt did come up slightly, but you can lift your arms and it wont show belly.Overall If you want a more loose fit, go one size up for that slight shrinkage."
    },
