        "review": "My favorite shirt ever!I have bought several pairs, been wearing them for years.Predominantly gym shirts, but they are great for wearing casually as well.Excellent quality. Cotton and stitching is holding up after 4-5 years of daily wear.Color slowly fades with washes, but they are looking worn in the best way."
