        "review": "’m really happy with these Gildan DryBlend T-shirts! They’re made with quality material, feel soft and comfortable, and have a really nice fit. The colors are great and they hold up well after washing. I especially love that they don’t shrink in the wash, which is a huge plus when buying clothes for my children. My kids love wearing them because they’re comfortable and easy to wear. Getting two shirts for the price makes this an even better value. Great quality, great fit, and a great everyday shirt!"
