[
    {
        "review": "Hate getting a light or white t-shrit that is see through? This is the perfect tee! You don't have to worry about seeing through it.  It's super soft, cute, a touch thicker than a cheap t-shirt, doesn't wrinkle, and has the perfect length for tucking in or leaving out.  We got these shirts for direct transfer iron on's and they looked so cute when they were complete.  The material is soft, stretchy and cozy.  The V-neck is flattering without being too low, sleeve length is nice and the fit is perfect as it goes out slightly at the waist.  Have washed and worn it several times, color does not fade, does not shrink, stays soft and is durable."
