    {
        "review": "I absolutely love these shirts! I bought them for a trip because I wanted a few simple, solid colored basics and they did not disappoint.The material is soft, comfortable, and lightweight without feeling too thin. They wash really well and haven't shrunk at all. I also love the neckline, it's very flattering and makes the shirts look a little more polished than a basic tee.One thing I was most impressed with was the white shirt. I usually avoid wearing white because they're often too see through, but that wasn't the case with these. With a nude bra, I didn't have any issues with transparency which was a huge plus for me.These shirts are flattering on their own and also work great for layering under jackets or cardigans. Overall, they're excellent quality for the price and I'll definitely be buying more colors!"
