[
    {
        "review": "I purchased a set in navy and deep magenta for my adult daughter Shea, because I wanted to try to hotfix custom designs for her.  I was reluctant because I thought it would melt.  I started at a lower temp but 290 for 15 seconds on the front and back works well.  I must add that the peel is a bit challenging because this soft fabric is nice and stretchy.  The colors are deeper than the photos and more if  a deep navy and plum.  It could have been the lighting.  I have a similar set in M (I’m 5’7” @ 135 lbs) which isn’t clingy but not snug.  It fits just right.  I originally purchased M for her but because of the fit, she needed XL for her 174 frame so that it’s not hugging her body."
