        "review": "So buttery soft! I needed some new plain basic tees and found these were the best priced at only around $11 for two shirts. Reviews appeared to be good so I purchased two sets (four shirts). They came in the next day and I immediately noticed how buttery soft and stretchy they are! They are not see through at all. They are form fitting but not too tight. I’d say if you want a looser fit to size up. The only thing I don’t like is the shoulders have either too much fabric or it could just be because they are new and need a couple washes , but it makes the shoulders look pointed. I think that may go down once I wash and dry a couple times. I bought heather grey/ charcoal heather and navy/pink. The pink is more of a coral color so keep that in mind before purchasing that one. I am 5’1 and around 145lbs and I purchased these in Medium and they fit perfectly. All in all I do like these a lot and I’m glad I found some shirts that are not that moisture wick material which I do not care for. I will be purchasing a few more colors in these soon!"
