        "review": "This journal is not just high quality, but it also is organized perfectly. On the 1st page, you can write your info in case you lose it, theres a few pages for the table of contents, you can date each entry, and you can number each page on the bottom. The paper is nice to write on and the pen glides on it very well. The back pocket is made of a pretty thick plastic and is double sided. This journal comes with a pen + sticky notes to mark pages. I also love how it has a closure. My stickers were able to hold on to the outside pretty well."
    },
    {
        "review": "Guys - if you need a notebook, BUY THIS ONE!I was running out of pages of my small notebook that I keep on my desk and in my bag to jot things down as they arise.  So to Amazon I went - and this was a cute color and a great price.It arrived and I was pleasantly surprised!  It had a personalized note from the seller, a matching pen, a cute sticker for the cover, tabs so you can separate sections, really high quality paper and a pocket in the back - such a great bargain, I highly recommend!"
