    },
    {
        "review": "I am thoroughly impressed with the outstanding value that the team at Mr. Pen has built into this 8.5 by 11-inch spiral-bound notebook. For a long time, my gold standard for paper was the classic ivory Ampad Gold Fibre writing pad, and this notebook easily equals its exceptional quality and daily functionality.The standout feature is the 100 gsm paper, which matches the heavy weight and premium texture found in high-end luxury stationery. It handles a wide array of writing instruments with ease, including my Cricut pens and liquid highlighters, showing zero signs of bleed-through or heavy ghosting. The paper also boasts a beautiful, warm ivory-beige tint that serves as a perfect substitute for my beloved, discontinued Ampad stock.This notebook confidently earns a spot in what I like to call the Ron Popeil \"But wait, there's more!\" category. The Mr. Pen team did not just stop at great paper; they packed the notebook with functional extras, including a matching pen, a set of sticky tabs, a durable plastic storage pocket, and a secure elastic closure band.This product delivers an exceptional value proposition. The combination of heavy-weight paper, useful accessories, a sturdy twin-wire binding that truly lays flat, and protective thick plastic covers create an exemplary price-to-value ratio that easily beats out other brands.Brava to everyone at Mr. Pen for engineering such a superb and thoughtful notebook."
