        "review": "I really like the size of this notebook because it gives me much more writing space than a small journal. The 8.5×11-inch format is especially useful for school notes, planning, lists, journaling, or keeping track of multiple things on the same page.The spiral binding makes it easy to flip through the pages and keep the notebook open while writing. The lined pages are great for keeping handwriting organized, and having 100 pages gives you plenty of room before needing another notebook.I also like the included sticky tabs because they're useful for separating sections or marking important pages. The black cover gives it a simple, professional appearance that works for school, work, or personal use.Overall, this is a practical notebook with a good amount of space and some useful extras."
