    {
        "review": "I bought a smaller notebook from this brand and loved it, so I decided to size up. Oh, wow. What a difference that made in my journaling. The size is very comfortable, the pages are lined in a beautiful way and it even has little tabs to label your pages. The outside cover feels durable and is very pleasing to look at."
