    {
        "review": "Timely arrival and nice product"
    },
    {
        "review": "Lifelong Moleskine user. I’m switching to this company. 100%. Over the years the paper quality of Moleskine seems to have gone down. Their leather covers still feel marginally softer than Paperage, but the paper quality of Paperage is just better. My writing is smoother, the color tone of the paper is slightly brighter (less warm), and the paper weight/thickness seems thicker. More pages per book and it has two built in bookmark ribbons. I use one bookmark for where I’m at and the other for referencing things. Such a better value, really impressed with this brand."
