[
    {
        "review": "I've had these for about 6 weeks now and have worn them almost daily for varying lengths of time. I work from home, so for much of the day I am barefoot, but I wear shoes when going out in the yard, walking my dog, or going out places. So, I can't speak to how these would feel or wear if I were wearing them for an entire day or anything, but for my purposes, they are great! Super easy to slip on, as the name implies, and they fit perfectly. I wear a women's size 11 and that's the size I bought.I will say that the first week or so my feet would be slightly achy after wearing these for longer walks (30-60 min) but that has gone away and I don't have any discomfort while wearing them or after wearing them. I like the color (I got the off white) and I think when my current pair of black tennis shoes bites the dust I'll probably replace them with these in black."
