    {
        "review": "I have purchased these Skechers D'Lites Fresh Start sneakers for women and I must say that they are a good buy. They are a fantastic option if you are looking for absolute comfort without giving up style.📦 Shipping and packaging: Shipping by Amazon was impeccable and very fast. The product box arrived within the indicated time and in perfect condition, without any damage.💎 Quality of materials and design: They have a beautiful design that combines with a lot of styles. The good quality of all its materials is noticeable from the first moment. One detail that I really liked is that the laces are of good quality and do not deform or fray with use. In addition, they are super easy to put on and take off, adapting to the foot perfectly.🚶‍♀️ Travel performance and comfort: The sole is wonderful: it is very comfortable and completely adapts to the shape of the foot with each step. I have used them on several trips that have involved a lot of walking throughout the day. The experience has been unbeatable: after whole days walking from one place to another, I do not end up tired or with any discomfort in my feet. You feel like they cushion the impact perfectly.⏳ Long-term durability: A key point is how well they age. After months of continuous use, they are still in perfect condition and continue to be exactly as comfortable as the first day. They have not lost the shape or cushioning of the sole.❤️ Overall impression: I recommend them 100%. They are worth every euro they cost for the health and rest they bring to your daily feet.🟢 Pros:- Very fast shipping and packaging in perfect conditions.- Extreme comfort: ideal for long trips and walking all day.- Very comfortable sole that adapts and cushions perfectly.- Great durability: impeccable and comfortable after months of use.- Resistant laces that do not lose their shape.🔴 Cons: Being an impeccable white color, they require more constant maintenance and cleaning to keep them shiny."
