        "review": "I was reluctant on buying shoes that I couldn't try on, but the reviews were really good. So I thought I would leave a good review as well. I bought size 15X and I'm a 52 year old male who is around 6ft7. My joints hurt all the time due to arthritis everywhere. I do a lot of walking at my job and just going on the reviews for these shoes was a gamble for me because nothing ever fits, but these shoes were a game changer for me. It's definitely easier to move around and they are good on my knees. I highly recommend buying these shoes, plus they add to my height and I have shrunk over the years due to gravity pulling back down. I might have to buy me another pair soon."
