        "review": "The 8.5 fits me perfectly without squishing the sides of my feet toward my toes. These sneakers need additional arch support for me (but I’m used to wearing hard plastic inserts in just about all my shoes). I really like the muted solid pink. It really helps the shoe feel less busy than it actually is. The shoelaces are about the only thing I dislike about these shoes since they are made of some different material that seems like it will hold dirt and snag easily. $52 this is a fair price for a nice tennis shoe. The sole is very thick and comfortable to wear all day."
