        "review": "I love these shoes.  I find them to be extremely comfortable!!  I've actually only worn them once so I can not comment on Durability but they seem to be made well, with a thick sole and quality material.  I wear a size 10, I ordered a size 10 and the fit is perfect.  They are not \"slip-on\" but after initial tying, I am able to slip off and slip back on with a slight tug of the tongue.  I do not have arch issues, but I do have lots of back, knee and hip issues ... and felt that overall they were as supportive as my regular tennis shoes.  As I said before, I have only worn them once but I should note that I did wear them for 8 hours of light walking, running errands, shopping and cleaning house with zero complaints.  I would definitely recommend!"
