[
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love these shoes and find them so cute and comfortable. I bought these shoes for work 3 weeks ago and have worn them every shift since. I am an ER nurse who is constantly on her feet at work for 12 hours. This is actually the second pair of new Balance shoes I have bought. I was so impressed with the first and I wanted a different color. I normally wear about a 6.5 to 7 in women’s depending on the brand. I bought a size 7 in the slate gray metallic silver color. These shoes fit me well and are true to size. The toe area is roomy enough to allow me to spread my toes out some. They also leave enough room to accommodate thicker socks, or foot swelling during shifts. I do have arches in my feet and they feel well supported while wearing them. They feel lightweight on my feet during my entire shift and my feet never feel heavy.When I first wore them they were a little stiff, but they never once hurt my feet. I was surprised because usually new shoes have to be broken in. Of course my feet do get tired since I worked 12 hour shifts, but they have never once hurt like they have with other shoes I have worn in the past.The sole of the shoe is cushioned and has not compressed after use. I have never once slipped while wearing them on polished and tiled flooring, so they provide traction. The mesh on the side is breathable. They are a little harder to keep clean because of the fabric near the lace toe and heel. After three weeks of use, I have not noticed any loose stitching and they have held up very well. Additionally, there isn’t any noticeable wear to the outsole.These shoes are good for casual wear, work, travel, and light exercise."
    },
    {
        "review": "I was honestly a little hesitant to order these because I've received knockoffs from other sellers before. I'm so happy I decided to give these a try! They look exactly like the pictures and seem to be authentic.I ordered my usual size (7.5), and they fit perfectly. I haven't worn them outside yet, but I did walk around the house in them, and they're super lightweight and really comfortable. They came in the original New Balance box with the branded wrapping paper, and they had that fresh new shoe smell. 😊 Overall, I'm really happy with my purchase and will definitely buy from this seller again. Highly recommend! ❤️❤️❤️"
    },
    {
        "review": "We bought these for school and my daughter absolutely loves them. They look even better in person—the neutral color is really cute and goes with just about everything. Most importantly, she says they’re super comfortable, which is exactly what I was hoping for in a shoe she’ll be wearing all day at school. They seem well made, fit nicely, and have that classic New Balance look. Very happy with this purchase!"
    },
    {
        "review": "These shoes are so cute and go well with a lot of my outfits! They’re lightweight and supportive! The material is very nice and the leather ages well even when dirty (I think it adds character similarly to the converse)! The only caveat is they run small so I would size up! They show a bit of ankle too so I wouldn’t consider them right for running or excessive exercise, but I use them for walking, going out, light weightlifting, and errands!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love these sneakers! They're the perfect combination of comfort and style, which is exactly what I was looking for.From running errands and chasing after my kids to long walks and everyday wear, they've been comfortable right out of the box with no break-in period. They provide great support, and my feet still feel good even after wearing them all day.I also love how versatile they are. They look great with leggings, jeans, shorts, or casual dresses, so I find myself reaching for them almost every day. The quality is excellent, and they've held up really well despite getting a lot of use.If you're looking for a comfortable everyday sneaker that also looks stylish, I highly recommend these. They've quickly become one of my favorite pairs of shoes, and I'd definitely buy them again."
    },
    {
        "review": "I have small feet and the size is a perfect fit. If you  have more of a flat foot, I recommend the wide. The shoe is lightweight with comfortable wear all day. The shoe is great quality and comfortable for someone on their feet all day. The lightweight technology allow for your feet to breathe."
    },
    {
        "review": "These new balance are lightweight and comfortable I ordered the black I’m very satisfied with my purchase I plan to order a different color"
    },
    {
        "review": "You really can find anything on Amazon. I bought these shoes the first time directly from New Balance and was so disappointed when I couldn't find them again. Decided to just TRY searching them on here and what do you know, they had them.I am a server so I am on my feet running around ALL day, sometimes 12-14 hour days and these shoes are so comfortable. (They definitely are NOT non-slip - and aren't listed as such so it's totally fine!! but I scuff them in the parking lot before I wear them at work for the first time to give them some grip and after that they aren't bad.)I really like that they are kind of wide without being wide? I definitely don't need a \"wide\" shoe, but most sneakers are so narrow these days. These one's aren't like that, I definitely feel like it gives room for my feet to be a bit more free without sacrificing stability.That being said... I wish they were more durable and lasted longer. Because I've needed to replace every few months with what I do. And with a $66 price tag ON SALE. It's kind of a bummer. As soon as the sole started to really sag I definitely noticed my feet hurting more and more. Also, this is the ONLY shoe I've ever had that started to curl up in the toe. Makes me think that the quality isn't that great, but when you first get them they are so I am committed until I find something else."
