        "review": "I was looking for a pair of silver sneakers and found these on sale. They are cute and real leather so I thought that was a huge plus. A lot of reviews are saying that they run big and to order down. I paid attention to that and it was a huge mistake. I'm usually between a 7 and a 7.5 but in sneakers I lean more towards 7.5. I first ordered the 7 and they were way too small. They fit like a 6.5 and I know they are in fact a 6.5 because the box said EU 37 which always fits like a 6.5 (7 would be a 37.5 EU) so I ordered the 7.5 (which the box says 38 which is correct for EU sizing) and they fit perfectly! So If you are a 6.5, then go ahead and order the 7. If you are between a 7 and a 7.5 then order the 7.5 for a perfect fit. They do run a bit narrow so keep that in mind if you have very wide feet they might not work for you."
