[
    {
        "review": "This Skechers style is the best fit for me.  This is my third pair.  Great to see Amazon has such a large selection of colors.This style also comes in a wide width.  I purchased size 8.5 rather than 9. This style has traditional laces which was also my preference.  Max cushioning for walking.  I always get compliments on these shoes especially the lavender color."
