[
    {
        "review": "I love these sneakers! I’ve gotten compliments on how cute they are. The color is pretty and match all my summer outfits. I added pictures, these are taken a week after wearing them, they hold up and pretty much stay clean looking. They are soft inside and comfortable, I’ve walked a lot in them. They aren’t heavy like I saw some people saying.  My feet are a little sore which is normal for me no matter what shoes I wear because I have medical issues. They do not hurt or cause any blisters. I may buy another pair I love these!! Highly recommend. The sizing is accurate as well."
