    {
        "review": "These sneaker’s pastel color block is super cute and fun. It runs true to size. The rubber sole was thicker than I thought it would be, but the weight didn’t bother me. The first day wear was great (no foot discomfort). I was expecting the memory foam padding to be thicker so they felt a little hard. I wish the memory foam padding was thicker. Gave it a 4 star due to the sole, fit, and the construction seems pretty good in addition to them being so cute."
