[
    {
        "review": "Reeboks are always high quality and these sneakers do not disappoint. They’re a neutral light tan with light pink accents, but they are neutral enough to match almost anything. I dress these up or down and they look incredible. I also have large feet and these looks great- sometimes Reeboks can make big feet look like boats, but that’s not the case here. I purchased a ten, but these are roomy enough that I could’ve sized down to a 9.5. Overall, I love the trendy but classic look of these Reebok sneakers and imagine me pairing these with numerous outfits for a while!"
    },
    {
        "review": "These run true to size. Whatever your normal size is in a tennis shoe or walking shoe, the same size in these will fit. They are beautifully made, as you would expect from Reebok. They are fairly comfortable, but not as cushiony and soft on the inside as I prefer. The inner soul, while it has some slight softness and cushioning is completely flat. There is no real arch support. I have high arches and prefer a walking shoe or tennis shoe to have good arch support. The leather is stiff as sometimes happens when new. I’m hoping it will soften up after these are worn a few times. The silver color is beautiful. It’s not very shiny or too blingy but it does have some pizzazz."
