    },
    {
        "review": "I normally wear a 41, but it was too big and got the 40 instead. It is a big fit, so would advise to go 0.5 or 1 size smaller.Very comfortable, affordable and good quality."
    },
    {
        "review": "I loved them, they are very pretty, the order arrived before the indicated date, thank you"
