[
    {
        "review": "I really love this candle set! All four scents smell great, especially Smoke & Vanilla and Vintage Leather. The fragrances are warm, masculine, and relaxing without being too overpowering. The candles also look really nice and stylish, so they make a great addition to any room. They burn evenly and have a good scent throw. For a 4-pack, I think these are a great value and would also make an excellent gift. Definitely recommend!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I picked up this candle set as a gift, and I was pleasantly surprised by how nice the presentation and scents are. The set comes with four different fragrances, Leather, Smoke & Vanilla, Oak, and Lavender Woods, so there’s a good variety to choose from depending on your mood.The scents have a more mature, woodsy feel rather than smelling overly sweet or floral. My favorite is probably the Smoke & Vanilla because it has a warm, cozy fragrance, while the Leather and Oak scents have that deeper, masculine character I was looking for. The Lavender Woods is a little lighter and works well when I want something more relaxing.I also really like the black glass jars. They have a simple, modern appearance that looks good on a nightstand, coffee table, office desk, or shelf. They don't have the typical overly decorative look that some scented candles have, so they would work well with almost any decor.The packaging is another plus. The four candles come together as a gift set, so it feels like a complete present rather than something that needs additional wrapping or putting together. I think this would make a great Father's Day, birthday, holiday, or housewarming gift.I also appreciate having four different scents instead of getting four identical candles. It gives you the opportunity to try each one and choose your favorites.Overall, I’m very happy with this set. The combination of different fragrances, attractive black jars, soy wax, and gift-ready presentation makes it a great value. If you're looking for candles with a more sophisticated and masculine scent profile, this is definitely a set worth trying."
    },
    {
        "review": "The appearance of this candle set is very aesthetic. The glass jars are robust and give a decorative vibe. The candle set burns evenly and scents really well. The scents are warm, masculine, and soothing, yet subtle enough not to feel overwhelming. Among the four different fragrances, I will especially mention smoke & vanilla and vintage leather as the best. If you are evaluating a gift option at a reasonable price, you can definitely think about this one."
    },
    {
        "review": "This candle set makes a really nice gift for a man. The packaging looks stylish and the scents are warm, masculine, and relaxing. I especially liked the Smoke & Vanilla and Oak scents. They burn nicely without producing much smoke, and the candles create a cozy atmosphere. The scent could be a little stronger in a large room, but overall I’m very happy with the set and would definitely recommend it as a gift."
    },
    {
        "review": "I recently purchased the Auelife Candles for Men Gift Set, and I’m really impressed with it.The set includes four different scents, which makes it fun to try something new each time.The fragrances are pleasant, warm, and perfect for creating a relaxing atmosphere.I especially like that the scents are not overly strong or overwhelming.The candles look stylish and would make a great addition to any room.The four-pack also makes this set a nice gift option for birthdays, holidays, or special occasions.They burn nicely and add a cozy touch to my home.Overall, I think this is a great candle set and a thoughtful gift for any man who enjoys nice fragrances."
    },
    {
        "review": "I picked up this men’s scented candle set not really knowing what to expect, but it turned out to be a solid buy — especially if you like deeper, more “masculine” scents.The variety is what stands out most. You get a mix like leather, smoke & vanilla, oak, and lavender, and each one has a distinct vibe. The leather and smoke scents are definitely the strongest and give off that warm, slightly cologne-like feel, while the lavender helps balance things out when you want something more relaxing.The candles burn pretty evenly and last a decent amount of time for their size. I also like that they’re soy-based, so they don’t produce that heavy, overpowering smoke some cheaper candles do.Scent strength is moderate — not weak, but not overwhelming either. It’s enough to fill a room without being too intense, which I prefer.Only downside is the tins are a bit small, so if you’re expecting large candles, these are more on the compact side. Still, they’re great for trying different scents or spreading them around the house.Overall, this is a great set if you want clean-burning candles with more rugged, unique scents instead of the typical sweet/fruity ones. Also makes a really solid gift."
    },
    {
        "review": "I was pleasantly surprised by the quality of this candle set. Each candle has its own unique masculine scent, and none of them smell artificial or overpowering. My favorites are the Leather and Smoke & Vanilla, they create a warm, relaxing atmosphere that's perfect after a long day.The candles burn evenly, and the soy wax gives a clean burn with very little soot. The containers also have a sleek, modern look that fits well in any room or office. I also appreciate that the fragrances are noticeable without being too strong.Overall, this is a great gift idea for dads, husbands, or any guy who enjoys a cozy space with refined scents. I would definitely purchase this set again and highly recommend it."
    },
    {
        "review": "Smells nice ., only one of my jars was broken when I received them. Came delivered in a plastic mailer bag so may have gotten damaged when they delivered"
