[
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love this candle warmer! It looks beautiful on my nightstand and adds a cozy, warm glow to the room. The adjustable brightness and timer are very convenient, and it melts the candle evenly without an open flame, making it much safer than burning a wick. It also helps my candles last much longer while filling the room with a wonderful fragrance. The quality is excellent, and it was very easy to set up. Highly recommend this for anyone who loves candles or wants a stylish piece of home décor!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I originally purchased this candle warmer lamp as a Mother’s Day gift, and after seeing how beautiful it looked and how well it worked, I ended up ordering one for myself too.It’s both functional and decorative. The design looks elegant in my home, and I love that I can enjoy my favorite candles without an open flame. The dimmable light and timer are features I use all the time, and they make it easy to create a cozy atmosphere while giving me peace of mind.One of my favorite things is that it melts the candle evenly and fills the room with fragrance while helping the candle last much longer than burning it with a wick.If you’re a candle lover or looking for a thoughtful gift, I highly recommend this warmer. It has become one of my favorite home purchases."
    },
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love this candle warmer lamp! It has become one of my favorite home décor pieces while also serving a practical purpose. The design is modern and stylish, and it fits beautifully on my nightstand and living room table.The warming light melts the candle evenly without an open flame, so I can enjoy the fragrance without worrying about smoke, soot, or forgetting to blow out a candle. The scent fills the room surprisingly quickly, and I feel like my candles last much longer than when I burn them traditionally.The timer and brightness settings are a great bonus because I can adjust the intensity depending on the room or time of day. It’s simple to use, quiet, and feels very well made.If you’re looking for a safer alternative to burning candles or want to extend the life of your favorite scented candles, I highly recommend this warmer. It also makes a thoughtful gift for anyone who loves candles and home décor."
    },
    {
        "review": "I bought this so I didn’t have to worry about forgetting to blow my candles out.Pros:It has a built in timer up to 10 hours that auto turns off the lamp.It can be dimmed to your preferred brightness and heat.It looks really nice on displayMelts the wax to release the scent from the top instead of from the bottom like others.The light height can be adjusted to fit larger candles up to 5.75in in height.It’s stable even when maxed out in height.Cons:None reallyOverall:I recommend this candle warmer if you are looking for one for personal use and It would also make for a great gift for anyone that doesn’t want to burn their candles for safety reasons."
    },
    {
        "review": "I bought this candle warmer lamp secondhand on Amazon at a very reasonable and affordable price, so I wasn’t sure what to expect. I was pleasantly surprised! It arrived in great condition and works perfectly. I absolutely love it! 🥰 It looks beautiful, gives off a cozy light, and does an excellent job warming the candle.The only downside was the estimated delivery time. When I purchased it, I didn’t realize I would have to wait for such a long time, and I was initially told it would arrive around October 1st. However, it actually arrived much earlier than the estimated date, which was a nice surprise.Considering the price I paid and the fact that it was secondhand, I’m extremely happy with my purchase. It works excellent and looks beautiful. I definitely recommend it!"
