    {
        "review": "Review by my wifeI feel so thrilled that I managed to get hold of these ahead of autumn - when I burn most candles .Firstly you really notice how big the candles are - the burn time on them is so impressive due to this . I like the brown and gold packaging style as I feel it matches the autumn theme of the candles themselves .You get quite the variety of scents - and all of them are so powerful ! I was so impressed as have never found candles other than the most popular branded ones that have the strong scent when you open the lid and then when you burn them but these do both of those things really well .There are 6 scents , a lot of them smell fairly cinnamon based which i do love as a smell but then you get some more top notes of different autumn themes like apple pie and nutmeg .I feel like they are a really affordable set of candles that would work so well for just your own home or even as a gift for a candle lover which makes them versatile . I also feel the price tag is so affordable and excellent value !! They would see you through autumn untill you want your Xmas scents ! A fab find in my opinion on all counts - well made , strongly scented and top quality candles."
    },
    {
        "review": "As described, this set of 6 scented soy wax candles diffuses delicious scents inspired by fall, with gourmet notes of apple, cinnamon, pumpkin and pastries. These scents quickly create a warm and comforting atmosphere in the house. 👍The 100% natural soy wax ensures a clean combustion and a long duration of use, which allows you to enjoy the different fragrances for many hours. The glass jars are elegant and provide a pretty decorative touch, while the neat box also makes it an excellent gift idea for different occasions. It is a pleasant set to use, both to perfume a room and to create a soft and friendly atmosphere. For €42.99 at the time of my review, we has a fairly decent value for money. Thank you for reading 😉"
    },
    {
        "review": "Introduction: I received this product through the Amazon Vine program, which allows you to try some items in exchange for an honest review. However, I would like to point out that this does not influence my opinion: I have not had any contact with the manufacturer, I do not receive any compensation and the product was sent to me directly by Amazon. My opinion is based solely on the actual use of the product. The six candles cover different autumn-themed scents and the yield in the room is what one would hope for: the scent spreads in the room without being heavy, even when lighting just one in a living room. The soy wax burns regularly, with the surface being consumed uniformly instead of digging a well around the wick, and the total 1197 grams guarantee a duration that justifies the price. The packaging deserves a separate note: it looks good enough to be given as a gift as it is, and for those who appreciate scented candles it is a thought that always has an effect. I bought them for home and found myself considering them as gifts: highly recommended in both cases."
    },
    {
        "review": "This set of 6 AOOVOO autumn scented candles is designed for those who enjoy creating warm and cozy environments at home. The selection of scents revolves around typical fall fragrances, such as apple pie, cinnamon, spiced apple, pumpkin pecan pie, pumpkin spice and baking spice. It is a proposal very oriented towards those looking for a homely, sweet and comfortable feeling. 🍎🎃Each candle comes presented in a carefully designed glass jar, so it not only works as an aromatic candle, but also as a small decorative element. In addition, the set arrives in a gift box, something practical if purchased for birthdays, seasonal details, Christmas or simply to surprise someone without having to add too much packaging. 🎁Aspects to highlight ⭐🍂 Variety of very autumnal aromas. The set includes six different fragrances, all with a warm and sweet aromatic line. It is a good option for those who enjoy pastry, cinnamon, apple or pumpkin type smells, especially in living rooms, bedrooms or reading corners.🕯️ Soy wax. The candles are made with soy wax, a fairly common alternative in better quality candles. It usually offers a cleaner and more uniform burn than other conventional waxes, as long as they are used correctly.⏳ Good overall duration. The set adds up to 1197 g of wax, with an announced duration of up to 300 hours in total. This allows them to be used for a long time if the fragrances are alternated or turned on in moderate sessions.🎁 Careful gift presentation. The box and glass jars with gold labels make the set look nice without preparing additional packaging. It's a simple detail, but it adds up a lot if bought as a gift.🏡 They provide an uncomplicated atmosphere. They are candles designed to create a cozy feeling at home: a quiet dinner, an afternoon of reading, a family gathering or an autumn night. They do not require installation or special accessories, beyond the usual precautions when using candles. Aspects that can be improved ⚠️🍰 Sweet aromas that will not be for everyone. The selection is very focused on warm, spicy and baking fragrances. Those who prefer fresh, floral or more neutral aromas may find them somewhat intense or sweet.🏠 Best for medium or small rooms. Although the set is complete, the actual intensity of the aroma may vary depending on the size of the room. In very large spaces it may be less noticeable, especially if there is ventilation. They require the usual precautions. Like any candle, they should be used with caution, away from fabrics, drafts, children or pets. It is something obvious, but important in a product of this type. Final rating: ⭐⭐⭐⭐☆ (4.5 out of 5) 🕯️🍂This set of AOOVOO candles offers a very pleasant combination of autumn aromas, good presentation and generous duration. It stands out especially as a gift or as a decorative accessory for those who enjoy warm environments and sweet aromas. I don't give it five stars because the aromatic selection is quite specific and may be too sweet for some tastes. Even so, it is a highly recommended set for those looking for cozy, beautiful and easy-to-give candles."
    }
]

