        "review": "I absolutely love the Yankee Candle Balsam & Cedar 22oz Large Jar. The scent is the perfect blend of fresh-cut evergreen and warm cedarwood—it immediately makes the whole house feel like a cozy winter cabin, even when it’s not the holidays. It’s strong enough to fill larger rooms without being overwhelming, and the fragrance stays consistent from the first burn all the way through.The burn time is impressive as advertised. With up to 150 hours, this candle lasts a long time, making it a great value for the size. It burns evenly when properly trimmed, and I haven’t had issues with tunneling. The large jar also looks nice as part of home décor, which is a bonus.I’ve also found it to be a great gift option. The scent is universally appealing for anyone who enjoys woodsy, clean, seasonal fragrances, and the packaging feels high-quality and ready to give. Overall, it’s a reliable, long-lasting candle that brings a comforting, festive atmosphere to any space."
