[
    {
        "review": "Amazing choice, if youre looking for something super cute these work wonders ! Ive had them for months and they all still work just as bright as the first time I received them. Considering the price, its totally worth it ! The different flickering settings and timers allow for multiple uses without getting tired of the same looks. They are light and cheap material but they dont look that way at night !"
