    {
        "review": "I used these for my wedding day. They came well packaged. I didn't have any issues with them being broken or damaged. They lasted for several hours and added great ambiance to the tables."
    },
    {
        "review": "Pretty candles in an elegant glass pot. However, a third of the candles burn poorly, the wick sinks into the wax and this gives no light."
