[
    {
        "review": "These little LED lights are amazing! I was having an outdoor party at night. I placed them in white paper bags on walkways and in the woods. Super easy to use, just a little switch on the bottom.They looked amazing and bright. I didn’t bother to turn them off after the party. This morning I checked them and were still on. I wanted to see if they were on that night. Still on and bright, 30 hours running.Every light in the box of 100 worked. I going to buy them again for a summer party."
    },
    {
        "review": "The holidays are coming, and I love candlelight, but not the danger of fire.  I have been using these little tea lights from the discount department store that has the red bullseye, and they last a few days.  Since I have been trying to avoid being in stores (for many reasons), I ordered two different kinds of tea lights from Amazon.  The first box was smaller, and I have used those up, because they lasted no longer than any other tea lights.  But these tea lights?  Wow!  I put a couple of little glass votives with one light in each in the main floor bathroom over TWO WEEKS ago, and they are still flickering away.  They are not quite as bright as they were 2-3 weeks ago, but they are still bright enough.I set up a little forest scene on a shelf in my living room, and I have used tea lights to illuminate that; looks like little campfires in the \"snow\".  In the past, I was replacing those tea lights every 3rd or fourth day, which was a pain, because I would inevitable knock over a tree, which would sometimes end up taking out half the \"forest\".  But these little lights, which would have been dim by now (after 4 days), are still going strong, and I have not turned them off; too much trouble to fish them out from behind the trees!You will love these lights! They last forever, never get warm, and are pretty bright for tea lights.Amazon carries multiple brands of tea lights, and I just randomly picked this brand because of the price per light, and I got lucky, and you will be lucky, too, if you get these.I don't usually gush over a product, but these modest little lights are just great."
