[
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love these flameless candles! The clear glass design gives them a high-end, luxurious look, and the flickering flame looks surprisingly realistic, especially in the evening. They created the perfect ambiance for my birthday celebration and made the table feel warm and inviting without worrying about an open flame.The remote control is convenient, and the different candle heights make decorating effortless. They look beautiful both indoors and outdoors and are a great alternative to traditional candles. Highly recommend if you’re looking for elegant, safe, and realistic candles."
    },
    {
        "review": "I am absolutely in love with my Eywamage Glass Flameless Candles and feel compelled to share the magic they've brought into my home. So much so I have bought several sets so far.  These candles blend seamlessly into any decor, bringing a warm, inviting glow.The feature that stands out the most is the remote control with its timer function. You can choose between a 4-hour or 8-hour setting, and once set, these candles will automatically light up at the same time every day for the chosen duration. This ingenious feature allows me to create a consistently cozy ambiance every evening without lifting a finger. I can scatter them around the house, and as dusk falls, my home transforms into a beautifully candlelit haven. Time will tell how long the batteries will last but so far they are going strong for well over a month.The realism of these LED pillar candles is simply stunning. They flicker and glow just like real candles, but without any of the hazards. I can leave them unattended without worry, which is a huge plus for me. The grey glass design (my personal favorite) adds a sophisticated touch, making them versatile for any room or occasion.I recently purchased a new pair of glass cabinet bookcases, and these candles have found a perfect home there. When lit, they cast a soft, enchanting light, highlighting my books and decor beautifully. Their aesthetic appeal has turned my bookcases into a focal point in the room.These candles are a wonderful purchase for anyone looking to add a touch of elegance and convenience to their home. Their realistic flicker, easy-to-use remote, and the versatility of placement make them an obsession-worthy addition to any space. I keep finding new spots around my house to place them, and they never fail to enhance the beauty and warmth of each room. A glowing 5-star review for a product that deserves it! 🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟"
    },
    {
        "review": "I love the warm glow these lights produce and it truly makes the room look like it’s been lit by candlelight. One night the power went out and I put a couple candles in the hallway/stairs, and a family member warned me not to put candles on carpet. They couldn’t tell they were fake! I love these and will be buying more."
    },
    {
        "review": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐I recently purchased the Eywamage Grey Glass Flameless Candles with Remote, and I'm thrilled to provide them with a five-star review. These battery-operated flickering LED pillar candles, made with real wax and featuring a beautiful grey glass design, have exceeded my expectations. Here's why I highly recommend the Eywamage Grey Glass Flameless Candles:1. **Realistic Flickering Effect:** The flickering LED lights perfectly mimic the natural flicker of real candles. This realistic effect creates a warm and cozy ambiance, making these candles a perfect addition to any space.2. **High-Quality Craftsmanship:** The combination of real wax and the grey glass design showcases high-quality craftsmanship. The attention to detail in both materials and construction adds an elegant touch to the candles.3. **Multiple Sizes:** The set includes candles in three different sizes (Φ 3\" H 4\" 5\" 6\"), providing versatility in decorating and styling. The graduated sizes look beautiful when displayed together, adding dimension to the arrangement.4. **Convenient Remote Control:** The included remote control enhances the convenience of using these candles. It allows for easy operation, including turning the candles on/off and adjusting the brightness and flickering mode.5. **Battery Operated:** The use of batteries eliminates the need for cords or outlets, providing flexibility in placing the candles anywhere in the home. The long battery life ensures extended usage before needing replacements.6. **Safe and Flameless:** These flameless candles offer a safe alternative to traditional candles, especially in households with children or pets. The absence of an open flame reduces the risk of accidents while still providing a charming glow.7. **Versatile Decor:** The grey glass design adds a touch of sophistication, making these candles suitable for various decor styles. They work well in both contemporary and traditional settings, making them a versatile home accessory.8. **Ideal for Special Occasions:** Whether for a romantic dinner, a relaxing bath, or a special celebration, these candles create a beautiful and romantic atmosphere. The flickering light enhances the overall ambiance, making any occasion more memorable.In conclusion, the Eywamage Grey Glass Flameless Candles with Remote are a delightful addition to any home. Their realistic flickering effect, high-quality craftsmanship, and versatile design make them a standout choice for creating a warm and inviting atmosphere. I confidently give these candles a five-star rating and highly recommend them for anyone seeking a safe and elegant alternative to traditional candles."
    },
    {
        "review": "These are one of the more expensive flameless remote candle options, but the good news is, they look really nice when they're on and the quality seems good.  Knocked off a star because, while there is a timer function, it doesn't remember it once the timer shuts off (meaning you have to turn it on the next day if you want them on again), and there are only two options, 4 and 8 hours. Other products also have 2 and 6 hour options and remember to turn back on at the same time each day.Been using them for about 3 weeks now and they seem good on battery life. They do look fake when they're off, but turned on, on a shelf, they are very realistic. I like that the glass is nice and shiny and there is real wax in the pillars, adding to the realism. I would probably purchase these again."
    },
    {
        "review": "Really nice"
    },
    {
        "review": "I recently learned that candle fragrance is not great for our health but being a candle lover I had to try something so tried out these battery-powered candles, and I’m thoroughly impressed! These candles are a game-changer for creating a cozy atmosphere without the worry of an open flame. The LED technology replicates the flicker and glow of a real candle remarkably well, creating a warm ambiance in any room. They’re especially great in households with pets or children where safety is a priority.One of the best features is the convenience of not having to deal with soot or wax drippings. Plus, many come with remote controls and timers, adding to their convenience. The battery life is also impressive, lasting much longer than I anticipated.The only downside is that they lack the authentic scent and the crackling sound of a real candle. However, for safety and cleanliness, they are a superior choice. I highly recommend battery-powered candles for anyone looking to add a touch of warmth and serenity to their home without the hazards of traditional candles.Pros- Look and feel is like real candles- Remote- Timer is great to set and it lights up every day at fixed time for 4/6 hours and shuts down by itself so no more using remote control on daily basis.Cons- Not real so no fragrance- little overpriced"
