    },
    {
        "review": "I received the AOOVOO scented candle set with 4 candles for free as part of Amazon Vine and I am really impressed. As soon as you unpack it, the set makes a high-quality impression and the scents fit perfectly into the colder season. 😊The candles are ideal for cozy evenings on the sofa, for reading, for relaxing hours after work or simply as an atmospheric decoration. I particularly like this: 🕯️ 4 different scented candles in a set 🍂 Perfect autumn and winter scents 💎 Decorative crystals as a pretty extra ⏳ Long burning time 🏠 Ideal for the living room, bedroom or bathroom 🎁 Also very suitable as a gift 🌟 The scents in the Set includes: 🍎 Apple & Cinnamon - fruity and pleasant with apple and cinnamon 🎃 Pumpkin Spiced - classic autumn scent with a cozy pumpkin spice note 🌾 Golden Harvest - warm, autumnal feel-good scent 🌿 Clove & Cinnamon - spicy with a nice clove-cinnamon combination I particularly liked the two cinnamon variants as they immediately create a cozy atmosphere without being too intrusive.🏠 Cozy atmosphereThe candles create a pleasant atmosphere for:☕ Coffee or tea in the evening📖 Reading on the sofa🎬 Movie nights🛁 Relaxing baths🍂 Autumn and winter decorationThe scents spread pleasantly throughout the room and do not seem artificial or overly intense.ProcessingCleanly poured candles ✅Beautiful containers ✅Even burning ✅High-quality presentation ✅Decorative crystals as a nice eye-catcher ✅The entire set looks lovingly put together and of higher quality than I initially expected. Conclusion: The AOOVOO scented candle set impresses with atmospheric autumn and winter scents, a beautiful look and a pleasant scent intensity. Apple & Cinnamon, Pumpkin Spiced, Golden Harvest and Clove & Cinnamon in particular ensure a cozy, feel-good atmosphere."
    },
    {
        "review": "Among the many candles tested for the home, this autumn set turned out to be an incredible surprise. The fragrances (Spiced Pumpkin, Apple and Cinnamon, Wheat and Vanilla, Cloves) are crazy, among the best and most intense ever smelled: they fill the room in a very short time leaving an enveloping, natural and never cloying aroma. THE STRONG POINTS - Intense and persistent fragrance: Thanks to the soy wax and quality essential oils, the diffusion of the perfume is rapid and long-lasting. - Clean combustion: The wax vegetable and the cotton wick guarantee a uniform burn without black smoke, ensuring an excellent overall lifespan of the set.-Careful presentation: Elegant jars and well-made gift packaging, also perfect as a furnishing element for the autumn season.A SMALL CURIOUS NOTEThe only detail that makes you smile is the indication in the title that defines them as \"for women\": scented candles have no gender and these spicy and exotic notes are perfect for the home of anyone!CONCLUSIONProduct promoted with flying colors with 5 well-deserved stars. If you are looking for candles that really smell and create atmosphere in your home, this kit is an absolute must."
    },
    {
        "review": "This is so beautiful, has a long burn and smells like being in love. I couldn’t recommend it more highly as a gift idea"
    },
    {
        "review": "This set of fall candles is an enchantment for the senses! The AOOVOO candle set includes four divinely scented fall scents: Pumpkin Spice, Cinnamon-Apple, Wheat Vanilla, and Clove-Cinnamon. All contain vegetable oils, are non-toxic, clean and durable. They have been made with pure soy wax, and their wicks are lead-free cotton, so they are natural products. Each of the candles is rated to burn for 40 to 50 hours, which is very decent. Presented inside a cardboard box in elegant autumn colors, with a particularly pretty and delicate design on the top of the box, they are perfectly protected, housed in their polyurethane foam locations. The wax was poured into a brown smoked glass container and closed with a copper-toned lid. A delicate label adorns the glass wall, adding a certain charm to the whole. These candles will have their place in a bedroom, a living room, or even a work space such as an office. Their scents soothe tension and provide well-being and obvious satisfaction. These candles will naturally accompany the arrival, installation and end of the autumn season, one of the most beautiful seasons there is, and will enhance precious moments thanks to the 160 to 200 hours of pleasant fragrance that they promise. A different scent for every mood! I can only recommend these scented candles, each scent of which is a real discovery!"
    }
]

