    {
        "review": "I have had problems with other sunglasses from Amazon.(breaking easily, distorted views, blurred vision etc)I was suspicious of the FEIDSUNS because of the very low price.However i've been very pleasantly surprised. These sunglasses are well made and sturdy , very comfortable, perfectly clear , sufficiently dark to provide protection , but clear and light enough to drive and see as clearly as with no sunglasses. My wife says how good they look on me. I have strongly  recommended these glasses to friends and family."
