[
    {
        "review": "These sunglasses are awesome, especially for the price. They block glare really well, and I wear them every day. They are comfortable and durable; they feel strong without weighing down your face, which is great. They come in two pairs, which is a nice bonus. My only complaint is that you can't pick and choose which styles you get. I personally love the silver frame and wish I could just get two of those, but you're forced to choose two different styles. Small complaint but worth mentioning."
