    {
        "review": "​These KALIYADI sunglasses are fantastic! The classic semi-rimless frame design looks stylish on both men and women, giving off a timeless, premium look without the steep designer price tag.​The polarized lenses do a great job reducing glare and eye strain, making them perfect for driving, outdoor activities, or daily wear. They feel lightweight and comfortable on the face for long stretches without digging into your nose or ears. Getting two pairs at this price point is an incredible deal—you can keep one in the car and one in your bag. Highly recommended!"
