    {
        "review": "The polarized lenses make a noticeable difference, especially when driving or spending time outdoors. Glare is significantly reduced, and everything looks clearer and more comfortable in bright sunlight.The build quality is also much better than I expected for the price. They feel lightweight and comfortable while still feeling sturdy and well made. The classic design looks great, and having three different pairs is incredibly convenient—I can keep one in the car, one at home, and one for outdoor activities.The polarization and lens quality are the standout features for me. They give a crisp, clear view without the washed-out feeling I’ve experienced with cheaper sunglasses. They honestly look and feel like sunglasses that should cost considerably more.For the quality, comfort, and value you get, this is an easy 5-star purchase. Highly recommended!"
