[
    {
        "review": "I wasn't expecting much at this price, but these sunglasses turned out to be a great buy. They fit comfortably, feel lightweight, and the polarized lenses do a nice job cutting down glare when I'm driving or spending time outside.They look good, feel more expensive than they are, and came well packaged. Overall, I'm really happy with them."
