[
    {
        "review": "I've had these for a year now and came back and ordered three more pairs. I wear these daily because they are so comfortable and cute. A lot of sunglasses give me headaches- either they are too tight or too heavy, these never do. They don't catch in your hair if you put them on your head. They don't slide down your nose when you sweat or move your head. The black pair isn't matte black which I dislike it's more satin black. The beige tortoiseshell is the prettiest most flattering color ever. I'm a dark winter and I struggle to find cute sunglass colors that aren't black. So many sunglasses lean brown and warm toned; the beige tortoiseshell is a unique cool-toned color with a violet undertone and flattering for my cool and neutral toned gals. I have a pretty normal size head and these are just a hint of oversized but in a good way. I have an oval face that leans long oval or slight heart and these are seriously flattering. I have so many photos in them and they always look good from any angle. I love the thin metal arms. Just buy these- it's such a good buy and brand. I literally donated other pairs because I don't wear them anymore after discovering these. I bought obviously the beige tortoiseshell, black with gold, and the cherry. Cherry is also a cool toned cherry and the gradient brown lenses don't read too warm they really read more grey. I barely got the cherry and it's very beautiful and a unique sunglass color as well. Debating on the green pair too but worried it might be too yellow undertones. My only wish is more color options. I'd love more silver arm options. Thanks WMP for these!"
