        "review": "The glasses box arrived crushed and open. I was very sad that the sender was Amazon. There was no case in the box... I encountered it for the first time. It is surprising that even the glass cleaning cloth has a case but it is not for the glasses. However, the glasses are very good, the image is clear and you do not feel very light, you can use them for a long time. It seems a little small but I think it is not a problem. Don't be fooled by 3D glasses, I recommend them."
    },
    {
        "review": "I really didn't expect these to live up to the Maui Jim Marketing machine but I have to say that after a month of ownership I absolutely love them. Mostly I wear them when out cycling which is about 5 hours a week, they are beautifully light, surprisingly robust for plastic glasses and the colour intensity - particularly greens - is genuinely amazing. From a sports perspective they let very little light in around the edges, fit very snugly against my face (I have fairly normal features and my face is slightly narrower than average), and even at 30 mph there not much draft causing my eyes to water. Definitely buy again, definitely recommend."
