        "review": "These are very inexpensive, but excellent for the price.Vision through them is exceptionally clear with the brown polarized lenses. The degree of darkness is perfect, and the color is great.The frames are extremely light and comfortable and sturdy.The hinges are springy and firm, not floppy. They snap closed, and snap open. When they snap closed, the ends of the temple pieces cannot touch the lenses. So that potential source of scratching is avoided.Each pair comes in a cloth bag, AND has a little cloth to clean the lenses with. Nice extras.The only negative I can think of is the style. The lenses are a bit on the square side, covering more vertical area than I'd probably like. And the lenses don't wrap around my face as much as I'd like, failing to filter my peripheral vision at all. Still, the style isn't so bad that I'm embarrassed wearing them in public. Three pairs for $20 is a great price. I've stored two pairs for when the first pair breaks or wears out. I wonder how long that will take."
