    {
        "review": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ “These sunglasses made me look like I spent way more than I actually did!”I honestly wasn’t expecting to love these as much as I do, but they’ve become my go-to pair! They’re lightweight, comfortable enough to wear all day, and instantly elevate any outfit. The oversized style is super flattering, and they have that expensive designer look without the designer price tag.I wore them on vacation and got so many compliments. They stayed comfortable even after hours in the sun, and the lenses are dark enough to protect my eyes while still looking stylish in photos.Why I’m obsessed:🖤 Lightweight and comfortable☀️ Great sun protection✨ Expensive-looking design🏖️ Perfect for vacations, beach days, and everyday wear💰 Amazing quality for the priceIf you’re looking for designer vibes on an Amazon budget, these are a must-have. Don’t think twice—add them to your cart. You’ll be reaching for them every day! 😎"
