[
    {
        "review": "This set of three polarized sunglasses is a total steal. Each pair is stylish in its own way—classic, modern, and sporty—so I always have the perfect option whether I’m heading to the beach, running errands, or going for a hike. The designs are sleek and versatile, and they look way more expensive than they are.Functionally, they deliver. The polarization really cuts down glare, especially when driving or spending time near water. My eyes feel noticeably more relaxed, and the lenses offer crisp, clear vision without distortion. They’re lightweight but sturdy, and the fit is comfortable enough to wear all day without slipping or pinching.For the price, getting three high-quality pairs is unbeatable. It’s rare to find a bundle that nails both fashion and function, but this one does. If you want reliable eye protection with a side of style—and without breaking the bank—this set is a smart buy."
    },
    {
        "review": "The style and shape and colors look good on my face. The black ones have dark tint lenses, one of the brown ones has less dark tint lenses, and the other brown one has even lesser dark tinting. The darkest one will offer the most sun protection. I’m glad there are 3, the price was great so I’m not complaining, but we’ll see how long they last with the cheap plastic frames. They fit well, sit straight on my face, and are lightweight. I can’t account for durability or scratch resistant. For the price, I’m just not going to have high expectations to tick all the boxes, like quality. I really like how they look on me and that’s what’s most important to me, and uv protection. There is one cloth bag included to store one pair of sunglasses."
    },
    {
        "review": "Bought for my wife & she likes them a lot. I like their look on her too. Worth the price"
    },
    {
        "review": "These sunglasses are amazing! Amazing fit! Amazing look! Amazing lenses!! I think I am in love! 🥰 🤣"
    },
    {
        "review": "I wasn’t expecting to love these sunglasses as much as I do, but they’ve quickly become my go-to pair. As a busy mom, I wanted something stylish but also practical—and these totally deliver. They have that classic, retro look that feels really high-end, like something you’d find at a much higher price point.The polarized lenses make a big difference, especially when I’m driving, at the park, or chasing my kids around outside. Everything looks clearer and there’s way less glare, which is a huge plus for everyday use. They’re also lightweight and comfortable enough to wear for long periods without feeling tight or slipping off.I also appreciate how durable they feel. Between being tossed in a diaper bag and handled by little hands, they’ve held up really well so far.Overall, these sunglasses strike the perfect balance between fashion and function. They make me feel put-together even on busy mom days, and I’d definitely recommend them if you want that high-end look without the high-end price."
    },
    {
        "review": "These are very comfortable and provide good protection. They look pretty cool too, and are just the right size - not too big, not too small in frame size and lens size. Great price for 3 pairs - I lose and break sunglasses all the time, and I usually have to settle for pretty low quality sunglasses because I don't want to spend a lot on them, and I was pleasantly surprised at the quality and protection with these. I had a hard time picking from all the color options, and I got the pack with black, green, and blue lenses. I am happy with that choice. So far they have held up well, no scratches or concerns about them breaking. I can easily put them on top of my head when I don't need them on my eyes, and they do not get tangled in my hair or slide down all the time - another important plus."
