    {
        "review": "These JULI sports sunglasses have a great retro look that really stands out. I like that they have a sporty design while still looking stylish enough to wear casually. The rimless frame gives them a clean, unique appearance, and they’re lightweight and comfortable to wear.They’re a great option for running, golfing, fishing, or just spending time outdoors. Overall, if you’re looking for sports sunglasses with a cool retro style and a comfortable, lightweight fit, these are a great choice."
