    {
        "review": "These are great. Got four of them to have in each room, office, night stand, around the house and carry one when I travel. Light weight yet sturdy. Great height and angle for phones to see the screen well. Also has openings to run your charging cord. Great as gifts. Color is great too. Oh and they are adjustable to lean in different angles."
    },
    {
        "review": "I'm really impressed with this phone stand!  It's like a small piece of modern sculpture, but fully useful.  There is nothing flimsy about this stand; you can adjust the piece that holds the phone and it stays in whatever position you choose.  I'm truly happy with the stand and think it's a great value for what you are getting. A++++"
