    {
        "review": "My apologies for not offering a photo but I only have one phone. If I were to put that phone in the holder, well, I wouldn't be able to take a photo of it.So basically this does exactly what I wanted to do. I find myself doing more and more video calls with a doctor a nurse the hospital occasional lawyer for a state stuff pharmacy whatever it is and it's annoying to have to hold the phone while talking and some of these video calls can go one for 5 minutes to 30 minutes So it's quite liberating to be able to place the phone in the holder squeeze it and have the video call take place. And it's good the bottom is for you so I can also charge the same time if necessary. The weight seems to be sufficient it's quite good I'm not afraid of the phone falling over for example also the base is rather wide which helps. It's sort of a matted black color which I think helps blend in on my desk and doesn't stand out and it's not in use. I do wish it had a little bit of a holder to self support the bottom but I understand that they made it so you could turn it to the side if you wanted to do it in landscape mode but I would have liked to have a little extra piece to hold on the bottom I'm always afraid that things going to fall out and I don't want to over tighten it. I also would have made it maybe a quarter of an inch deeper because there's people like me who have a cell phone case and then I have a little cloth piece that is taped to the back of that which is like a wallet that has all my cards ATM card driver license health care card and I have to take all that stuff out when I put it in the holder because it just becomes too fat and really I think half an inch extra would have made it perfect. Unfortunately all the holders have the same issue which is why the one holder that actually makes a nice deep one that will fit all kinds of situations will be the one that will win most of the customers eventually. This one however is sufficient as long as I don't have too many things in my little wallet on the back of my phone case. Other than that it's very simple product and I'm giving it 4 out of 5 stars. One day that gripper will probably stop working as well and the phone may slip out maybe in a few years I don't know and that's another reason why having some sort of support on the bottom that I could at least attach would have been good to protect my phone from damage. So because there's a few minor things that they could have done to make this stand out and less generic I'm giving it four to five stars. But otherwise I'm keeping the product and I'm happy with it."
