        "review": "We just got this Guitar today.  We opened the box and were very impressed with the appearance!  This is a gift for our granddaughter and she loves purple.  This guitar is the perfect color with a beautiful gloss finish.  There are other colors a person can choose from. The guitar has wire strings which is what we were looking for. It comes with a strap, a cover, extra strings, pics, and tuner.  It sounds great and arrived in perfect condition.  We can't wait to give it to our granddaughter. This guitar was priced very reasonable, is very durable, and comes with materials that will help any beginner get started.  I would suggest that you purchase a solid case to protect this beautiful guitar."
