        "review": "This is a great little guitar, Sounds really nice and looks great . I'm glad I bought it."
    },
    {
        "review": "Sounds very nice and is an excellent guitar for the Price. Some of the hardware is a little cheap, and I have noticed that it pulls out of tune a little easier than my other guitars. Perfect for camping trips and teaching kids to play guitar without trying to get a little junior acoustic."
    },
