        "review": "This guitar looks great but the sounds is extremely rinky dink.  I was not expecting a fantastic sound from such a small guitar, but this has no sustain like it is made of cheap plastic.  I wanted to like it because its cool looking, but I just cannot get past cheap sound.  The strings stay in tune and the tuning heads look decent.  Other than for a kid of 8 to 12, this guitar is a no go."
