[
    {
        "review": "At 63, I decided to try and teach myself guitar to play in church. Got some lessons and a cheap $150 acoustic. It was difficult going. A friend suggested if I was serious, investing in a quality instrument would keep me from getting discouraged. My Ibanez AEG70L arrived today. I was amazed at the quality of craftsmanship. It is well made and beautiful. To my novice ear it sounds great and the ease of playability is wonderful. Tuned it up fresh out of the box, and was ready to go. Well worth the mild investment. I am enjoying lessons and practice time immensely now!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Beautiful guitar, beautiful sound. I was iffy getting a guitar from Amazon because I couldn't hold it and play it first but this is a good size, the wood on the neck feels really nice, and it has a beautiful sound"
