        "review": "This is a good guitar and would recommend it for a beginner / novice level player but you probably have that figured out if you are looking at this review ;-)"
    },
    {
        "review": "This is a beautiful guitar with a beautiful sound! This guitar is very easy to tune and does not require constant adjustments during use."
    },
    {
        "review": "Great little guitar! Sounds amazing! It rings like a much more expensive guitar. Very clear plugged in. No static.On-board tuner is a great feature."
    },
    {
        "review": "This guitar is beautiful instrument.  The action is really nice and the neck is super playable.  It is thinner so you do not get deep base tones, definitely on a bit on the \"tin\" side.  But the playability and built in preamp more than make up for it.  The built in tuner is really nice too.  When you turn on the tuner, it turns off the pickups.  A really nice guitar for gigs."
