[
    {
        "review": "This amp was everything the Spark 2 was not.Bluetooth works easily with NO APP required. Just press the bluetooth button and connect. It remembers bluetooth connections as it should so when on, no need to reconnect. Unlike the Spark 2 that would constantly lose bluetooth when scrolling around on the app. Also the bluetooth audio is MUCH more balanced. Spark 2 was so bass-heavy that it was basically unusable. Then my Spark 2 immediately died within the first week when its terribly designed power button jammed.For the Yamaha, I haven't needed to download any app at all. The physical settings are great and intuitive. Plug and play, sounds great, as it should be.Having tried two similar amps in this niche -- small amps that can double as bluetooth speakers in a pinch -- Spark 2 is vastly overrated. Even though Yamaha is twice the cost, it is well-worth it for an amp that actually works. Will update if anything changes."
    },
