        "review": "Beautiful quality, impeccable finish, our grandson was delighted to receive it under the tree"
    },
    {
        "review": "My husband is super happy with his guitar"
    },
    {
        "review": "Defective, waste of money and they didn't even refund me. I sent the guitar back but didn't receive a refund"
    },
    {
        "review": "Poor quality guitar does not tune and with only one mha belt attachment"
