        "review": "THANK YOU SELLER FOR SUCH EXCELLENT & ORIGINAL PRODUCT LIKE THIS!! This is my first ever Mixing Console! This product is easy to use but need also some knowledge how to use it. While waiting this product I've watched so many reviews and tutorials in Youtube. Over all i love this Yamaha MG10XU👌👏"
